14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":15,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott Went to the theatre in the evening. The bespeak of the Bachelors of North Shields for the benefit of Miss C Scsuton. A good house &pound;59.16/-. Play The Haunted Tower with Registers Officer &amp; High life below stairs, a very good company. Wind SSE. A heavy fall of snow, the latter part of the evening it thawed. Sea fallen</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":12,"lock":null}
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/12/16
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":16,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy unpleasant day &amp; the thaw continuing, excessively wet and sloppy Received a letter from Dixon stating the impossibility of his assisting me (Promises much easier made than kept). Wind W&amp;SW. Sea fallen &amp; ship &amp; sailed</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":13,"lock":null}
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/12/16
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":16,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy unpleasant day &amp; the thaw continuing, excessively wet and sloppy Received a letter from Dixon stating the impossibility of his assisting me (Promises much easier made than kept). Wind W&amp;SW. Sea fallen &amp; ship &amp; sailed</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":13,"lock":null}
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/13/17
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":17,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>After a blowy and rainy night, on rising this morning, found the snow nearly dissolved. Wind E to ESE &amp; very heavy sea upon the bar, a few ships arrived. Another disappointment! Received a letter from Sir D Smith stating the Dukes inability to comply with my request for a loan. Every person poor when you want assistance! Adversities the time for trying friendship, in prosperity you have professions enough. I've oft been told, but I have now ascertained it's a d-d selfish world we live in; every one for himself. &lsquo;tis almost a crime to be liberal &amp; kind hearted</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":14,"lock":null}
14:36:38.384 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.385 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/13/17
14:36:38.385 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":17,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>After a blowy and rainy night, on rising this morning, found the snow nearly dissolved. Wind E to ESE &amp; very heavy sea upon the bar, a few ships arrived. Another disappointment! Received a letter from Sir D Smith stating the Dukes inability to comply with my request for a loan. Every person poor when you want assistance! Adversities the time for trying friendship, in prosperity you have professions enough. I've oft been told, but I have now ascertained it's a d-d selfish world we live in; every one for himself. &lsquo;tis almost a crime to be liberal &amp; kind hearted</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":14,"lock":null}
14:36:38.385 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/14/18
14:36:38.385 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":18,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet unpleasant day &amp; a gale from the east, with a heavy sea on the bar, snow at heights. Dined with the associated clubs at the George Tavern. A very handsome dinner &amp; nearly two hundred sat down. Looked into the theatre in the evening</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":15,"lock":null}
