14:36:38.401 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/1/8/12
14:36:38.401 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":12,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; spent the evening at home. Wind &amp; weather the same as yesterday</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":9,"lock":null}
14:36:38.401 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
