14:36:38.412 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":313,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful autumnal day. Wind WSW. Drove Fanny, Bell &amp; Emma Galbraith down to Warkworth church. Called upon the <span class=highlight_yellow>Miss</span> Watsons. Saw the Chatterbucks etc. In the afternoon took a walk with Tom to the colliery. <span class=highlight_yellow>res</span> Matt Culley came to dinner at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":296,"lock":null}
