14:36:38.412 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/2/294
14:36:38.412 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":294,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still fine weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. Went down to the Hope, only to do 10 &frac12; cha today. Dined on board. Walked up &amp; went to Drury Lane Theatre to the pit at full price &amp; saw &quot;A cure for the heartache&quot; &amp; XYZ. Very much entertained.</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":278,"lock":null}
