14:36:38.421 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/10/5/297
14:36:38.421 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":297,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind South. Got underway from off _____ at 11 o'clock am with a fresh breeze, landed William at Gravesend. At 1 o'clock pm. At 4 o'clock passed through Shoe Hole 8 o'clock abreast of Harwich &amp; 10 o'clock off the Lowestoft Light &amp; turned in for the night. Blowing fresh.</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":281,"lock":null}
14:36:38.421 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
