14:36:38.424 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/10/335
14:36:38.424 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":335,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day. Very stormy with sleet &amp; hail. Wind in the morning NE &amp; changed to SE. On board the Hope. Tom &amp; Fanny Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith arrived from Togston.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":318,"lock":null}
