14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/11/336
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/11/336
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/12/337
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":337,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant &amp; raw cold day. Wind SSW. The Hope got all her coals today, but being thick weather and poor prospect, did not go to sea. Mrs Matthews &amp; Miss Liddell drank tea with us. Gave Stephenson &pound;8. To my astonishment a writ of arrest was opened against me by Bland, Dunn the tailor partners . Very unhandsome conduct as William had called upon him to settle the account before I left town.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":320,"lock":null}
14:36:38.425 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
