14:36:38.427 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/15/340
14:36:38.427 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":340,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather with rain. Wind SE. Mr Mark dined with me on board the Hope. No ships got to sea this day</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":323,"lock":null}
