14:36:38.428 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":342,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Wind NNW. A large fleet of small ships got to sea. The pilot refused to take charge of the Hope there being a heavy sea upon the bar. Dined at J Tinley with a small party.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":325,"lock":null}
14:36:38.428 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/18/343
14:36:38.428 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":343,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day with a little rain &amp; wind in the morning. NE afterwards changed to SE &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. The Hope still not able to get to sea. Dined at home. Attended the new whist club for the first time at J Tinleys. Won 20/-</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":326,"lock":null}
14:36:38.428 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
