14:36:38.429 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/19/344
14:36:38.429 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":344,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NW &amp; sea down. A very large fleet with the Hope sailed with a fine prospect. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Marks of the 5<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Dined at Mr Mayne. Met Captain Bunbury of the 80<sup>th</sup> Regiment. Mr Hopkins, Mr Mayne &amp; Mr Ferguson.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":327,"lock":null}
14:36:38.429 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
