14:36:38.429 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/2/327
14:36:38.429 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":327,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind NNW. Went to Warkworth Church in the morning. Called upon Mr &amp; Miss Watons. Drove Fanny &amp; Bell Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith in the afternoon. Robert Brown walked down from Brinkburn, dined &amp; stayed all night. Spent a jolly evening.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":310,"lock":null}
