14:36:38.432 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":348,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW &amp; cold. Went to church with Emma in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":331,"lock":null}
14:36:38.432 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/24/349
14:36:38.432 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":349,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day, but blowing hard from SSW. On board the Amity. Went over the water to see Mr P Laing respecting Che Harry's account, but did not see him, he being in London. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry. Received a letter from William.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":332,"lock":null}
14:36:38.432 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
