14:36:38.435 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/3/328
14:36:38.435 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":328,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind, but little in the morning at NW, afterwards changed to SE. Robert Brown left us for Brinkburn. Tom Smith drove him beyond Felton. Went out shooting but had no sport. Birds wild &amp; scent bad.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":311,"lock":null}
14:36:38.435 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/3/328
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":328,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind, but little in the morning at NW, afterwards changed to SE. Robert Brown left us for Brinkburn. Tom Smith drove him beyond Felton. Went out shooting but had no sport. Birds wild &amp; scent bad.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":311,"lock":null}
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/30/355
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":355,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy &amp; rainy morning with a gale of wind from ESE to E by N. &amp; high sea upon the bar. I went to church in the morning. A continuation of rain &amp; much heavier. Dined with J Tinley. Received a letter from William of the Hope's arrival. Old Mr Metcalf of Tynemouth died very suddenly this morning during church time.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":338,"lock":null}
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
