14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":355,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy &amp; rainy morning with a gale of wind from ESE to E by N. &amp; high sea upon the bar. I went to church in the morning. A continuation of rain &amp; much heavier. Dined with J Tinley. Received a letter from William of the Hope's arrival. Old Mr Metcalf of Tynemouth died very suddenly this morning during church time.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":338,"lock":null}
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/4/329
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":329,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; thick weather. Wind SE. Walked twice to the colliery. Miss M Watson came up &amp; dined at Togston. Played at whist in the evening</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":312,"lock":null}
14:36:38.436 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/4/329
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":329,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; thick weather. Wind SE. Walked twice to the colliery. Miss M Watson came up &amp; dined at Togston. Played at whist in the evening</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":312,"lock":null}
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/5/330
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":330,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 6 o'clock am. A fine morning. Wind at SE. Breakfasted &amp; rode to Morepeth with Tom Smith, market &amp; fair day there. Left Morpeth by the Shields coach &amp; got home at 4 o'clock. To dinner. Mrs Scott very well. The Hope arrived this afternoon &amp; fixed for Wellington to be loaded on Tuesday. Received a letter from William, the sale with balance now for &pound;73.18/-</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":313,"lock":null}
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/5/330
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":330,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 6 o'clock am. A fine morning. Wind at SE. Breakfasted &amp; rode to Morepeth with Tom Smith, market &amp; fair day there. Left Morpeth by the Shields coach &amp; got home at 4 o'clock. To dinner. Mrs Scott very well. The Hope arrived this afternoon &amp; fixed for Wellington to be loaded on Tuesday. Received a letter from William, the sale with balance now for &pound;73.18/-</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":313,"lock":null}
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/6/331
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
14:36:38.437 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
