14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":331,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. Wind about SSE. Called upon J Tinley. On board the Hope &amp; gave Mr Stephenson &pound;35 to pay wages. Dined with Mrs Scott &amp; in the evening at the whist club of which I've been elected a member.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":314,"lock":null}
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/7/332
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/7/332
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":332,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool day. Wind SSE blowing hard. A great many laden ships put back. Mr Mark &amp; Mr Ferguson dined on board the Hope with me. Hauled her upon the shore to get her ballast out &amp; look at her bottom. Took coffee with Ferguson .</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":315,"lock":null}
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/8/333
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
14:36:38.438 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
