14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/9/334
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/11/9/334
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/1/356
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":356,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Early this morning it blew a very heavy gale of wind from the NE &amp; ENE with showers of rain &amp; heavy sea. Towards afternoon the wind abated but continued from the east. Engaged in the office the principal part of the morning. Wrote to William. Dined at home. Mr Wheatley buried a son &amp; daughter Mr Gun today. They died of consumption.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":339,"lock":null}
14:36:38.439 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/1/356
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":356,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Early this morning it blew a very heavy gale of wind from the NE &amp; ENE with showers of rain &amp; heavy sea. Towards afternoon the wind abated but continued from the east. Engaged in the office the principal part of the morning. Wrote to William. Dined at home. Mr Wheatley buried a son &amp; daughter Mr Gun today. They died of consumption.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":339,"lock":null}
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/10/365
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":365,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but cold frosty day. Wind WNW. Went to Benton by the coach in the morning. Walked there from the turnpike &amp; afterwards onto Newcastle where I wrote to William to sell the Hope. Missed Dixons, walked out to Benton again to dinner. Mr Colonel Dixon staying there. Mr Allinson dined with us</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":348,"lock":null}
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/10/365
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":365,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but cold frosty day. Wind WNW. Went to Benton by the coach in the morning. Walked there from the turnpike &amp; afterwards onto Newcastle where I wrote to William to sell the Hope. Missed Dixons, walked out to Benton again to dinner. Mr Colonel Dixon staying there. Mr Allinson dined with us</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":348,"lock":null}
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/11/366
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":366,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a stormy day &amp; cold. Wind WNW. Walked into Newcastle with Dixon. A great day at Gosforth guns firing etc etc. Mr Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Bell married one the Miss Brandlengs. Returned to Benton to Dinner.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":349,"lock":null}
14:36:38.440 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.441 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/11/366
14:36:38.441 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":366,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a stormy day &amp; cold. Wind WNW. Walked into Newcastle with Dixon. A great day at Gosforth guns firing etc etc. Mr Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Bell married one the Miss Brandlengs. Returned to Benton to Dinner.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":349,"lock":null}
14:36:38.441 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/12/367
14:36:38.441 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":367,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild day. Wind WNN. Out greyhound coursing. Ran 8 or 9 hares &amp; killed none. The dogs out of wind not having had any exercise lately. But had some pretty running.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":350,"lock":null}
14:36:38.441 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/12/367
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":367,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild day. Wind WNN. Out greyhound coursing. Ran 8 or 9 hares &amp; killed none. The dogs out of wind not having had any exercise lately. But had some pretty running.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":350,"lock":null}
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/13/368
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":368,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly fine mild. More like summer than December. Walked with Dixon to Newcastle. Spent the morning there, took the steamer boat &amp; got to Shields at 3 o'clock. Dined with J Tinley in the evening at Mr Harry's. Then whist club. At night the wind got round to the east.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":351,"lock":null}
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/13/368
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":368,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly fine mild. More like summer than December. Walked with Dixon to Newcastle. Spent the morning there, took the steamer boat &amp; got to Shields at 3 o'clock. Dined with J Tinley in the evening at Mr Harry's. Then whist club. At night the wind got round to the east.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":351,"lock":null}
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/14/369
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":369,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy day &amp; unpleasant day. Wind about S by E. At church in the morning. Tinley, Mr Brereton of Liverpool &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at Tinley's. Met Mr Brereton &amp; a Mr Smith of Oporto.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":352,"lock":null}
14:36:38.442 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/14/369
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":369,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy day &amp; unpleasant day. Wind about S by E. At church in the morning. Tinley, Mr Brereton of Liverpool &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined at Tinley's. Met Mr Brereton &amp; a Mr Smith of Oporto.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":352,"lock":null}
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/15/370
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":370,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day but dry. Wind about S. Received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 34/6, a miserable price = 8/6 freight. After laying a fortnight at London. Dined at home. Wind changed to about SW in the evening.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":353,"lock":null}
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/15/370
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":370,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull day but dry. Wind about S. Received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 34/6, a miserable price = 8/6 freight. After laying a fortnight at London. Dined at home. Wind changed to about SW in the evening.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":353,"lock":null}
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/16/371
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":371,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S &amp; SW. Went at Williams request to look for Baxter Arthur of the amety, but he had gone to sea. Called upon J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Carr &amp; gave him William's letter to pay me the balance of the Hope's freight account. Dinned at home. Wrote to William. Payed into Chapmans &pound;15 rents on account of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":354,"lock":null}
14:36:38.443 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/16/371
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":371,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S &amp; SW. Went at Williams request to look for Baxter Arthur of the amety, but he had gone to sea. Called upon J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Carr &amp; gave him William's letter to pay me the balance of the Hope's freight account. Dinned at home. Wrote to William. Payed into Chapmans &pound;15 rents on account of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":354,"lock":null}
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/17/372
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":372,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A little rain in the morning. Wind W &amp; SW. A pleasant afternoon. Dined on board the Combatant, Captain Barnes. A ship of the Tinleys, an agreeable party consisting of J Tinley, A Harry, Mr Boswell, Captain Webb, W Barnes, Mr Richardson &amp; self, went to the play at &frac12; price to pass an hour but returned home at 10 o'clock at which hour Mrs Scott had made up her mind I should be in. Her conduct towards me so pointed &amp; bad that I have determined to go to lodgings as I neither have nor do I wish to give her any annoyance at the same time. I don't choose to submit to it myself, for it seems her temper &amp; disposition neither to be happy &amp; comfortable herself or to let others be so.</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":355,"lock":null}
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
