14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/18/373
14:36:38.444 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":373,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":717,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":356,"lock":null}
