14:36:38.447 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/22/377
14:36:38.447 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":377,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet day. Wind about W or W by S. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it ordering by W Taylors desire the Morning Journal &amp; Morning Herald newspapers. At 5 guineas for the Newsroom. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":360,"lock":null}
14:36:38.447 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
