14:36:38.451 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/29/384
14:36:38.451 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":384,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine weather day. Excessively cold. Wind SW. Engaged in the morning drawing &amp; on board ship. Dined at home. Took wine with Mark Cunningham &amp; Boswick at the Albion</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":367,"lock":null}
