14:36:38.451 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/3/358
14:36:38.451 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":358,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day and wind about W by N. Walked to Tynemouth called at Tibbs upon Mr Ildeston who returned to Shields with me. Dined at home &amp; in the evening met Mr Ildeston at Mr Baskers to take wine. Mr Mark there.</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":341,"lock":null}
