14:36:38.455 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/12/8/363
14:36:38.455 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":363,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant winters morning. Wind NNW which changed in the afternoon to about WSW. Got &pound;5 from the bank for own use. Dined with J Tinley. Went to the theatre at <span class=highlight_yellow>the Prince</span>. Mrs Metcalf of Tynemouth buried today</p>","pageId":716,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":346,"lock":null}
