14:36:38.458 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":48,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly cold weather &amp; frosty. Wind variable between SE &amp; SSW. Dined at home &amp; at a party at Mrs Recds in evening. Sent to William their promissory notes at 12.18 &amp; 24 months to Messrs Lees for &pound;400, 400 &amp; 450 dated  11 feb 1828</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":45,"lock":null}
14:36:38.458 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/14/49
14:36:38.458 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":49,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A tremendously heavy storm &amp; fall of snow all day &amp; wind SE. Mr Smith &amp; Fanny unexpectedly arrived some busy body having sent a &quot;message&quot; to Togston in my name, that Mrs Scott was not expected to live more than two or three days. Dined at home &amp; at whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":46,"lock":null}
