14:36:38.461 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/2/19/54
14:36:38.461 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":54,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind WSW but changed to SSW towards the evening. Got the Hope upon the blocks &amp; the flat up to light water mark caulked. Condemned the main mast. Dined at home</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":51,"lock":null}
