14:36:38.487 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":108,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild day. Wind WSW. Master R Jldesters and I dined on board the Hope &amp; spent the afternoon</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":103,"lock":null}
14:36:38.487 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/4/12/109
14:36:38.487 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":109,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Received a most distressing letter from Mr Vernon Rector of Carlow of the poor Bafer being very ill of a typhous fever. I therefore have determined to set off for carlow in the morning from South Shields at 5 o'clock by Pelot Leeds coach</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":104,"lock":null}
14:36:38.487 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
