14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":109,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Received a most distressing letter from Mr Vernon Rector of Carlow of the poor Bafer being very ill of a typhous fever. I therefore have determined to set off for carlow in the morning from South Shields at 5 o'clock by Pelot Leeds coach</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":104,"lock":null}
14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/4/13/110
14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":110,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain last night during the day showers &amp; in the evening it came down in torrents. Wind variable from SS to NW. Not able to leave for Carlow, this morning being  Sunday, coach doesn't run, but shall start in the morning. Dined at home. At church in the morning.</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":105,"lock":null}
14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
