14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":110,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain last night during the day showers &amp; in the evening it came down in torrents. Wind variable from SS to NW. Not able to leave for Carlow, this morning being  Sunday, coach doesn't run, but shall start in the morning. Dined at home. At church in the morning.</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":105,"lock":null}
14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/4/14/111
14:36:38.488 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":111,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning at 3 o'clock &amp; left South Shields at &frac12; past 4 o'clock coach for Carlow. A fine day, arrived at Leeds at 6 o'clock where I stay all night</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":106,"lock":null}
