14:36:38.496 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":125,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of the same sort of weather with the cool wind. Engaged all the morning with Mr Turner in examining &amp; entering rents. In the afternoon Mr Vernon &amp; I took a walk along the Kilkenny Road, returned home to drefs &amp; took a family dinner with Mr W<sup>en</sup> Fishburn who was exceedingly kind, but yet I should have preferred dining quietly at Mr Vernon's. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":115,"lock":null}
