14:36:38.505 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":145,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day engaged all the morning in preparing for the sale. Dined quietly at home, wrote to A Fitzmaurice</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":135,"lock":null}
14:36:38.505 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/13/146
14:36:38.505 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":146,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful and hot summers day. Received two letters from Mrs &amp; Miss Scott. The sale commenced &amp; good prices said to be obtained. Mr Vernon with his unreal kindness &amp; consideration asked a party to dine with us consisting of the two Careys, E Butler, Fishebourne, O'Connor &amp; Captain Ballesby. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":136,"lock":null}
14:36:38.505 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.506 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/13/146
14:36:38.506 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":146,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful and hot summers day. Received two letters from Mrs &amp; Miss Scott. The sale commenced &amp; good prices said to be obtained. Mr Vernon with his unreal kindness &amp; consideration asked a party to dine with us consisting of the two Careys, E Butler, Fishebourne, O'Connor &amp; Captain Ballesby. Spent a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":136,"lock":null}
14:36:38.506 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/14/147
14:36:38.506 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":147,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. The sale still going on. Wrote to Mr I Robert about a chain cable for the Hope. Dined early. John &amp; I took a long walk to fish but had no sport</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":137,"lock":null}
14:36:38.506 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
