14:36:38.515 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/4/137
14:36:38.515 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":137,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold wind NW. Went to church in the morning &amp; heard a very good discourse from Mr Vernon. Wrote a letter to Mrs Scott. Dined at the Mr Careys &amp; spent an extremely pleasant day. Present Mr Vernon, Captain Warren (65<sup>th</sup> regiment), 2 Careys, Ed Butler &amp; Mr Ballerely. Came into wine</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":127,"lock":null}
14:36:38.515 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
