14:36:38.515 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/5/138
14:36:38.515 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":138,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a cool NW wind. The cattle fair at Carlow, town was crowded. Got the last trunk nearly packed with books, plates etc. Dined at Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":128,"lock":null}
