14:36:38.516 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/5/6/139
14:36:38.516 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":139,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind WSW &amp; heavy showers of rain. Engaged part of the morning packing. Took a long walk with Mr Vernon &amp; returned to dinner</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":129,"lock":null}
