14:36:38.518 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/11/175
14:36:38.518 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":175,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. Attended at Mr Stocks again &amp; Mr Carmichael. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":165,"lock":null}
14:36:38.518 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
