14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":166,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy day with heavy showers of rain. Had some conversation with Mr Walker. Determined upon going to Dublin to administer to the amount of sale of furniture only &amp; take out letters of guardianship. Received from Mr Cleer &pound;1.11 for whisky &amp; malting. Dined at home Finished my letter to William &amp; put it into the post. Ordered a car to be with me at 7 o'clock in the morning if fine to go to Athy to see Mr Pope</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":156,"lock":null}
14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/20/184
14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":184,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day. Not particularly engaged. Received a letter from William &amp; answered it. Dinned at College Hotel</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":174,"lock":null}
14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
