14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/21/185
14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":185,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Heavy rain towards afternoon with thunder. Took walk with the boys &amp; got wet through. Dined at Cossays</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":175,"lock":null}
14:36:38.523 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
