14:36:38.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":168,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet day. Quite a deluge of rain. Confined to the house all the morning by the wet. Engaged in covrtey for wrote a letter to Mr Buther of Athy. Asking to whom he pays rent for the tanyard. Dined at home with Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":158,"lock":null}
14:36:38.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/5/169
14:36:38.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":169,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet day. Heavy showers Dined with Mr Vernon, the two Careys dined with us &amp; Mr Moor. Spent a pleasant day. Agreed to let the house to Mr Dugan at &pound;35 a year when appointed guard<font color=#BFBFBF>ian</font></p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":159,"lock":null}
14:36:38.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
