14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":169,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet day. Heavy showers Dined with Mr Vernon, the two Careys dined with us &amp; Mr Moor. Spent a pleasant day. Agreed to let the house to Mr Dugan at &pound;35 a year when appointed guard<font color=#BFBFBF>ian</font></p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":159,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/6/170
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":170,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Left Carlow for Dublin to take over letters of guardianship. A showery day. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":160,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/6/170
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":170,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Left Carlow for Dublin to take over letters of guardianship. A showery day. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":160,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/7/171
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":171,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The first thing in the morning called upon Mr Carmichael but being engaged made an appointment with for 1 o'clock. Walked down to see the guard returned at the castle. Much to my surprise, met captain <span class=highlight_yellow>flu </span><span class=highlight_yellow>ie</span> Butler. At 1 o'clock saw Mr C<font color=#BFBFBF>armichael</font> &amp; then went to Mr Stocks the Proctor who filled up a form for the children to sign that they are willing. I should administer (in my opinion very inconsistent), sent it off by post to Mr Vernon. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":161,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/7/171
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":171,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The first thing in the morning called upon Mr Carmichael but being engaged made an appointment with for 1 o'clock. Walked down to see the guard returned at the castle. Much to my surprise, met captain <span class=highlight_yellow>flu </span><span class=highlight_yellow>ie</span> Butler. At 1 o'clock saw Mr C<font color=#BFBFBF>armichael</font> &amp; then went to Mr Stocks the Proctor who filled up a form for the children to sign that they are willing. I should administer (in my opinion very inconsistent), sent it off by post to Mr Vernon. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":161,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/8/172
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":172,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went to see the guard relieved &amp; afterwards attended morning service at the castle chapel. The interior very beautiful &amp; chaunting good. Called upon Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry</span>. Walked out &amp; afterwards dined with Him</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":162,"lock":null}
14:36:38.530 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/8/172
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":172,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went to see the guard relieved &amp; afterwards attended morning service at the castle chapel. The interior very beautiful &amp; chaunting good. Called upon Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry</span>. Walked out &amp; afterwards dined with Him</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":162,"lock":null}
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/9/173
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/6/9/173
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/1/195
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":195,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day after a fall of rain during the night. Bathed in the Barrow. Attended the examination of the boys at Mr Jameson's &amp; dined there Took a long walk with Mr Vernon in the evening Paid Montgomery Chemist &pound;1.2.4</p>","pageId":701,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":185,"lock":null}
14:36:38.531 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
