14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":195,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day after a fall of rain during the night. Bathed in the Barrow. Attended the examination of the boys at Mr Jameson's &amp; dined there Took a long walk with Mr Vernon in the evening Paid Montgomery Chemist &pound;1.2.4</p>","pageId":701,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":185,"lock":null}
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/10/204
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":204,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Left Carlow at 9 o'clock for Dublin with Emma who bore the fatigues of the journey well. Took her to Mrs Balskams in Grafton Street to sleep. Dined by myself at Mackens</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":194,"lock":null}
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/10/204
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":204,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Left Carlow at 9 o'clock for Dublin with Emma who bore the fatigues of the journey well. Took her to Mrs Balskams in Grafton Street to sleep. Dined by myself at Mackens</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":194,"lock":null}
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/11/205
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":205,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. After breakfast, called &amp; saw Emma &amp; took her to see her friends, the Bagots in Peter Street who requested she should spend the day with them. Called upon Mr Carmichael &amp; got the leases. Dined with Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry &amp; brought Emma home in the evening. Sent the leases by Mr Gale to Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":195,"lock":null}
14:36:38.532 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/11/205
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":205,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. After breakfast, called &amp; saw Emma &amp; took her to see her friends, the Bagots in Peter Street who requested she should spend the day with them. Called upon Mr Carmichael &amp; got the leases. Dined with Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry &amp; brought Emma home in the evening. Sent the leases by Mr Gale to Mr Vernon</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":195,"lock":null}
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/12/206
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":206,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfast with Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry. Hired a car &amp; took Emma to Kingstown. Left Luggage on board the St George steam boat &amp; afterwards dined at Greshams Hotel Left Kingstown at 7 o'clock with a great many passengers on board</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":196,"lock":null}
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/12/206
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":206,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfast with Char<font color=#BFBFBF>les</font> Hurry. Hired a car &amp; took Emma to Kingstown. Left Luggage on board the St George steam boat &amp; afterwards dined at Greshams Hotel Left Kingstown at 7 o'clock with a great many passengers on board</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":196,"lock":null}
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/13/207
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":207,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It began very early in the morning to rain &amp; blow hard &amp; it increased to a heavy gale. Nearly all on board sick. Obliged about 12 o'clock to lay to not being able to see land or make the floating light. The weather so thick. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock made the light &amp; got into Liverpool at 3 o'clock after a very stormy passage across of 20 hours and landed very wet. Got Emma to bed, much exhausted from the fatigues &amp; sickness. We stopped at the Angel Inn</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":197,"lock":null}
14:36:38.533 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/13/207
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":207,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It began very early in the morning to rain &amp; blow hard &amp; it increased to a heavy gale. Nearly all on board sick. Obliged about 12 o'clock to lay to not being able to see land or make the floating light. The weather so thick. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock made the light &amp; got into Liverpool at 3 o'clock after a very stormy passage across of 20 hours and landed very wet. Got Emma to bed, much exhausted from the fatigues &amp; sickness. We stopped at the Angel Inn</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":197,"lock":null}
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/14/208
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":208,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A deluge of rain which continued all day. Left Liverpool for Leeds at 5 o'clock where we arrived about 6 o'clock. Poor Emma much annoyed by an eruption on the skin with great heat &amp; itching like the nettle rash from the heat &amp; sickness on board the steam boat. Took tea &amp; slept at Greaves</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":198,"lock":null}
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/14/208
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":208,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A deluge of rain which continued all day. Left Liverpool for Leeds at 5 o'clock where we arrived about 6 o'clock. Poor Emma much annoyed by an eruption on the skin with great heat &amp; itching like the nettle rash from the heat &amp; sickness on board the steam boat. Took tea &amp; slept at Greaves</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":198,"lock":null}
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/15/209
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":209,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather  cloudy in the morning, but turned out a fine day. Left Leeds at 6 o'clock for Shields where we arrived at 8 o'clock &amp; got home at 9 o'clock. Poor Emma tormented by the eruption. Dr Grunhow saw her &amp; sent some physic. Mrs Scott from home at Togston. Got some tea &amp; went to bed early</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":199,"lock":null}
14:36:38.534 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
