14:36:38.535 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/16/210
14:36:38.535 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":210,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Emma a great deal better. Engaged all morning writing to Mrs Falkener, Mr Verrnon &amp; Miss Scott. Dined with I Tindley</p>","pageId":703,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":200,"lock":null}
