14:36:38.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/8/202
14:36:38.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":202,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day after a little rain in the morning. Emma arrived from Broomville &amp; much better than I could have expected. Engaged with Mr Turner settling his accounts. Paid Haughton &pound;9.12.6 Byrm Chymist &pound;9.18. Mrs Connolly &pound;7.4.6 Dined with Mr Vernon. Drank tea with Mrs Falkener</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":192,"lock":null}
14:36:38.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
