14:36:38.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/7/9/203
14:36:38.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":203,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Engaged during the morning in paying bills etc. paid Davies &pound;14.5 Sally bal wages &pound;13.17.7 &amp; left with Mr Vernon a bill at 1 mo<font color=#BFBFBF>nth</font>: WBS for the balance of his account &pound;56.9/-. Wrote to Mrs Scott of my intention to leave Carlow tomorrow. Dined with Mr Vernon &amp; took tea with Mrs Falkiner</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":193,"lock":null}
