14:36:38.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":228,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold cloudy morning. Wind about NNW. Went to Newcastle &amp; agreed to take 10/- freight. It turned out a very wet day. Dined with J Tinley. Ship went to the spout. Gave Stephenson &pound;40</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":217,"lock":null}
14:36:38.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/20/247
14:36:38.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":247,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SSW Went into the city by a Paddington stage. A few fresh ships up. Could not sell the Hope. Bob March, Mr Vincent, William &amp; I went down by water &amp; dined on board.  In the evening at English Opera House</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":235,"lock":null}
