14:36:38.558 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":256,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning, wind NE. Cleared up towards 12 o'clock &amp; turned out a delightful day. Rebecca Captain &amp; Mr Lewis, F Barclay, Bob Marsh, William &amp; I went in a sailing boat to Portsmouth to see the Victory &amp; much pleased with our trip. The wind being  against us, we were obliged to land &amp; walk about two miles to Gosport. Returned to Navarino at &frac12; past 7 o'clock to dinner</p>","pageId":707,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":244,"lock":null}
14:36:38.558 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/3/229
