14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/5/231
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":231,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE Called &amp; paid Spence &amp; Foster for the main mast &pound;20.13/-. Walked to Tynemouth. A heavy thunder shower in the afternoon. Dined with Mrs Scott</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":220,"lock":null}
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/5/231
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":231,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE Called &amp; paid Spence &amp; Foster for the main mast &pound;20.13/-. Walked to Tynemouth. A heavy thunder shower in the afternoon. Dined with Mrs Scott</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":220,"lock":null}
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/8/6/232
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":232,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind SE Engaged in the office with Robert. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; took a warm bath. Dined with Mrs Scott. Walked in the evening to Carr's Wall Spout The Hope got under it in the morning &amp; to come off at night with 13 or 14 Keels. The remainder to follow</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":221,"lock":null}
14:36:38.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
