14:36:38.563 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":232,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind SE Engaged in the office with Robert. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; took a warm bath. Dined with Mrs Scott. Walked in the evening to Carr's Wall Spout The Hope got under it in the morning &amp; to come off at night with 13 or 14 Keels. The remainder to follow</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":221,"lock":null}
