14:36:38.565 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":263,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind still from the NE. F Barclay, WBS &amp; I bathed &amp; after breakfast started for Newport where after passing through a pretty country, we arrived about 2 o'clock, stopping to see Carisbrooke Castle on the way. After lunch continued our journey to East Cows, where we dined. <del>For</del> Previously crossing the water to see West Cowes &amp; in the evening, after a most delightful tour &amp; favored with most beautiful weather. We all returned safe to Navarino House much pleased &amp; satisfied. Expenses of the tour &pound;3.10.</p>","pageId":707,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":247,"lock":null}
14:36:38.565 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/10/272
14:36:38.565 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":272,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly wet day. Wind E in the morning &amp; afterwards changed to SW blowing fresh. Walked about the town and pier.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":256,"lock":null}
14:36:38.565 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
