14:36:38.566 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/12/274
14:36:38.566 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":274,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning &amp; blowing hard from the SE. Walked into town after breakfast &amp; played at billiards in the afternoon. Turned out fine. Attended the theatre. Mrs Hugh Barclays bespeak, a fair house.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":258,"lock":null}
