14:36:38.569 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/17/279
14:36:38.569 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":279,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind ESE. We amused ourselves in the morning making a large kite for the boys &amp; in the afternoon walked on the pier. Received from William by George Lee two &pound;5 notes with a letter from Stephenson of the arrival of the Hope at Shields after an 8 day passage on for journey</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":263,"lock":null}
