14:36:38.572 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":284,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine warm day. Wind SW with a few light showers in the morning. Bob Marshes &amp; I had a most delightful bath after breakfast. The Brocklebank steamer arrived from Brighton on an excursion of pleasure loaded with passengers between 2 &amp; 3 rd, principally trades people in appearance. Lots of vulgarity, pipes &amp; &quot;heavy wet&quot;. Played a few games of billiards.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":268,"lock":null}
14:36:38.572 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/23/285
14:36:38.572 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":285,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW. Remained in the house until after lunch. In the afternoon strolled about the town. Went to a Quadrille party at the library in the evening. Very well attended &amp; good company. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":269,"lock":null}
