14:36:38.572 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":286,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most extraordinary fine weather, with wind SW. Strolled about the pier &amp; town</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":270,"lock":null}
14:36:38.572 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
