14:36:38.575 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":291,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW. Went into the city by a Paddington Stage. Saw William. Attended the market &amp; afterwards went down the river and dined on board the Hope. Walked home in the evening on our way drinking tea with <span class=highlight_yellow>Oliphant</span> at Cockspur Street.</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":275,"lock":null}
14:36:38.575 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/3/265
14:36:38.575 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":265,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still delightful weather. Wind variable between NE &amp; NW but returned to the old quarter NE in the afternoon again. Strolled about the town &amp; pier all day. Dined at Navarino</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":249,"lock":null}
