14:36:38.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/5/267
14:36:38.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":267,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind SE. Sea quite calm. Captain &amp; Mrs Lewis, Bob Marsh &amp; I took a boat &amp; amused ourselves four hours fishing. Great success having caught 89 what they call whiting <span class=highlight_yellow>pacets</span>, a small fish. Took a walk on the pier after dressing &amp; dined at Navarino. The two young Wainwrights dined with us</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":251,"lock":null}
