14:36:38.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/6/268
14:36:38.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":268,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still fine weather. Wind variable between SE &amp; N. Spent the morning Lewis Marsh &amp; I in taking a walk to St John's towards St Helens &amp; home in the afternoon. On the pier blowing very fresh. The Samarary frigate sailed &amp; an Indiaman brought up off Ryde</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":252,"lock":null}
