14:36:38.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1828/9/7/269
14:36:38.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":269,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind ESE. Attended divine services in the morning. The afternoon walked on the pier. Never was at such a dull place on a Sunday. Scarcely a soul to be seen.</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":253,"lock":null}
