14:36:38.587 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/24/411
14:36:38.587 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":411,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost &amp; snow &amp; a gale of wind from SE to SSE. Went to Newcastle to endeavour to get something for the Hope, but did not succeed. People not willing to do anything until after the meeting of coal owners. Dined with J Tinley, a party, Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Morins</span> &amp; 2 Lieutenants  of the <span class=highlight_yellow>childers</span>, C <span class=highlight_yellow>Milners</span> &amp; sister Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Atlen</span> Lieutenants 80<sup>th</sup> Regiment</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":393,"lock":null}
