14:36:38.588 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":414,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw with heavy rain. Much of the snow disappeared. Wind SSE. Went to Newcastle but no freights or anything offering. The <span class=highlight_yellow>fuller</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>obsheiate</span>.  On my return found Mr Watson of Walkworth here. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. <span class=highlight_yellow>Miss</span> Nicholas, Miss Allen and Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Moorers</span> there.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":396,"lock":null}
14:36:38.588 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
