14:36:38.589 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":415,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A unpleasant day. Rainy &amp; very wet &amp; dirty walking. Wind NE in the morning which changed to NW. Dined &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":397,"lock":null}
14:36:38.589 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/29/416
14:36:38.589 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":416,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind ENE. Mr Watson left us for Newcastle. Went up to Newcastle to attend the annual meeting of the Hope Club. No material alterations made in the rules. Took Mr Boswell up to dine with me. Returned in the evening &amp; attended the whist club. Reduced my <span class=highlight_yellow>investment</span> in the Hope Club to &pound;500. With <span class=highlight_yellow>Ana</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Gallop</span> for the first time.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":398,"lock":null}
