14:36:38.589 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/1/3/390
14:36:38.589 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":390,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. On board the Hope. People engaged smoking her. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at the Craiges. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Geo</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Sl</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ops</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>apple</span> the balance of his wages 18/3 &amp; advances him 3 weeks lodging money &amp; 10/9 cash. Tom Wright junior married today to his grace of Felling.</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":372,"lock":null}
