14:36:38.601 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":726,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":13,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having been a good deal of rain during the night. Wind about SSW. We breakfasted with Mr G Greenwell at ____, a party there to hunt. Went out with the harriers, but I did not follow them having a fair commanding view from the top of the hill. They had a plenty of running &amp; found a great many hares, but being several plantations they made their escape into them. Turned out very well. We all returned &amp; dined at Lanchester at C Lumley's public house. Sat down nine to dinner. In the evening played whist, A very stormy night. A deluge of rain. Continued playing until 3 o'clock in the morning in the hope it would clear up, instead of which, the rain was so heavy that the river overflowed its banks &amp; covered the green so that we were compelled to remain all night.</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":681,"lock":null}
14:36:38.601 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/14/727
14:36:38.601 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":727,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet <font color=#BFBFBF>day</font>. Still raining, very heavy. Wind I think NNW. Walked to Burnhopeside to breakfast. <span class=highlight_yellow>Bressed</span> &amp; Joe <span class=highlight_yellow>Reshar</span>, Allen Hutchinson &amp; I went with Mr Potts, who came for us in his carriage to Mr Whites at Woodlands where we dined &amp; spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day &amp; after supper returned to Burnhopeside. <span class=highlight_yellow>Kit</span> &amp; Miss R stayed all night at Mr Whites</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":682,"lock":null}
14:36:38.601 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
