14:36:38.603 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/18/731
14:36:38.603 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":731,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning, quite like a summer's day. Mrs Richmond &amp; Loo went to church. Kit &amp; I took a ride to Durham &amp; got back to dinner at 3 o'clock. <span class=highlight_yellow>Nicholas</span> Greenwell &amp; Reverend Thompson dined with us.</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":686,"lock":null}
