14:36:38.605 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/23/736
14:36:38.605 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":736,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull misty morning. Wind NW &amp; N by W</p>\r\n<p><font color=#CC9368>Accepted balances bill at 4 </font><font color=#CC9368><span class=highlight_yellow>months</span></font><font color=#CC9368> for the </font><font color=#CC9368><span class=highlight_yellow>Mesa</span></font><font color=#CC9368> at premium &pound;20-2.6 due 20</font><sup><font color=#CC9368>th</font></sup><font color=#CC9368> Jan</font></p>\r\n<p>Went to South Shields &amp; paid Rids &amp; Oliver their dividend upon G <span class=highlight_yellow>Morrisons</span> estate. Dined at house. Wrote &amp; enclosed a soverign to Mrs Scott Crathorn. H Harry &amp; I drank wine together at the Commercial &amp; afterwards eat some oysters at Janes</p>","pageId":780,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":691,"lock":null}
