14:36:38.606 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/24/737
14:36:38.606 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":737,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind WNW. Towards afternoon it got round to SSE. Several ships got to sea. The lady Jane arrived from Greenland with 9 fish. Called at MisJarre &amp; saw Emma. Also upon <span class=highlight_yellow>M &amp; </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ino</span> Matthews. Dined at home. Mrs Scott not quite so well today. Took a walk in the evening with A. S__k_s <font color=#BFBFBF>(Ann Stokes) </font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font></p>","pageId":780,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":692,"lock":null}
