14:36:38.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":744,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; milder weather. Wind WNW. Engaged the principle part of the morning in drawing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening eat some oysters at <span class=highlight_yellow>Marks</span> &amp; afterwards attended  the whist club.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":698,"lock":null}
14:36:38.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/3/713
14:36:38.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":713,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning after a rainy night. Wind NW. Wrote a letter to Stephenson to meet him at Elsineur which I gave to H French to put on board some vessel at Hull bound to the Baltic. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. J Tinley returned from Liverpool, called in the evening &amp; took a cup of coffee with him. Met Ann at &frac12; past 7 o'clock</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":671,"lock":null}
14:36:38.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.610 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/3/713
14:36:38.610 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":713,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning after a rainy night. Wind NW. Wrote a letter to Stephenson to meet him at Elsineur which I gave to H French to put on board some vessel at Hull bound to the Baltic. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. J Tinley returned from Liverpool, called in the evening &amp; took a cup of coffee with him. Met Ann at &frac12; past 7 o'clock</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":671,"lock":null}
14:36:38.610 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/30/745
14:36:38.610 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":745,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind WNW. Again engaged the morning in drawing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry &amp; I went to the Commercial &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>punished</span> two bottles of port. His treat having heard of the safe arrival of the Choice at Hull from <span class=highlight_yellow>Wybarz</span> making the voyage in two months. In the evening at Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Lays</span> at Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; played a rubber.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":699,"lock":null}
14:36:38.610 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
