14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":715,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having had rain during the night. Wind W by N <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp; cots</span>. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening with Ann. Took supper &amp; a glass of punch with Allen</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":673,"lock":null}
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/6/716
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":716,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW by N. Walked with Mark to the New Quay &amp; afterwards with Mrs Tinley up Preston Lane. Dined at J Tinley. He treated us with turtle soup, spent a pleasant day. Present the vicar, William &amp; H Metcalf, J Fenwick, J Dale &amp; myself</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":674,"lock":null}
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/6/716
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":716,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW by N. Walked with Mark to the New Quay &amp; afterwards with Mrs Tinley up Preston Lane. Dined at J Tinley. He treated us with turtle soup, spent a pleasant day. Present the vicar, William &amp; H Metcalf, J Fenwick, J Dale &amp; myself</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":674,"lock":null}
14:36:38.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/7/717
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":717,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, cool. Wind NW. Dined at home. Walked with captain Webb to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Miss Marr's &amp; saw Emma G. At night blew hard with heavy rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":675,"lock":null}
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/7/717
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":717,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, cool. Wind NW. Dined at home. Walked with captain Webb to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Miss Marr's &amp; saw Emma G. At night blew hard with heavy rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":675,"lock":null}
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/8/718
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":718,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning. Exceptional wet &amp; heavy sleet showers. Wind about N. Got breakfast early &amp; took the steam boat to Newcastle &amp; at 10 o'clock got into the Express coach &amp; went to Durham. When we arrived a little after 12 o'clock Richmond had sent his man and gig for me but by some mistake the man supposing I had not come, returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>Burn</span><span class=highlight_yellow>hopeside</span> without me at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. I therefor started &amp; walked out to dinner.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":676,"lock":null}
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/8/718
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":718,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning. Exceptional wet &amp; heavy sleet showers. Wind about N. Got breakfast early &amp; took the steam boat to Newcastle &amp; at 10 o'clock got into the Express coach &amp; went to Durham. When we arrived a little after 12 o'clock Richmond had sent his man and gig for me but by some mistake the man supposing I had not come, returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>Burn</span><span class=highlight_yellow>hopeside</span> without me at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. I therefor started &amp; walked out to dinner.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":676,"lock":null}
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/9/719
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":719,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day &amp; frosty. Richardson &amp; I out shooting all the morning. The birds very wild &amp; we only got two braces. <span class=highlight_yellow>Kit</span> rode a pony, not being able to walk much. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jo</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span> out this morning exercising the hounds, preparing to begin the season tomorrow.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":677,"lock":null}
14:36:38.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/10/9/719
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":719,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day &amp; frosty. Richardson &amp; I out shooting all the morning. The birds very wild &amp; we only got two braces. <span class=highlight_yellow>Kit</span> rode a pony, not being able to walk much. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jo</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span> out this morning exercising the hounds, preparing to begin the season tomorrow.</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":677,"lock":null}
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/1/747
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":747,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Rather frosty. Wind NNW. The sea still continues heavy upon the bar. Attended morning services.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS &amp; another from Captain Stephenson dated <span class=highlight_yellow>aneruel</span> 17<sup>th</sup> Oct &amp; expecting to sail next day. London on the 15<sup>th</sup> drawn upon Chapmans for expenses &pound;93.4/- which I consider heavy.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home at 2 o'clock &amp; afterwards took a walk to Tynemouth with H Harry. Mrs Scott not so well. Indeed the Dr considering her getting considerably worse. The disease having extended to the armpits.</p>\r\n<p>At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":701,"lock":null}
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/1/747
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":747,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Rather frosty. Wind NNW. The sea still continues heavy upon the bar. Attended morning services.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS &amp; another from Captain Stephenson dated <span class=highlight_yellow>aneruel</span> 17<sup>th</sup> Oct &amp; expecting to sail next day. London on the 15<sup>th</sup> drawn upon Chapmans for expenses &pound;93.4/- which I consider heavy.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home at 2 o'clock &amp; afterwards took a walk to Tynemouth with H Harry. Mrs Scott not so well. Indeed the Dr considering her getting considerably worse. The disease having extended to the armpits.</p>\r\n<p>At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":701,"lock":null}
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/10/755
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":755,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind SW &amp; blowing fresh. Walked out. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Emma came from school for a few days. Spent the evening at home</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":709,"lock":null}
14:36:38.614 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
