14:36:38.615 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":755,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind SW &amp; blowing fresh. Walked out. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Emma came from school for a few days. Spent the evening at home</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":709,"lock":null}
14:36:38.615 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/11/756
14:36:38.615 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":756,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from WBS. No account yet of the Hope's arrival. At the billiard room all the morning. Dined at home at 4 o'clock &amp; spent the evening in the house. Paid Mrs Stephenson  mom o &pound;4 carpenter &pound;2.5/- &amp; cook &pound;1.10/-</p>","pageId":782,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":710,"lock":null}
14:36:38.615 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
