14:36:38.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":765,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine frosty morning. Wind about West. An idle day with me. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Boswell &amp; I spent the evening with Allen.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":719,"lock":null}
14:36:38.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/21/766
14:36:38.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":766,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind NW by N. Received a letter from WBS with a bank post bill for &pound;50. Went to church.</p>\r\n<p>The wind suddenly changed to NE blowing very hard with heavy showers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Boswell came in &amp; took wine with me. Wrote to WBS. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":720,"lock":null}
