14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":768,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing very hard all night from ESE &amp; still continues nearly the same about E by S with a heavy sea upon the bar but clear weather &amp; exceedingly cold. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went on board the Choice &amp; had some punch with H Harry. The wind increased to a heavy gale. Drank tea with Miss Harry &amp; spent the evening with mark</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":722,"lock":null}
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/25/769
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":769,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy morning &amp; a heavy gale of wind at E by N with sleet showers &amp; been so all night. Increased <font color=#BFBFBF>to </font>a perfect hurricane with a most tremendous sea. Dined at home. H Harry, H Nicolson, Boswell &amp; I had some punch at the Commercial.</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":723,"lock":null}
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
