14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/26/770
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":770,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather more moderate &amp; sea much fallen. Wind SE. Dined at home. Had some punch on board the Unanimity with H Nicholson. Attended the card club &amp; had some oysters in the evening with H Harry at Jane Moors.</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":724,"lock":null}
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
