14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/11/27/771
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":771,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Thick weather. Wind NW. Drew &pound;5 out of Chapmans. Dined at home. H Harry, Boswell, Nicholson &amp; I took grog together at the Commercial &amp; afterwards went to the theatre</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":725,"lock":null}
14:36:38.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
