14:36:38.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":774,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind SW. Received a letter from William. Dined with H Harry on board the Choice. A pleasant party.</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":728,"lock":null}
