14:36:38.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/12/786
14:36:38.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":786,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather &amp; wind  SW. Been blowing a gale all night. On board the Hope. At &frac12; past 12 o'clock went by steam to Newcastle. Met Dixon there &amp; walked with him out to Benton to dine &amp; stay all night.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":740,"lock":null}
