14:36:38.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/14/788
14:36:38.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":788,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning. Wind SW. On board the Hope. H Harry with me. Examined her stern inside &amp; all appeared sound &amp; good. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":742,"lock":null}
