14:36:38.634 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/12/21/795
14:36:38.634 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":795,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick frost morning. Wind SW by W. Paid the washerwoman for a quarter washing &pound;1.11.6. On board the Hope. The carpenter busy fixing the new hook at the stern. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening at home.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":749,"lock":null}
