14:36:38.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/1/419
14:36:38.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":419,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day. Wind W by N. A large fleet of colliers went to sea. Attended church in the morning. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum. A French, Boswell &amp; Nicolson. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jane</span> Muston</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":401,"lock":null}
14:36:38.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
