14:36:38.650 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":440,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind E by N. About 10 o'clock am it began to rain very heavy &amp; continued all the morning. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":422,"lock":null}
