14:36:38.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/27/445
14:36:38.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":445,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind SSW. Dined at home. In the evening attended a large party at Mr J Fenwicks, Preston Villa, about 120 there, a dinner.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":427,"lock":null}
