14:36:38.653 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":445,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind SSW. Dined at home. In the evening attended a large party at Mr J Fenwicks, Preston Villa, about 120 there, a dinner.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":427,"lock":null}
14:36:38.653 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/2/28/446
14:36:38.653 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":446,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold foggy morning. Wind SW. Drove up to Newcastle with Mr Tinley, called upon Mrs Dixon, went to the Quay side, but could not do anything for the Hope. Returned to Shields by steam boat. Dined with J Tinley &amp; went to the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":428,"lock":null}
