14:36:38.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":463,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SW &amp; cold. Another large fleet coming in. Borrowed off Robert &pound;5. On board the Hope. Two keels alongside. People engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>lending</span> sails. Walked up to the spout/<span class=highlight_yellow>huroonaschs</span> &amp; took lunch on board the 3 Brothers with A French, H Harry, Allen, W Harrison, J Wright there. Dined with J Tinley a party &amp; in the evening went to the ball which was thinly attended but a very pleasant one.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":445,"lock":null}
14:36:38.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/18/464
14:36:38.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":464,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind SW. Paid E Reed's mother &pound;1.8.9 being &frac14; years wages. On board the Hope. Got 9 keels in. paid Fenwick for making main stagsail &amp; foretopmast <span class=highlight_yellow>sturing</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ail</span> &pound;2.9/-. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":446,"lock":null}
14:36:38.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/18/464
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":464,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind SW. Paid E Reed's mother &pound;1.8.9 being &frac14; years wages. On board the Hope. Got 9 keels in. paid Fenwick for making main stagsail &amp; foretopmast <span class=highlight_yellow>sturing</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ail</span> &pound;2.9/-. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":446,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/19/465
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":465,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Showers of rain &amp; blowing fresh from SSW. Attended a meeting of the parishioners at the church respecting the burial ground at Tynemouth. The board of ordinance having given orders that no more interments shall take place. A most arbitrary &amp; unjust proceeding &amp; which the parish considers they have no right to do, it having been the parish church &amp; ground for time immemorial. Dined with Mr Allen &amp; afterward went on board the Hope. Got six more keels on board today. In the evening at the whist club. Paid Geo Slops &pound;1.13/- the balance of years wages account.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":447,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/19/465
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":465,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Showers of rain &amp; blowing fresh from SSW. Attended a meeting of the parishioners at the church respecting the burial ground at Tynemouth. The board of ordinance having given orders that no more interments shall take place. A most arbitrary &amp; unjust proceeding &amp; which the parish considers they have no right to do, it having been the parish church &amp; ground for time immemorial. Dined with Mr Allen &amp; afterward went on board the Hope. Got six more keels on board today. In the evening at the whist club. Paid Geo Slops &pound;1.13/- the balance of years wages account.</p>","pageId":727,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":447,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/2/448
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":448,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SE &amp; E by S. Went to Newcastle by steam. Could do nothing for the Hope. Walked up to Westgate Street &amp; the billiard rooms. Returned to Shields to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":430,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/2/448
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":448,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SE &amp; E by S. Went to Newcastle by steam. Could do nothing for the Hope. Walked up to Westgate Street &amp; the billiard rooms. Returned to Shields to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":430,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/20/466
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":466,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SW. Mr Mark &amp; Ferguson dined with me on board the Hope at 1 o'clock. Got the last keel down in the morning at 3 o'clock pm <span class=highlight_yellow>move</span> ship out but having a foul anchor could not get to sea. Much damage done but on the middle sand &amp; much <span class=highlight_yellow>stove</span>. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":448,"lock":null}
14:36:38.662 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/20/466
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":466,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SW. Mr Mark &amp; Ferguson dined with me on board the Hope at 1 o'clock. Got the last keel down in the morning at 3 o'clock pm <span class=highlight_yellow>move</span> ship out but having a foul anchor could not get to sea. Much damage done but on the middle sand &amp; much <span class=highlight_yellow>stove</span>. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":448,"lock":null}
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/21/467
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":467,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. The Hope got to sea early. Wind NW. Paid Foy boat 13/- Went with Mr &amp; Mrs Tinley to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;176.7.7 The <span class=highlight_yellow>Dmans</span> refused to change less than 21/- to upheld &amp; have I <span class=highlight_yellow>conceded</span> treated me <span class=highlight_yellow>exceptional</span> ill. Dined &amp; stayed all night with D Dixon. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":449,"lock":null}
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/21/467
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":467,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. The Hope got to sea early. Wind NW. Paid Foy boat 13/- Went with Mr &amp; Mrs Tinley to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;176.7.7 The <span class=highlight_yellow>Dmans</span> refused to change less than 21/- to upheld &amp; have I <span class=highlight_yellow>conceded</span> treated me <span class=highlight_yellow>exceptional</span> ill. Dined &amp; stayed all night with D Dixon. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":449,"lock":null}
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/22/468
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":468,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Rather frosty &amp; wind SSE &amp; SE. Came down to Shields by steamer &amp; changed my cloths. Received a letter from William with one to J Tinley. Returned by steam to Newcastle &amp; again dined and stayed all night with D Dixon. Mrs Coll Dixon dined with us</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":450,"lock":null}
14:36:38.663 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.664 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/22/468
14:36:38.664 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":468,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Rather frosty &amp; wind SSE &amp; SE. Came down to Shields by steamer &amp; changed my cloths. Received a letter from William with one to J Tinley. Returned by steam to Newcastle &amp; again dined and stayed all night with D Dixon. Mrs Coll Dixon dined with us</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":450,"lock":null}
14:36:38.664 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/23/469
14:36:38.664 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":469,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp &amp; unpleasant cold morning, blowing fresh  from the SE. Some loaded ships put back. Gave J Tinley, William's letter. My cold so much worse today &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>allofother</span> so unwell that I was obliged to lay up &amp; take physic.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":451,"lock":null}
14:36:38.664 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
