14:36:38.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/27/473
14:36:38.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":473,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSE. At the Mulstrum in the morning. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":455,"lock":null}
14:36:38.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
