14:36:38.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/28/474
14:36:38.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":474,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold &amp; frosty. Wind SSE. Dined at home. Took grog on board the Brodwick. R Peach. Drank tea &amp; attended the whist club at H Harry's<u> </u></p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":456,"lock":null}
