14:36:38.669 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/3/31/477
14:36:38.669 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":477,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning &amp; cool. Wind NE with showers of snow towards the middle of the day. Jackson &amp; I returned from Sunderland. Dined at Mr Matthews, a party.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":459,"lock":null}
14:36:38.669 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
