14:36:38.671 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":455,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. Brought some beef <span class=highlight_yellow>6.0.6 at 4 o'clock</span>. Dined at Mr Allen's &amp; suppered in the evening at the George with a party. An Oyster supper. Kept it up very late. Paid &pound;1.4/- entrance for Friday C Club. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":437,"lock":null}
14:36:38.671 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/1/478
14:36:38.671 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":478,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold winter's morning. Wind NE having been a good deal of snow during the night. Wind changed to NW with heavy showers of hail &amp; snow during the day&amp; night. Dined at home. In the evening at a party at Mr Mathews</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":460,"lock":null}
