14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":488,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair morning. Wind WNW. About 11 o'clock began to rain. Drew &pound;40 out of Chapmans to pay wages &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>hadesmens</span> bells for the Hope. Mr Mark <span class=highlight_yellow>sit </span>took our dinner on board. Wind got to ESE again. Attended the whist club at R Pearts. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":470,"lock":null}
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/12/489
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":489,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SSE. Received a letter from William <span class=highlight_yellow>weth</span> the Hope. Balance note $40.11/- &amp; &pound;50 lent = &pound;90.11. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley. Mr &amp; Mrs Carr &amp; Jane Kelsoe there.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":471,"lock":null}
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
