14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":489,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SSE. Received a letter from William <span class=highlight_yellow>weth</span> the Hope. Balance note $40.11/- &amp; &pound;50 lent = &pound;90.11. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley. Mr &amp; Mrs Carr &amp; Jane Kelsoe there.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":471,"lock":null}
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/13/490
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":490,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind blowing fresh from SW &amp; W. Several ships sailed for America but no loaded vessels got out. A heavy sea being upon the bar. Moved the Hope from the crane to a tees in South Shields. The river on the north side being so crowded Dined at home. Joined a party on board the Harmony. <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr</span> Peark in the evening. With Bell Jarvis. Paid into Chapmans. The bill for &pound;90.10/-</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":472,"lock":null}
14:36:38.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/13/490
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":490,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind blowing fresh from SW &amp; W. Several ships sailed for America but no loaded vessels got out. A heavy sea being upon the bar. Moved the Hope from the crane to a tees in South Shields. The river on the north side being so crowded Dined at home. Joined a party on board the Harmony. <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr</span> Peark in the evening. With Bell Jarvis. Paid into Chapmans. The bill for &pound;90.10/-</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":472,"lock":null}
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/14/491
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":491,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SW. On board of ship Mr Allen &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Mary</span> &amp; Bell Jarvis. Danced on board with me. Drew a draft for self for &pound;15 &amp; paid into the account of Exors &pound;20. Paid Mr Lough an <span class=highlight_yellow>average</span> for Hope Club &pound;19.2.1. In the evening the wind changed to SSE blowing hard all night with rain.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":473,"lock":null}
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/14/491
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":491,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; blowing fresh from the SW. On board of ship Mr Allen &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Mary</span> &amp; Bell Jarvis. Danced on board with me. Drew a draft for self for &pound;15 &amp; paid into the account of Exors &pound;20. Paid Mr Lough an <span class=highlight_yellow>average</span> for Hope Club &pound;19.2.1. In the evening the wind changed to SSE blowing hard all night with rain.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":473,"lock":null}
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/15/492
14:36:38.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":492,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This morning dry weather but <span class=highlight_yellow>still</span> blowing hard all night &amp; still continuing from SSE &amp; S by E. The Hope moved down to a tier below the library to load up. Dined at home. Wrote the secretary of the Hope Club to reduce the value of the Hope to &pound;1600.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":474,"lock":null}
