14:36:38.678 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":497,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind about N by E. Turned out a most beautiful &amp; warm day &amp; favourable for Tynemouth Races. Immense number of people out. Dined at home</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":479,"lock":null}
