14:36:38.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":499,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning with a dry easterly wind. Walked down to Shields. Dined at homer &amp; afterwards went to Tynemouth races, very few people there &amp; not worth going to. Drank tea with Mr Tibbs. With Bell Jarvis in the evening</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":481,"lock":null}
14:36:38.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/23/500
14:36:38.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":500,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another cold morning. Wind easterly. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley. In the evening called upon Mr J Young &amp; had a long conversation both with him about taking our dividend without surveying. Also he did not seem so determined in his opposition. He desired me to see H Dale &amp; talk to him.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":482,"lock":null}
14:36:38.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
