14:36:38.681 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":505,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning &amp; blowing fresh from the N &amp; W by N and increased to a very heavy gale of wind varying between NNW and NNE which brought on a tremendous sea, a small sloop in coming in got upon the Heard Sand. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":487,"lock":null}
14:36:38.681 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/29/506
14:36:38.681 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":506,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The gale has continued all night with showers of snow with a tremendous sea. Wind continues the same as yesterday. The gales abated towards evening. Dined at home. In the evening with Bell Jarvis</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":488,"lock":null}
14:36:38.681 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
