14:36:38.682 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":506,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The gale has continued all night with showers of snow with a tremendous sea. Wind continues the same as yesterday. The gales abated towards evening. Dined at home. In the evening with Bell Jarvis</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":488,"lock":null}
14:36:38.682 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/3/480
14:36:38.682 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":480,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A clear frosty morning. Wind NW. received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 38/6  8/3 for <span class=highlight_yellow>Town by</span> = to <span class=highlight_yellow>7</span> freight <span class=highlight_yellow>eneserable</span> work. Dined at home. Slept all night with Bell Jervis at her sisters.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":462,"lock":null}
14:36:38.682 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
