14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":480,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A clear frosty morning. Wind NW. received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 38/6  8/3 for <span class=highlight_yellow>Town by</span> = to <span class=highlight_yellow>7</span> freight <span class=highlight_yellow>eneserable</span> work. Dined at home. Slept all night with Bell Jervis at her sisters.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":462,"lock":null}
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/30/507
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":507,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; again calm Weather. Wind NW by N. Went to Newcastle by steamer to dine with Mr R <span class=highlight_yellow>Arsey</span> in Eldon Square. Spent a very pleasant day &amp; returned to Shields. In the evening took Mr Dacres <font color=#BFBFBF>&amp;</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font><span class=highlight_yellow>RA</span> with me. Tom Smith &amp; his mother arrived at Dockwray Square today.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":489,"lock":null}
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/30/507
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":507,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; again calm Weather. Wind NW by N. Went to Newcastle by steamer to dine with Mr R <span class=highlight_yellow>Arsey</span> in Eldon Square. Spent a very pleasant day &amp; returned to Shields. In the evening took Mr Dacres <font color=#BFBFBF>&amp;</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font><span class=highlight_yellow>RA</span> with me. Tom Smith &amp; his mother arrived at Dockwray Square today.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":489,"lock":null}
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/4/481
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":481,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind WNW. Got home to breakfast after sleeping with Bell Jarvis. The wind in the afternoon changed to SE. Several ships sailed for America &amp; the Baltic. The XYZ <span class=highlight_yellow>Ld</span><span class=highlight_yellow> the soles run</span>.  Dined with J Tinley, Ian Carr married to Sam Barton &amp; got home this morning attended the whist club at H Dales.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":463,"lock":null}
14:36:38.683 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.684 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/4/481
14:36:38.684 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":481,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind WNW. Got home to breakfast after sleeping with Bell Jarvis. The wind in the afternoon changed to SE. Several ships sailed for America &amp; the Baltic. The XYZ <span class=highlight_yellow>Ld</span><span class=highlight_yellow> the soles run</span>.  Dined with J Tinley, Ian Carr married to Sam Barton &amp; got home this morning attended the whist club at H Dales.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":463,"lock":null}
14:36:38.684 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/4/5/482
14:36:38.684 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":482,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning wind SSE. Turned out very wet. Wrote to William. Wind changed in the afternoon to SE. Found myself very queer this morning in consequence of late hours &amp; last night at the Dales. Stayed in the house all day. In the evening at the newsroom &amp; called at the Mulstrum &amp; gave Bennett a <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span>.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":464,"lock":null}
14:36:38.684 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
