14:36:38.686 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":486,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by E &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Bowies Brittania arrived in the harbour this morning without the Captain Mr W Bowie on board. Supposed to have jumped out of the cabin window when off the bar. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon joined me &amp; returned home in the evening.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":468,"lock":null}
