14:36:38.688 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/5/12/519
14:36:38.688 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":519,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NE. Paid into Chapmans &pound;27 the balance of sales &amp; our ship Hope for &pound;69.5/-. Went to Newcastle again &amp; fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>Gamlington</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Walls</span> at 9/6 freight by spout clear of brokerage &amp; the freighters to pay two keel dues should she not load up. Dined on board the Choice with H Harry &amp; A French. Wrote to William. The Hope <span class=highlight_yellow>dis lorry is</span> to go past him to <span class=highlight_yellow>millis</span><span class=highlight_yellow> &amp; </span><span class=highlight_yellow>roth</span></p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":501,"lock":null}
