14:36:38.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":521,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind W by N. Changed to SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Gave the fitter the Hope's monthly bill. Called upon J Hodgson &amp; returned to dinner. In the evening a little rain.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":503,"lock":null}
14:36:38.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/5/15/522
14:36:38.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":522,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fine spring weather. Wind NE. Mr Mark, Mr Sadler &amp; I walked up to Cramlington Spout. Found the Hope hauling off &amp; she shortly after proceeded down the river having only taken in 14 keels. Dined with Mr Sadler. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":504,"lock":null}
14:36:38.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
