14:36:38.690 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/5/17/524
14:36:38.690 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":524,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SE. The Hope was loaded on Friday but we could not go to sea in consequence of Young business. Determined not to sail until the morning tide. Walked to Tynemouth with H Harry. Took a warm bath. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Mr Dadler took wine with me. Wrote to William of my intention to sail ...</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":506,"lock":null}
14:36:38.690 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
