14:36:38.699 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":512,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning with showers. Wind SSW. Several light ships arrived. Tom &amp; Mrs Smith left us this morning for Benton. Dined at home. Accepted a bill at 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>months</span> dated 16 April for polices &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Insurance</span> 1 &amp; 2 coal voyages in general Premium Club &pound;13.7.10. With Bell Jervis in the evening</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":494,"lock":null}
14:36:38.699 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/5/6/513
14:36:38.699 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":513,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Called upon &amp; spent an hour with Fergusson the artist. Dined at home. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth with Fergusson to sketch the ruins. In the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Davies</span> Rooms at the Castle</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":495,"lock":null}
