14:36:38.717 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":577,"version":2,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>... occurred today worthy of note. Since the morning we have had most delightful weather, with a few refreshing breeze at SW &amp; SW by W. Our course NE &frac12; E &amp; going 4 7 5 knots. At 9 o'clock Bob &amp; I finished two glasses of gin &amp; water &amp; at 10 o'clock turned in.</p>","pageId":745,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":553,"lock":null}
