14:36:38.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":549,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; a fresh breeze from NW. Walked into the city with William. Got a new hat at Olipharts. Called for Bob Marsh &amp; we afterwards went by water to the Hope. Walked home to dinner</p>","pageId":737,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":527,"lock":null}
14:36:38.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/6/7/550
14:36:38.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":550,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, but weather cooler. Wind NE. I went to the Roman Catholic Chapel in Warwick Street &amp; much pleased with the ringing. Went to the park, met Bob Marsh &amp; proceeded to Kensington Gardens. A great crowd of fashionable company there &amp; many beautiful women. Dined at Mr Lees.</p>","pageId":737,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":528,"lock":null}
