14:36:38.730 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2315,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>... took a walk in the summer gardens of the Palace. On our return had a glass of grog with Mr Lindsey &amp; got to bed at 12 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>Got admission into the premises where they are building the new Isaac Church &amp; now engaged in erecting the granite pillars for the Portico &amp; they use of an immense size most beautifully polished. The finest &amp; longest in the world, brought from the quarries in Finland, their circumference about 30 feet &amp; height upwards of 50 &amp; although they weight ___ tons, they raise them in 20 minutes</p>","pageId":755,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2255,"lock":null}
