14:36:38.737 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/7/17/618
14:36:38.737 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":618,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning, but by the time we had breakfast, it had cleared up. Paid our account for lodgings etc &amp; got on board the steam boat at 9 o'clock &amp; proceeded to Cronstad, where we ...</p>","pageId":758,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":582,"lock":null}
