14:36:38.742 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2318,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... humour to go on shore. Obliged to go to bed. The pain &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>opium</span> making me exceptionally drowsy. Bought some flannel &amp; hartshorn in the evening which I put upon my face when I went to bed</p>","pageId":760,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2258,"lock":null}
