14:36:38.742 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":625,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still wind bound, blowing fresh from the SW. Suffered a great deal of pain during the night from my tooth &amp; my face swollen to a giant size. Could with difficulty eat. In no ...</p>","pageId":760,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":589,"lock":null}
