14:36:38.744 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/7/25/628
14:36:38.744 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":628,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... packet from Mr Dye, a present for Emma Galbraith. Mr L took a glass of grog with us &amp; we afterwards accompanied him on board. The Chase, captain Thompson arrived today in 13 days from Hull, and had supper.</p>","pageId":761,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":592,"lock":null}
14:36:38.744 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
