14:36:38.755 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2313,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":6.0000,"text":"<p>... the <span class=highlight_yellow>Pete</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rs</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ho</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ff</span> Road, but being plagued with my toothache &amp; my jaw much swollen, I was obliged to let Bob go by himself &amp; dined at the club with Mr Lindsey. He &amp; I in the evening each got a horse of Me Webster who keeps excellent cattle &amp; took a very pleasant ride down by <span class=highlight_yellow>Catharinoff</span> &amp; round home by the <span class=highlight_yellow>Petershoff</span> Road. After having our grog, retired to bed between 11 &amp; 12 o'clock, exceedingly stiff &amp; fatigued.</p>","pageId":753,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2253,"lock":null}
