14:36:38.779 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":642,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day. The ship making good way about 4 &frac12; knots with a fine breeze at SSE going free. We can perceive the Islands of <span class=highlight_yellow>E</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>tholm</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ene</span> &amp; Bornholm with the glass. The ship much to my annoyance very leaky. Obliged to pump every hour. At 1 o'clock pm passed close to <span class=highlight_yellow>Erth</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow>lm</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ene</span>. With a fine breeze at S by E. Studding sails set. These are small rocky islands belonging to Denmark about 11 miles from Bornholm. Upon the largest is a lighthouse, a few small batteries &amp; houses. On the south side a very good harbour I understand. The other two islands are mostly rocks &amp; ...</p>","pageId":763,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":604,"lock":null}
14:36:38.779 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/8/6/643
14:36:38.779 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":643,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out this morning at the usual hour. Coppers hot &amp; rather feverish, took a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidletz</span>, very pleasant answering a double purpose. A beautiful morning. Summer returned. A light breeze at SE. At noon by observation in lat 55.10N. Kept our reach the whole of the day. Wind NW. At 8 o'clock tacked ship. <span class=highlight_yellow>Reigen</span> Island bearing S by W distant 10 or 12 miles.</p>","pageId":763,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":605,"lock":null}
14:36:38.779 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
