14:36:38.780 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/8/8/2320
14:36:38.780 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2320,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":8,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>.. glass of wine with him &amp; I don't know how to account for it, excepting it was drinking upon an empty stomach but I really got muzzy of which I was sensible enough to feel heartily ashamed when I had to appear in the presence of Mr ships Chapmans. Got on board a little after 12 o'clock after one or two adventured before we left the town H French's ship, the 3 Brothers &amp; several other vessels passed us upward bound between Copenhagen &amp; Elsinore</p>","pageId":764,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2260,"lock":null}
