14:36:38.781 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/8/9/646
14:36:38.781 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":646,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out at the usual hour &amp; found the ship off the Koll having got underway at 9 am with a fresh breeze at W by S, proceeding at the rate of 6 or 6 &frac12; knots during the whole of the day. Passed Anholt at about 6 o'clock in the evening</p>","pageId":764,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":608,"lock":null}
14:36:38.781 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
