14:36:38.782 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/11/690
14:36:38.782 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":690,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked into the city early. Called at Chapmans at 10 o'clock &amp; fixed the Hope for <span class=highlight_yellow>memel</span> at 21/- <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp;</span> load for a full cargo of timber. Found Mr Mewburn at the office, tis a long time ...</p>","pageId":773,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":648,"lock":null}
