14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":698,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been raining very heavy all night. Weather thick. Wind NE. Packed my cloths up. Took a packing coach &amp; went down to the office. Paid &pound;4.12. for 23 gallons of rum at 4/ per gallon. William paid it out of &pound;30 I gave him to place to my <span class=highlight_yellow>Chapmans account</span>. William &amp; I got on board the Pearl Gravesend boat. He accompanied me as far as Woolwich where he landed &amp; I proceeded to the ...</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":656,"lock":null}
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/19/699
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":699,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing a gale of wind from the NNE all night &amp; continued with rain all day. Amused ourselves during the morning strolling about Purfleet &amp; playing at billiards. Got our ballast on board &amp; hauled from the wharf about 5 o'clock. Weighed anchor &amp; sailed down to the Tower. Hope when we brought up for the night. Blowing a gale of wind. Finished a couple of glasses of whiskey punch, smoked a pipe &amp; turned in at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":657,"lock":null}
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/19/699
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":699,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing a gale of wind from the NNE all night &amp; continued with rain all day. Amused ourselves during the morning strolling about Purfleet &amp; playing at billiards. Got our ballast on board &amp; hauled from the wharf about 5 o'clock. Weighed anchor &amp; sailed down to the Tower. Hope when we brought up for the night. Blowing a gale of wind. Finished a couple of glasses of whiskey punch, smoked a pipe &amp; turned in at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":657,"lock":null}
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/2/676
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":676,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. Called upon Jobling. He drove me down to Woolwich to see the Lumley's. Eat some cold meat with them &amp; returned to the ship at Greenwich to dinner, where Tom Jobling joined us. Left the ship about 7 o'clock &amp; drove to town. Had a glass of brandy &amp; wine with Jobling &amp; got to bed at &frac12; past 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":771,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":638,"lock":null}
14:36:38.788 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/2/676
14:36:38.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":676,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind NW. Called upon Jobling. He drove me down to Woolwich to see the Lumley's. Eat some cold meat with them &amp; returned to the ship at Greenwich to dinner, where Tom Jobling joined us. Left the ship about 7 o'clock &amp; drove to town. Had a glass of brandy &amp; wine with Jobling &amp; got to bed at &frac12; past 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":771,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":638,"lock":null}
14:36:38.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/20/700
14:36:38.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":700,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind about NNE. Got under way about 6 o'clock &amp; ran down to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Warp</span> where we brought up about &frac12; past 9 o'clock am.  Turned out an uncommonly fine day &amp; warm. About 12 o'clock the wind got to the NNW then NW &amp; after dinner to W by S &amp; WSW. When we got our anchor up, but being little wind, did not make much way. At about 8 o'clock being dark &amp; not able to see the buoy of the middle, we brought up for the night. Several ships in company.</p>\r\n<p>At 9 o'clock smoked a pipe, wet both eyes &amp; turned in. A good deal annoyed at not being able to proceed, there being a fine breeze.</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":658,"lock":null}
14:36:38.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
