14:36:38.794 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/3/677
14:36:38.794 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":677,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Bob Marsh &amp; I walked into the city &amp; thence on board the Hope where we dined. The people busy getting the tallow out. Returned to Philpot Lane where we stopped until 6 o'clock with Mary Ann first time. Walked out of the city to chambers &amp; remained all evening. Received a letter from William which came yesterday. Did not answer it.</p>","pageId":772,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":639,"lock":null}
