14:36:38.794 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1829/9/30/710
14:36:38.794 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":710,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NNW. Took a walk with Mark. Dined at 12 o'clock. Mr French buried this afternoon, aged 82. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening with Mr Tinley</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":668,"lock":null}
