14:36:38.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/15/822
14:36:38.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
14:36:38.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
