14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/16/823
14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
