14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/17/824
14:36:38.804 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
