14:36:38.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/19/826
14:36:38.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":826,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; very intense frost. Been a little snow in the night. Wind NW. Took a walk to Tynemouth with Captain Webb. Dined at home. At the Commercial with Brown &amp; Newton</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":778,"lock":null}
