14:36:38.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/2/808
14:36:38.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":808,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning rather inclined to thaw. Wind NW. J Tinley drove me to Newcastle but could do nothing for the Hope. The Colliers being still off work. Returned with J Tinley &amp; dined with him. In the evening attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":761,"lock":null}
14:36:38.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
