14:36:38.806 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/21/828
14:36:38.806 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
14:36:38.806 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/21/828
14:36:38.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":828,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of thaw but finer weather. Wind WNW. Dined at home. With a party at the Duke of York in the afternoon. At the whist club in the evening. Received a letter from WBS Paid an average &pound;20.2.6</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":780,"lock":null}
14:36:38.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/22/829
14:36:38.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":829,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fresh weather &amp; been blowing very hard all night from the SE. One ship has got upon the Heard Sand, another upon the rocks &amp; two riding off the Bar. One having cut away her masts &amp; the other with main mast gone. Both these ships &amp; the one on the Heard Sand got into the harbour. Walked to Tynemouth with Nicholson &amp; Cunningham. Dined at home. In the evening H harry, Nicholson &amp; I went to the Duke of York where we found Mr Heweson</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":781,"lock":null}
14:36:38.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
