14:36:38.808 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":830,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Still blowing fresh from S by E. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening at Drury's</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":782,"lock":null}
14:36:38.808 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/24/831
14:36:38.808 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":831,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant raw damp morning. Wind SSE</p>\r\n<p>A serious accident has befallen Mrs Scott. This morning having fallen off the bed &amp; broken her thigh. It is only a simple fracture &amp; having got it set immediately, she is suffering as little pain as could possibly be expected. Wrote to Mrs Dixon to come down immediately. Sent a messenger off to Togston. Dined at J Tinleys. Met Mr Mark there. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":783,"lock":null}
14:36:38.808 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
