14:36:38.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/26/833
14:36:38.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":833,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind about west. Mrs Scott has had a bad night &amp; is very sick and ill. Walked with D Dixon round by the rocks to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards to Benton by the river &amp; Wellington. Dined there &amp; staid all night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":785,"lock":null}
14:36:38.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
