14:36:38.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":837,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind NE. Went to the newsroom, read the papers. Dined at home at 9 o'clock. Spent the afternoon at the billiard room. Wind suddenly changed to SE. Blowing fresh. Attended the whist club at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":789,"lock":null}
14:36:38.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/31/838
14:36:38.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":838,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winter's morning. Frosty with snow. Wind SW. Prevented attending church in the morning. The Smiths coming down so late to breakfast. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley&amp; C Milner. Attended afternoon service &amp; afterwards dined at the castle with west of the 80<sup>th</sup>. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":790,"lock":null}
14:36:38.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
