14:36:38.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":838,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winter's morning. Frosty with snow. Wind SW. Prevented attending church in the morning. The Smiths coming down so late to breakfast. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley&amp; C Milner. Attended afternoon service &amp; afterwards dined at the castle with west of the 80<sup>th</sup>. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":790,"lock":null}
14:36:38.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/4/811
14:36:38.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":811,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather. Frost gone. Wind WNW. Walked up to the Point with H Harry, H Nicholson &amp; J Elder &amp; dined with Mr Sadler. In the evening went up to Newcastle to see Duncan. Had an oyster supper afterwards &amp; got home at about 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":763,"lock":null}
