14:36:38.814 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/7/814
14:36:38.814 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":814,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; fresh weather. Wind about north, been blowing hard all night, sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS. Took a walk with a party to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":766,"lock":null}
14:36:38.814 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
