14:36:38.815 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/1/9/816
14:36:38.815 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":816,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Thawing after a slight frost during the night. Very sloppy &amp; unpleasant. Walked to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Craigs</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":768,"lock":null}
