14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/1/1084
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1084,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning Very little wind at W by S Received a letter from Stephenson on informing me of his safe arrival at Woolwich on Wednesday with a large fleet many of which have been at sea a fortnight. It lost anchors &amp; cables. Dined at home. On board the Brodarick. Attended the first meeting of the whist club</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1032,"lock":null}
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
