14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1084,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning Very little wind at W by S Received a letter from Stephenson on informing me of his safe arrival at Woolwich on Wednesday with a large fleet many of which have been at sea a fortnight. It lost anchors &amp; cables. Dined at home. On board the Brodarick. Attended the first meeting of the whist club</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1032,"lock":null}
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/10/1093
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1093,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning Wind WNW but little of it. Received a letter from WBS. The Hope was out on Friday &amp; going to the chalk wharfs. Went to church. The vicar's brother preached. Gave a most excellent sermon for the benefit of the inadequate society. He a beautiful preacher</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1041,"lock":null}
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.816 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/10/1093
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1093,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning Wind WNW but little of it. Received a letter from WBS. The Hope was out on Friday &amp; going to the chalk wharfs. Went to church. The vicar's brother preached. Gave a most excellent sermon for the benefit of the inadequate society. He a beautiful preacher</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1041,"lock":null}
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/11/1094
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1094,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind little at SE. Got up early &amp; walked round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats, called upon Mr Hewetson &amp; returned to breakfast. Received a letter from WBS with the Hopes coal freight account enclosing Metcalfrs &amp; Drury's note for &pound;79.18.2 Which I paid into chapmans. Took another long walk with H Harry &amp; Peart round by the head of the town, Burdon Main, height Charton, Belly Hill &amp; Preston &amp; got home to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at Alderneys.</p>","pageId":854,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1042,"lock":null}
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/11/1094
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1094,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind little at SE. Got up early &amp; walked round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats, called upon Mr Hewetson &amp; returned to breakfast. Received a letter from WBS with the Hopes coal freight account enclosing Metcalfrs &amp; Drury's note for &pound;79.18.2 Which I paid into chapmans. Took another long walk with H Harry &amp; Peart round by the head of the town, Burdon Main, height Charton, Belly Hill &amp; Preston &amp; got home to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at Alderneys.</p>","pageId":854,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1042,"lock":null}
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/12/1095
14:36:38.817 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1095,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning rather thick. Weather having been rain in the night. Wind but little at east Walked to Tynemouth &amp; Dined at home. Cunningham &amp; H Harry took wine with me. Suppered with Allen &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":854,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1043,"lock":null}
