14:36:38.819 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/17/1100
14:36:38.819 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1100,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind SSW. The Hope arrived last night &amp; is laid upon the Lowlight shore. Did not go to church having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidlity</span>. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1048,"lock":null}
