14:36:38.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/20/1103
14:36:38.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1103,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; a fresh breeze at SW Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; Elder in a sculler to the Point &amp; ate oysters &amp; spent the evening with Sadler. The Hope got 14 Keels today. A great many ships arrived</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1051,"lock":null}
14:36:38.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
