14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/23/1106
14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1106,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WBW. Walked into Newcastle. Called upon Miss Robinson &amp; fixed for Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> to go to her school on Tuesday. Went to the quayside, took a steamer &amp; got home to dinner. In the evening at J Tinlay, whist club</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1054,"lock":null}
14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
