14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/10/24/1107
14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1107,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Went to church. Dined at home unto &frac12; past 1 o'clock. Five companies of the 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment landed today. at the Lowlights from Jersey. Walked to Tynemouth. Spent the afternoon at Cunningham's. In the evening at the Mulstrum. The Lady Jane arrived with only 3 fish</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1055,"lock":null}
14:36:38.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
