14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1168,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning, blowing hard from NNW. It must have been &amp; no doubt no is at sea, from NNE. Such a human disaster sea, been upon the bar. Heavy showers of snow. Dined at home At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":869,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1116,"lock":null}
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/24/1169
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1169,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Most intense frost &amp; NW wind, sea high. Received a letter from WBS of the arrival &amp; sale of 126 chars of the Hope cargo at Wednesday day mackerel  at 34/-. Mr C Wright &amp; Mr L Loyd a <span class=highlight_yellow>dined</span> on board the Lamaracy came &amp; took dinner today. Attended the whist club in the evening at Fenwicks. A most intense frost</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1117,"lock":null}
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/24/1169
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1169,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Most intense frost &amp; NW wind, sea high. Received a letter from WBS of the arrival &amp; sale of 126 chars of the Hope cargo at Wednesday day mackerel  at 34/-. Mr C Wright &amp; Mr L Loyd a <span class=highlight_yellow>dined</span> on board the Lamaracy came &amp; took dinner today. Attended the whist club in the evening at Fenwicks. A most intense frost</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1117,"lock":null}
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/25/1170
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1170,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Xmas day</u> After a most intense frost during the night, we have a heavy fall of snow. Wind NW. At the newsroom. Paris in a fearful state of excitement. The most fearing the decision of the peers well be in favour of the later. Herewith to WBS giving him an account of the weather here. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined with J Cunningham, family party. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1118,"lock":null}
14:36:38.854 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.855 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/25/1170
14:36:38.855 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1170,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Xmas day</u> After a most intense frost during the night, we have a heavy fall of snow. Wind NW. At the newsroom. Paris in a fearful state of excitement. The most fearing the decision of the peers well be in favour of the later. Herewith to WBS giving him an account of the weather here. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined with J Cunningham, family party. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1118,"lock":null}
14:36:38.855 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/26/1171
14:36:38.855 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1171,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frosty weather. A good deal of snow fallen in the night. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Received an account these H Harry, A Clark &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Berges</span> of the sale of 84 more than Hope coals at 35/-. Dined with J Tealey. The officers of HMS Samarang &amp; Childers there &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Goshing</span> RA</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1119,"lock":null}
14:36:38.855 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
