14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1172,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frost still continues. Wind wavering variable between SSW &amp; SSE.  Received a letter from WBS. HMS Childers sailed out in beautiful style. Dined at home. At Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening. Received &pound;1.15. for WBS. Herald <span class=highlight_yellow>hewop</span> open</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1120,"lock":null}
14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/28/1173
14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1173,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but still frosty, although the wind is from the SE. Dined at home at 5 o'clock H Harry. L<font color=#222222>ieutenant </font><font color=#222222>Gostl</font><font color=#222222>i</font><font color=#222222>ng</font><font color=#222222>, K A</font><font color=#222222>.</font><font color=#222222> </font>L<font color=#222222>ieutenant Rudyard 15</font><sup><font color=#222222>th</font></sup><font color=#222222> regiment </font><font color=#222222>Tibbs &amp; </font><font color=#222222>Dr</font><font color=#222222> Wilton dined with me</font><font color=#222222>. H</font><font color=#222222>ad a very pleasant day &amp; in the evening went to the Ball which was very well attended</font></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1121,"lock":null}
14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/28/1173
14:36:38.856 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1173,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but still frosty, although the wind is from the SE. Dined at home at 5 o'clock H Harry. L<font color=#222222>ieutenant </font><font color=#222222>Gostl</font><font color=#222222>i</font><font color=#222222>ng</font><font color=#222222>, K A</font><font color=#222222>.</font><font color=#222222> </font>L<font color=#222222>ieutenant Rudyard 15</font><sup><font color=#222222>th</font></sup><font color=#222222> regiment </font><font color=#222222>Tibbs &amp; </font><font color=#222222>Dr</font><font color=#222222> Wilton dined with me</font><font color=#222222>. H</font><font color=#222222>ad a very pleasant day &amp; in the evening went to the Ball which was very well attended</font></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1121,"lock":null}
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/29/1174
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1174,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; continuance of frost. Wind SW. Walked round by the <span class=highlight_yellow>ridges</span>, the ice so thickly covered with snow, the <span class=highlight_yellow>skating</span> bad. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>at</span><span class=highlight_yellow>re</span></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1122,"lock":null}
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/29/1174
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1174,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; continuance of frost. Wind SW. Walked round by the <span class=highlight_yellow>ridges</span>, the ice so thickly covered with snow, the <span class=highlight_yellow>skating</span> bad. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>at</span><span class=highlight_yellow>re</span></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1122,"lock":null}
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/3/1147
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1147,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing hard from the SE. Received an answer from Mr Coulter with the cago both for my <span class=highlight_yellow>seguaturn</span> &amp; refusing to make any allowance. Retuned it &amp; complaining of the <span class=highlight_yellow>enforshor</span> Cunningham &amp; A Nicholson dined With me on board the Hope. At the theater &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":864,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1095,"lock":null}
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/3/1147
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1147,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing hard from the SE. Received an answer from Mr Coulter with the cago both for my <span class=highlight_yellow>seguaturn</span> &amp; refusing to make any allowance. Retuned it &amp; complaining of the <span class=highlight_yellow>enforshor</span> Cunningham &amp; A Nicholson dined With me on board the Hope. At the theater &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":864,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1095,"lock":null}
14:36:38.857 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/30/1175
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1175,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frost this morning but slight. Mark Webb &amp; I set off to walk to Hartley with our guns, but by the time we reached Whetley it began to sleet &amp; rain so <span class=highlight_yellow>heavy</span> that we turned back but got wet before we got home. Dined at home &amp; attended the whist club in the evening. Was engaged to supper at Cheston with Lowrey but being such a stormy night did not go.</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1123,"lock":null}
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/30/1175
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1175,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frost this morning but slight. Mark Webb &amp; I set off to walk to Hartley with our guns, but by the time we reached Whetley it began to sleet &amp; rain so <span class=highlight_yellow>heavy</span> that we turned back but got wet before we got home. Dined at home &amp; attended the whist club in the evening. Was engaged to supper at Cheston with Lowrey but being such a stormy night did not go.</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1123,"lock":null}
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/31/1176
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1176,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Very thick &amp; damp &amp; from the heavy rain last night, the snow has quite disappeared . Wind SW. Dined at home. Spent the evening at Mr Richmond's &amp; sat the new year in. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":872,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1124,"lock":null}
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
