14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/4/1148
14:36:38.858 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1148,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp morning. Wind SSW. Gave Stephenson a draft on chapman for &pound;10 being the balance of his archangel account 3.12.6 Tongues &pound;1.18 &amp; cash for present voy<font color=#BFBFBF>age</font> &pound;4.9.7. Dined with J B Wright at the Star &amp; Garter Tynemouth at 5 o'clock &amp; in the evening attended the whist club at Tibbe</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1096,"lock":null}
