14:36:38.859 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/12/5/1149
14:36:38.859 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1149,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning rather cold wind SSW. Several ships got to sea. Not very well. Did not go to church. Dined with H Harry &amp; also took tea &amp; in the evening at the Mulstrum &amp; Abbey</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1097,"lock":null}
