14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/18/856
14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":856,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frosty morning wind NW. A sea upon the bar which will prevent the Hope getting out. Dined at home In the evening at the Whist Club.</p>","pageId":799,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":808,"lock":null}
14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
