14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":856,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frosty morning wind NW. A sea upon the bar which will prevent the Hope getting out. Dined at home In the evening at the Whist Club.</p>","pageId":799,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":808,"lock":null}
14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/19/857
14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":857,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A course frost. Wind NNW &amp; blowing fresh &amp; although the sea was breaking upon the bar, several small ships ventured out &amp; some were literally smothered in the surf, but all got out safe. Dined with I Readhead on board the Nautalus At the billiard room in the afternoon. Drank tea at home &amp; in the evening With Bode Jerois &amp; afterwards at the Duke Of York</p>","pageId":799,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":809,"lock":null}
14:36:38.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
