14:36:38.869 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":840,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of winter weather, very cold. Been blowing a gale all night with snow showers A heavy sea upon the bar. Wind E.S.E Dined at home. At 3 o'clock at the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening called and sat an hour or two with Mark, he having had a severe loin attack</p>","pageId":795,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":792,"lock":null}
14:36:38.869 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/20/858
14:36:38.869 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":858,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost Wind NW. Got up early &amp; went by stream to Newcastle; had a heavy snow storm Returned to dinner at 1 o'clock. Emma G with us. Mrs Dixon came to see Mrs Scott Not water sufficient for the Hope to get to sea. Attended the Whist Club at Allans in the evening</p>\r\n<p>xx</p>","pageId":799,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":810,"lock":null}
14:36:38.869 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/20/858
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":858,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost Wind NW. Got up early &amp; went by stream to Newcastle; had a heavy snow storm Returned to dinner at 1 o'clock. Emma G with us. Mrs Dixon came to see Mrs Scott Not water sufficient for the Hope to get to sea. Attended the Whist Club at Allans in the evening</p>\r\n<p>xx</p>","pageId":799,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":810,"lock":null}
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/21/859
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":859,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning Been a delightful fall of snow in the night. Blowing fresh at NWW. Attended morning Service; a collection was made for the singers &pound;9.6 received. Dined at home. Being a fine sea tide a great many ships got to sea among them the Hope. Dined at home &amp; went to afternoon service. Afternoon walked to Tynemouth In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":811,"lock":null}
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
