14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/22/860
14:36:38.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":860,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of severe frost. &amp; NW wind. Payed 5/- for the Hope's foy boat. Having a cold &amp; Pain in my side, took physician &amp; remained in the house. Dined at home At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":800,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":812,"lock":null}
