14:36:38.876 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":844,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind S.W. &amp; keen frost. Walked to Cullercoats Dined at home. In the evening the whist Club. Tea at Mr N Finwicks<u> </u></p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":796,"lock":null}
14:36:38.876 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/2/7/845
14:36:38.876 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
14:36:38.876 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
