14:36:38.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":872,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A duller foggy morning. Wind SW.  <del>Afterwards got to the L&amp;E</del> <del>Cold accompanied</del> Took a walk with Captain Webb to Tynemouth. Dined with Nicholson a party spent a very Pleasant day &amp; in the evening Attended the Whist Club at I Dales</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":824,"lock":null}
14:36:38.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/3/7/873
14:36:38.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":873,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy morning. Wind NE. Afterwards changed to SE &amp; fine clear weather. Went to Church in the morning. Mr Pemberton accompanied me. I was engaged to dine with I Tealey today but on my return from Church. I found that Mrs Scott was so much poorer &amp; her death expected every moment. I sent an apology. She expired precisely at 9 o'clock without a struggle</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":825,"lock":null}
14:36:38.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
