14:36:38.897 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/13/912
14:36:38.897 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":912,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... party consisting of the <span class=highlight_yellow>Joblary</span> &amp; he took them all away, which prevented the remainder of the company, being too few, having any dancing. Craig it appears took the party with much of the gentlemen to his own house &amp; prevailing upon the musicians to accompany him. May these had a dance. But that would be expected from a fellow brought up behind a counter ! the filles ! place for him.</p>","pageId":812,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":864,"lock":null}
