14:36:38.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":922,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Received a note from In Carr of Walkers, that he could not see me to dinner today a fixed upon &amp; immediately me for next Tuesday. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Bulman cargo club &pound;1.12. Entrance on policy 1830. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":874,"lock":null}
14:36:38.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/24/923
14:36:38.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":923,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull morning with rain. Wind SE. Walked with Captain Webb to Tynmouth &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton at the Star &amp; Garter. Dined at house &amp; attended the whist club in the evening at the A Fenwicks. Rained very heavy  all the afternoon with the wind changed to N by W</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":875,"lock":null}
14:36:38.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
