14:36:38.905 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/3/901
14:36:38.905 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":901,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning with heavy showers of snow. A great deal having fallen during the night. Wind ENE. Dined at home. Emma G: came from school to us. In the evening attended the whist club at Mrs Creigs. And asked the club to come to me on Thursday</p>","pageId":809,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":853,"lock":null}
