14:36:38.907 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":903,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another frosty morning blowing fresh at NW Dined at home</p>","pageId":809,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":855,"lock":null}
14:36:38.907 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/4/6/904
14:36:38.907 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":904,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; blowing fresh from the WNW. Saw Brown about his continuancy in the George. He is to give us an address by Thursday Took the steam boat &amp; went to Newcastle Could not get anything for the Hope Lunched with A Weyhtos &amp; at 3 o'clock called in Westgate Street. I found Mrs Dixon just arrived from Brenbuch &amp; Joys Cow Dined &amp; stayed all night with them</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":856,"lock":null}
14:36:38.907 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
