14:36:38.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/1/930
14:36:38.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":930,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning much like rain. Wind WSW Turned out a most beautiful day. Went with H Harry by steam to Newcastle. Could not fix the Hope, but almost determined to talk 11 Gr Kent to Dublin. Returned home to dinner. Tour Seventh A Harry &amp; Emma G: dined with me. Mark came in to wine. In the evening we went to whist club at Allens</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":882,"lock":null}
14:36:38.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
