14:36:38.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/10/939
14:36:38.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":939,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>at &frac12; past 8 o'clock. Got the Alnwick coach at Newcastle at 10 o'clock and reached Alnwick at 3. Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderstow there in the carriage &amp; took me out to Leamington to dinner</p>","pageId":818,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":891,"lock":null}
14:36:38.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
