14:36:38.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":942,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather again. Wind about SW. After breakfast we went to fish in the Ala Had fair sport &amp; got home to dinner. Spent a quiet evening</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":894,"lock":null}
14:36:38.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/14/943
14:36:38.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":943,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind much the same. Again went &amp; fished in the Alm. Not such good sport. Returned to dinner found Mrs Forston of Alnwick there, who fed  with us. Got a letter from WBS.</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":895,"lock":null}
14:36:38.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
