14:36:38.913 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/16/945
14:36:38.913 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":945,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind somewhere from the W. After breakfast, accompanied Jane of the family in the carriage to Bottom Church. Mr Manestry did the service. Mrs I Winton not well. Dined at home. Wrote to A Harry to ask if he had fixed the Hope</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":897,"lock":null}
