14:36:38.914 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":946,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind from the S &amp; W. Engaged all the morning fishing in the Aln &amp; had good sport. Returned home to dinner</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":898,"lock":null}
14:36:38.914 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/18/947
