14:36:38.915 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":949,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day but rather cooler wind SE. Again <span class=highlight_yellow>binoculars</span> in shooting rooks. Bob Alderton &amp; I rode over to Broom Park to dinner. Met there Tom JW &amp; Mrs Dixon. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":901,"lock":null}
