14:36:38.916 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":950,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather cool. Wind SE. shooting rooks. In the moor. After lunch went out to fish &amp; got down at &frac12; paid 8.6- killed two dozen good trout</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":902,"lock":null}
