14:36:38.916 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":950,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather cool. Wind SE. shooting rooks. In the moor. After lunch went out to fish &amp; got down at &frac12; paid 8.6- killed two dozen good trout</p>","pageId":820,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":902,"lock":null}
14:36:38.916 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/22/951
14:36:38.916 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":951,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather and warmer. The whole of the moors answered ours <span class=highlight_yellow>lpes</span> in shooting rooks, killed about 70. Young <span class=highlight_yellow>Clensed</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Fiawick</span> came from school to stop until Monday chat. Ilterton's birthday, made a jug of punch in the evening to drink his health</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":903,"lock":null}
