14:36:38.917 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":951,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather and warmer. The whole of the moors answered ours <span class=highlight_yellow>lpes</span> in shooting rooks, killed about 70. Young <span class=highlight_yellow>Clensed</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Fiawick</span> came from school to stop until Monday chat. Ilterton's birthday, made a jug of punch in the evening to drink his health</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":903,"lock":null}
14:36:38.917 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/23/952
14:36:38.917 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":952,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Went with the carriage in the morning to church. <span class=highlight_yellow>Pa</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ss</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ed</span> the afternoon in walking about the garden. In the evening a thick fog set in &amp; the wind from the SE.</p>","pageId":821,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":904,"lock":null}
