14:36:38.920 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":959,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... &amp; continued showering all day. Got upon Dunns coach at 4 o'clock &amp; arrived at home a little after 5 o'clock to dinner. Received a letter from <span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ss</span>. That my friend A Harry &amp; A Nicholson the latter the first time since his parried <span class=highlight_yellow>extect</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>es</span> captain his ship the Tenacity having foundered in the North Sea &amp; he &amp; the crew taken aboard on <span class=highlight_yellow>gallcot</span> that <span class=highlight_yellow>Cuekerly</span> hove in sights before dark. Spent the evening together with Mr Com <span class=highlight_yellow>Hewesion</span> at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":911,"lock":null}
14:36:38.920 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/3/932
14:36:38.920 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":932,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind about West. By Steam to Newcastle but did not find the Hope to load coal for Dublin as intended as they could not load her before they did of much works. Returned to Dinner on board the Choice in the afternoon. Drank tea with H Harry &amp; In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":816,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":884,"lock":null}
14:36:38.920 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
