14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":961,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NSW Blowing hard. Sent my letter off to WBS. Gave a draft on estate then 4 on after  for &pound;50 for ABS. Crew also from &pound;10.10s + &pound;16.3.8 = 27.3.8 for av wages ...</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":913,"lock":null}
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/31/962
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":962,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... Hope &amp; Liberal club. A Harry, A Nicholson &amp; Richardson NP took 1 o'clock dinner with me &amp; we afterwards crossed the water to South Shields Races, but it came on such a stormy afternoon we could not do the sport</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":914,"lock":null}
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/31/962
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":962,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... Hope &amp; Liberal club. A Harry, A Nicholson &amp; Richardson NP took 1 o'clock dinner with me &amp; we afterwards crossed the water to South Shields Races, but it came on such a stormy afternoon we could not do the sport</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":914,"lock":null}
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/4/933
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":933,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather with a West wind. Turned out at 6 o'clock &amp; took a long walk round by Cullercoat Sands &amp; before breakfast. And afterwards Webb, Mark &amp; I took a walk along the hard sand where I made a sketch of Tynmouth Castle be. Returned home to dinner. In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":885,"lock":null}
14:36:38.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/4/933
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":933,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather with a West wind. Turned out at 6 o'clock &amp; took a long walk round by Cullercoat Sands &amp; before breakfast. And afterwards Webb, Mark &amp; I took a walk along the hard sand where I made a sketch of Tynmouth Castle be. Returned home to dinner. In the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":885,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/5/934
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":934,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Glorious weather. Wind very variable between SE &amp; W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Gave up the Dublin charter &amp; returned home to dinner. A Harry took a bottle of port with us &amp; I gave him an order to fix the Hope for anchorage &amp; Hull dealers at &pound;4.7.6 At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":886,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/5/934
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":934,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Glorious weather. Wind very variable between SE &amp; W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Gave up the Dublin charter &amp; returned home to dinner. A Harry took a bottle of port with us &amp; I gave him an order to fix the Hope for anchorage &amp; Hull dealers at &pound;4.7.6 At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":886,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/7/935
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":935,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind East &amp; SE. Walked beyond Marsden Rocks with Webb, Gosling RNW To see <span class=highlight_yellow>exfrenements</span> laid for saving shipwrecked men, my means of a rope ladder &amp; air jacket. Returned home to dinner. Webb &amp; Gosling dinned with us. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening at Webb </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":887,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/7/935
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":935,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind East &amp; SE. Walked beyond Marsden Rocks with Webb, Gosling RNW To see <span class=highlight_yellow>exfrenements</span> laid for saving shipwrecked men, my means of a rope ladder &amp; air jacket. Returned home to dinner. Webb &amp; Gosling dinned with us. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening at Webb </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":887,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/8/936
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
14:36:38.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/8/936
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/9/937
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/5/9/937
14:36:38.925 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
14:36:38.925 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/6/1/963
14:36:38.925 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":963,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind blowing fresh at SW. A Harry, Nicholson took a walk around Tynmouth &amp; at 2 o'clock dined with I Richardson MP at 4 o'clock. We crossed the water to attend the races which were all won easy by chamber horses. Got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":915,"lock":null}
14:36:38.925 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
