14:36:38.929 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":979,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning wind NE  with showers. H Harry, French &amp; I went up to Newcastle in a steam boat. Walked out to the race course. Very little company there. The running very good. Dined at the Stand &amp;  got to Shields again in a gig by the country road at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":931,"lock":null}
