14:36:38.930 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":981,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cold. With a NE wind. Walked round by the high end of Shields to Dr Drings garden. Dined at home. At the Pig &amp; Whistle &amp; in the evening at Tynemouth. Suppered with A Harry</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":932,"lock":null}
14:36:38.930 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
