14:36:38.931 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/6/26/984
14:36:38.931 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":984,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning and blowing fresh at SE with a heavy sea upon the bar. Took a short walk. Dined at home. A French gave me a bottle of wine at the George. An awfully heavy thunder storm with a deluge of rain which overflowed the streets in two or three minutes &amp; changed the wind to NW</p>","pageId":828,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":935,"lock":null}
14:36:38.931 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
