14:36:38.933 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":986,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning with appearance of rain. Wind SE. Received an account of the poor vicar's death at &frac14; past 8 o'clock on Saturday morning to the inexpressible sorrow of the a <span class=highlight_yellow>alecow</span>. All the ships be hoisted their colours half mast high. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy thunder storm with showers at intervals. Went to see A Harry in the evening who has got a light attack of gout.</p>","pageId":829,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":937,"lock":null}
14:36:38.933 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/6/29/987
14:36:38.933 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":987,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; like more rain again blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from B B Gallbraith &amp; answered it. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":829,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":938,"lock":null}
14:36:38.933 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
