14:36:38.940 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1001,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning but rather dull. Wind SSW &amp; blowing hard. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the evening walked with Mark to Tynemouth. Heard this evening of Leddill having resigned! Consequently there is no possibility of a contest for the county</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":952,"lock":null}
14:36:38.940 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/15/1002
14:36:38.940 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1002,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning blowing fresh at SW. Walked up to Tynemouth, met Harry Nicholson &amp; Richardson who had been over the bar with the Harvey bound to <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascksaget</span>. Dined at home. Took wine with Richardson &amp; spent a very pleasant afternoon &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth</p>","pageId":833,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":953,"lock":null}
14:36:38.940 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
