14:36:38.941 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/17/1004
14:36:38.941 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1004,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth Had a little rain. In the afternoon Henry Mark Nicklinson had a little Wiskey todd at Koddams. Walked to Tynemouth again in the evening and finished off at the Duke of York (paid the <span class=highlight_yellow>su</span><span class=highlight_yellow>shious</span> wives the amount of &pound;16-10)</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":955,"lock":null}
