14:36:38.942 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1005,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day with puffs of wind at WSW. Went to Church in the morning. Stayed at home in the evening walked to Tynemouth in large afternoon blaze of company thence</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":956,"lock":null}
14:36:38.942 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/19/1006
14:36:38.942 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1006,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, wind W by S and WNW. Walked  to Tynemouth and shuffled home to <span class=highlight_yellow>denby</span> for M W Kedley cause afraid N  South Shields Then took <span class=highlight_yellow>Wenes</span> walk at Nicklinson at the <span class=highlight_yellow>G</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eor</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ge</span></p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":957,"lock":null}
