14:36:38.944 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/23/1010
14:36:38.944 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1010,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning, The qlaps fallen a little, wind NNW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; came home To dinner. In the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked round by the Doctor's garden. In the evening a little rain</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":961,"lock":null}
