14:36:38.946 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1013,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful morning. Very slight breeze from SW. Afterwards NW. A Harry &amp; I took a cullier &amp; went round ...</p>","pageId":836,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":964,"lock":null}
14:36:38.946 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/26/1014
14:36:38.946 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1014,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... to Tynemouth haven where I bathed. Walked home to dinner. In the afternoon we took I Richardson's coble &amp; went to sea mackerel fishing. Stood as far as Hartley Bay but caught nothing. Ran to the south &amp; brought up off the Herd where we caught several guraets &amp; got home at 10 o'clock after a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":837,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":965,"lock":null}
