14:36:38.947 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/27/1015
14:36:38.947 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1015,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Further most beautiful day &amp; but for a SE breeze would have been insufferably hot. Bathed again this morning. The water in fine order. Walked to Tynemouth. Got home to dinner. Took Wine at the George. Tea at A Harry's &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth. A great many people in the castle yard</p>","pageId":837,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":966,"lock":null}
