14:36:38.948 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1018,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, rather thick, wind East. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Cleaned up and turned out excessively hot. A little rain in the evening which brought the wind round to NW. Some lightning</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":969,"lock":null}
