14:36:38.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/6/994
14:36:38.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":994,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull calm morning. Wind SW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Received &pound;4.9.2 balance of premium out of Hope club. Saw the exhibition of paintings which was very good. Walked with D Dixon out to Beaton. Dined &amp; stayed all night</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":945,"lock":null}
14:36:38.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
