14:36:38.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":995,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy heavy thunder storm this morning. A deluge of rain. Wind SW &amp; afterwards NW. Set off after breakfast &amp; walked down to Shields between storms. After my arrival it commenced again &amp; continued the remainder of the day, heavy thunder &amp; rain. Dined at I Tealeys</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":946,"lock":null}
14:36:38.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/7/8/996
14:36:38.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":996,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine clear morning blowing fresh from W by N. Dined at home. Wrote to ABS &amp; sent him his inventory of <span class=highlight_yellow>fumition</span> &amp; by Mr Gosling who sets off for London in the morning. In the evening walked with H Harry to Tynemouth &amp; called in at the Duke of York on our way home</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":947,"lock":null}
14:36:38.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
