14:36:38.953 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/10/1031
14:36:38.953 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1031,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":10,"sequence":3.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at E by S. I went to Newcastle in the steam boat. I dined at the rooms at a <span class=highlight_yellow>deueser</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>geocor</span>. Mr Hodgson then returned home. I stayed all night at Mr Aireys in Eldon Square. A wet day</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":980,"lock":null}
