14:36:38.956 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/17/1038
14:36:38.956 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1038,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Beautiful day. Wind NNE. Payed an <span class=highlight_yellow>averages</span> Hope Club &pound;10.2.1 Walked with J Tinley &amp; WBS to C <span class=highlight_yellow>Milncras</span> to dinner. Returned home in the evening</p>","pageId":842,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":987,"lock":null}
14:36:38.956 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
