14:36:38.961 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/26/1048
14:36:38.961 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1048,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Been rain in the night. Wind N to NE &amp; WNW. Turned out a very fine day. Received a letter from J Chapman. William and I went out with our guns &amp; walked to Marsden Rock by the sands. Got to the top of the rock, a man having made steps up. Got a lunch there &amp; on our way home took a few glasses of punch with the sea breeze &amp; Phasine Society who has <span class=highlight_yellow>this tent</span> pitched on the cliffs.</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":996,"lock":null}
