14:36:38.962 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/27/1049
14:36:38.962 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1049,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little wind at SE with showers. Mr Mark, William &amp; I went in a chaise to Whitby Park &amp; dined with Mr J Wright. Turned out very wet night</p>","pageId":845,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":997,"lock":null}
14:36:38.962 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
