14:36:38.967 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/8/8/1027
14:36:38.967 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1027,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind ENE. Attended service. Mr  King preached. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. An immense number of people there. Dined at I Finleys. At Tynemouth again in the evening. But it unfortunately rained a little &amp; frightened the people away.</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":978,"lock":null}
