14:36:38.968 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/10/1063
14:36:38.968 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1063,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with the appearance of more rain. Wind N by W. Several ships got to sea. Walked to Tynemouth, caught in the rain. Dined at home. At Roddany in the afternoon &amp; the Duke &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":847,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1011,"lock":null}
