14:36:38.971 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/18/1071
14:36:38.971 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1071,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind NW. Onboard the Hope. Got two keels of <span class=highlight_yellow>wqlaure</span> down. Pain G Slop &pound;3.11.3 wages up to today. Dined at home. H Henry &amp; I on board the Hope to taste some brandy. In the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1019,"lock":null}
