14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1072,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with a little rain. Wind SW, increased in the afternoon to a gale. Attended morning service. The vicar did duty &amp; preached. Dined at home. Took wine with H Harry &amp; tea in the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1020,"lock":null}
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/2/1055
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1055,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been a great deal of rain in the night &amp; still continuous heavy wind SW. Borrowed &pound;300 of Chapman's upon WBS &amp; I are named executors to pay bills &amp; for Mrs Scott's executors, funeral etc. Dined at home. In the evening there was a total eclipse of the moon</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1003,"lock":null}
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/2/1055
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1055,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been a great deal of rain in the night &amp; still continuous heavy wind SW. Borrowed &pound;300 of Chapman's upon WBS &amp; I are named executors to pay bills &amp; for Mrs Scott's executors, funeral etc. Dined at home. In the evening there was a total eclipse of the moon</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1003,"lock":null}
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/20/1073
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1073,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has blown a gale of wind all night at SW &amp; continuing. The Suffolk Hull steamer was driven upon the rock in coming in last night. Walked to the rock to see the Suffolk. No chance of getting her off. Afterwards walked up to Sadlers at the Point to dinner &amp; spent a pleasant day at the Malstrum in the evening. Got our <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship this morning</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1021,"lock":null}
14:36:38.972 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
