14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/29/1082
14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1082,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a long walk round by the heigh end of the town. Preston &amp; by the fields to Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon waiting for me on my return. Dined &amp; spent a pleasant day at H Dales. At the Marlstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1030,"lock":null}
14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
