14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1082,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a long walk round by the heigh end of the town. Preston &amp; by the fields to Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon waiting for me on my return. Dined &amp; spent a pleasant day at H Dales. At the Marlstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1030,"lock":null}
14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/3/1056
14:36:38.978 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1056,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very boisterous day with rain &amp; blowing hard from N by W to N &amp; NNE which brought on a heavy sea. HMS Cordelia came in. William &amp; I took the coach to Benton Lane &amp; walked up to Dixons, but they were at Belford.  Walked home to dinner. In the evening at a Quadrille party at J Tenby.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1004,"lock":null}
