14:36:38.979 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/30/1083
14:36:38.979 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1083,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a warm bath. Dined at home. On board the Brodewick in the afternoon In the evening went to a concert at the theatre at which Miss Hughes sang a march, beautiful voice &amp; fine execution. Suppered with Mr Tinley</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1031,"lock":null}
