14:36:38.979 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1830/9/4/1057
14:36:38.979 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1057,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calmer weather. Wind NE. Engaged with WBS preparing for his departure. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> with us. Dined at home. WBS embarked at 5 o'clock on board the Ahoy of <span class=highlight_yellow>Ed</span><span class=highlight_yellow>inb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rgh</span> Steamer for London. Wind changed to SSE. At the Duke &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Druries</span> in the evening.</p>","pageId":846,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1005,"lock":null}
14:36:38.979 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
