14:36:38.981 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1060,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning, blowing hard from the NE with a sea upon the bar. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":847,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1008,"lock":null}
14:36:38.981 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
