-13 Trip to London</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-15\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-15 Reconciled with Bob Marsh after 2 years</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-19\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-19 By coach to Southampton</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-23\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-23 Sailed to Guernsey</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-08-26\">\r\n\t<p>1831-08-26 Returned to Southampton</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-02\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-02 Returned to London</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-08\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-08 Coronation procession of King William IV along Pall Mall</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-21\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-21 Presented to the King at a 'Levee' and kissed his hand</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-09-22\">\r\n\t<p>1831-09-22 Launch of HMS Thunderer</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-10-01\">\r\n\t<p>1831-10-01 Sailed home to North Shields</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1831.html#1831-10-10\">\r\n\t<p>1831-10-10 The Hope spings a leak!</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
