14:36:38.983 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1178,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A slight frost during the night wind WSW.  Walked up to Beaton. Dined and stayed all night. Mr Allinson and their daughters dined there.  Emma Galbraith not very well and looking delicate.</p>","pageId":873,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1125,"lock":null}
14:36:38.983 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/10/1188
14:36:38.983 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1188,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, blowing fresh from NNE. Went by steam to Newcastle. Fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>ords</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Redheught</span> to be upheld 11/- freight go to WBS as factor, &amp; all profit above 11/- to be divided. Returned by coach. Attended the annual meeting of the Eligible and United clubs to alter &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>receive</span> the rules etc. Sat down a large party to dinner afterwards. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1134,"lock":null}
14:36:38.983 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
