14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1193,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy morning. Wind about west. On board the Hope, finished her loading, but did not go to sea, the weather having such an unsettled appearance &amp; wind so far from the southward. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Mr Gortlier R A at Tynemouth Place</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1139,"lock":null}
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/16/1194
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1194,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind SW. Did not go to church as Mr Burdan was to sit in our pew to try how he liked it before he would determine upon taking it. Dined at home. Dr Drury &amp; friends came in &amp; took a glass of wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1140,"lock":null}
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/16/1194
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1194,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind SW. Did not go to church as Mr Burdan was to sit in our pew to try how he liked it before he would determine upon taking it. Dined at home. Dr Drury &amp; friends came in &amp; took a glass of wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1140,"lock":null}
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/17/1195
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1195,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still very unpleasant foggy weather. Wind SSW. Received a letter from WBS. Sent him a copy of Chapmans book for the last quarter, also gave him authority to apply to the Duke for a commission in the Northumbria Militia. Dined at home. Wind freshened at SE &amp; every appearance of bad weather.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1141,"lock":null}
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:38.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/17/1195
14:36:38.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1195,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still very unpleasant foggy weather. Wind SSW. Received a letter from WBS. Sent him a copy of Chapmans book for the last quarter, also gave him authority to apply to the Duke for a commission in the Northumbria Militia. Dined at home. Wind freshened at SE &amp; every appearance of bad weather.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1141,"lock":null}
14:36:38.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/1/18/1196
14:36:38.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1196,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very damp foggy morning. Wind fresh at SE &amp; a good deal of sea. Dined at 5 o'clock with the Gastling RA Tynemouth Place. A very pleasant party. Got home before1 o'clock in the morning. Gave notes to the Premium &amp; Hope clubs of the Hope being loaded. Leadbetter went to Newcastle</p>","pageId":878,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1142,"lock":null}
