14:36:39.002 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/16/1486
14:36:39.002 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1486,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind W by N. After a breakfast walked to Tynemouth. Called upon &amp; lunched with W<font color=#BFBFBF>illia</font><sup>m</sup> Laidlers. Lounged about the Castle Yard all the afternoon. Dined with J Readhead &amp; Lockwood &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1432,"lock":null}
