14:36:39.007 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1493,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with showers &amp; SW wind. Did not go to church. At the newsroom all the morning. Dined at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Ed Chesterton dined with me. Lockerwood came in in the afternoon.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1439,"lock":null}
14:36:39.007 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/24/1494
14:36:39.007 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1494,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh from the SW. Lockerwood &amp; I walked up to Wallsend &amp; breakfasted with Potts. The hounds after breakfast were taken out. Charlton offered me his horse but I declined it. Laid the hounds on a <span class=highlight_yellow>bag</span> fox. Returned home. Dined with Readhead &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":956,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1440,"lock":null}
