14:36:39.009 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/10/28/1498
14:36:39.009 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1498,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. A great many ships sailed. The Hope came down below to load. Got some damage done by the painter. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Tom Jobling at Mrs Atkinson.</p>\r\n<p>Quarrelled with Bess</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1444,"lock":null}
