14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1520,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of snow last night again. A complete thaw with sleet. Wind E by N. Paid average Eligible Club &pound;12. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1466,"lock":null}
14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/2/1503
14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1503,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind fresh from SW &amp; little rain.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson up to &amp; he settled with Mr Archer. Received 30/0 &amp; a deal plank. The ship got her beef on board. Sent WBS a round up. Walked up to Tynemouth. Saw Rifles march for Manchester. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Lockerwood came in &amp; took a glass of toddy with me.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1449,"lock":null}
14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
