14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/21/1522
14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
14:36:39.023 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.024 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/21/1522
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/22/1523
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/22/1523
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/23/1524
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1524,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; fresh breezes from WNW. Wrote to WBS with a list of ships that sailed before &amp; after the Hope. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess's. Jobling, H Hurry &amp; Boswell <font color=#BFBFBF>there</font>.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1470,"lock":null}
14:36:39.025 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
