14:36:39.027 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/27/1528
14:36:39.027 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1528,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold &amp; frosty. Wind SW. My head still being bad from cold, T this morning breakfasted in bed &amp; got up at 12 o'clock. Went to church in the afternoon. Afterwards walked round by Tynemouth. Dined with Tinley at 5 o'clock, Jobley &amp; Captain Cuthbert 15<sup>th</sup> there</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1474,"lock":null}
