14:36:39.029 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/3/1504
14:36:39.029 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
