14:36:39.031 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
14:36:39.031 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/8/1509
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1509,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine autumnal morning. Fresh breeze from the NW &amp; WNW. Walked to Tynemouth with Lockwood &amp; afterwards to Preston. Dined at home &amp; spent the evening at <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span>.</p>\r\n<p>Worse accounts from Sunderland, several new cases of cholera &amp; deaths</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1455,"lock":null}
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/9/1510
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1510,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Air frosty &amp; glass high. Wind NW.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from Wilkinson &amp; Angus saying they could not purchase the carriage.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with Boswell to Tynemouth. Jobling arrived &amp; agreed to stay with me. He dined with me at 2 o'clock. At the billiards room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Ordered 2 gallons of whiskey for one of which Jobling paid.</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1456,"lock":null}
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/11/9/1510
