14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/1/1532
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
14:36:39.032 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.033 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/1/1532
14:36:39.033 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
14:36:39.033 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/10/1541
14:36:39.033 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
14:36:39.033 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.034 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/10/1541
14:36:39.034 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1541,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind from SW. Went by Dunns coach to Newcastle. At Bell &amp; Browns <span class=highlight_yellow>ofein</span>. The ship will get coals on Monday &amp; be loaded on Wednesday. Saw Mr Anderson, Hope Club, to let him have the average papers on Tuesday. The committee having a meeting on Thursday to settle <span class=highlight_yellow>Hopes</span> etc. Called &amp; saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> found her quite well. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner. At the billiard room &amp; at night attended the whist club at H Harry's</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1487,"lock":null}
14:36:39.034 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/11/1542
14:36:39.034 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
14:36:39.034 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
