14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1542,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind South. Did not go to church. Dr Drury called. I called upon &amp; sat some time with J Dale who has been extremely ill. Dined at 2 o'clock with Dr Drury. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1488,"lock":null}
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/12/1543
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/12/1543
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/13/1544
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
14:36:39.035 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
