14:36:39.038 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1548,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning, but fine weather. A fresh breeze from WSW &amp; SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Signed the Hope's cargo bill &pound;216.10.6 at 60 days from the 14 Dec.</p>\r\n<p>Saw Dixon Dixon. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Lockwood dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. At the whist club with me at Ben Wrights</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1494,"lock":null}
14:36:39.038 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/18/1549
14:36:39.038 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
14:36:39.038 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.038 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/18/1549
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1549,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Engaged most of the morning in the house writing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Jobling stayed confined to his room. At the Doctor's in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1495,"lock":null}
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/19/1550
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/19/1550
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/2/1533
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1533,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Thick cold weather wind WNW. The committee of the Eligible &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Whcatley</span> as a member of the Hope Club committee, went on board the Hope &amp; surveyed her &amp; found her much strained &amp; they readily agreed to give her a caulking, if I were willing to accept it &amp; not strip her etc. two warps a <span class=highlight_yellow>trwlinge</span> &amp; studding sail continued. Set the men on to work after dinner.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Messrs Hurry &amp; Co. <font color=#BFBFBF>of </font>Yarmouth acknowledging the receipt of these accounts &amp; vouchers.</p>\r\n<p>Dined with a party at Gordons at Tynemouth Place at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1479,"lock":null}
14:36:39.039 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
