14:36:39.041 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/22/1553
14:36:39.041 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1553,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp morning. Wind South. At the news &amp; billiard rooms. Dined with J Tinley at 6 o'clock to meet Colonel Creagh, an officer sent down by government to establish Boards of Health &amp; the precautions against the cholera. Captain Lenthbest &amp; Gosling there</p>","pageId":970,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1499,"lock":null}
