14:36:39.045 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/29/1560
14:36:39.045 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1560,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went up to the new quay with Drury. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Attended the whist club in the evening. Called at Bess's but slept at home.</p>","pageId":971,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1506,"lock":null}
