14:36:39.045 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/3/1534
14:36:39.045 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1534,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. At the dock the men 21 busy caulking. Stephenson &amp; the carpenter found the ship in good order &amp; not at all broken. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. At the billiard room. Called to see Bess &amp; at night at the club at Drury</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1480,"lock":null}
