14:36:39.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1537,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, after rain &amp; blowing very heavy from WSW. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach, called on bell &amp; Brown to let them know when the Hope would be out of dock. Saw Emma Galbraith who was quite well. Returned to Shields by steam. At the ship. Dined with Dr Drury.  At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1483,"lock":null}
14:36:39.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/7/1538
14:36:39.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
14:36:39.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/7/1538
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/8/1539
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.052 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/8/1539
14:36:39.053 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
14:36:39.053 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/9/1540
14:36:39.053 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1540,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a great deal of rain during the night. Wind WSW. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1486,"lock":null}
14:36:39.053 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/12/9/1540
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1540,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a great deal of rain during the night. Wind WSW. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1486,"lock":null}
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/1/1210
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1210,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Such a winters day. Blowing very hard at ESE and frosty. Wind increased to a perfect hurricane with one continuous shower of snow all day. I fear we shall have bad accounts of the shipping, many vessels being upon the coast. Dined at home and in the evening at the Mulstrum</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":883,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1156,"lock":null}
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/1/1210
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1210,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Such a winters day. Blowing very hard at ESE and frosty. Wind increased to a perfect hurricane with one continuous shower of snow all day. I fear we shall have bad accounts of the shipping, many vessels being upon the coast. Dined at home and in the evening at the Mulstrum</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":883,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1156,"lock":null}
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/10/1221
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1221,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful mild spring morning. Wind fresh at about W by S. A great deal of damage done last night amongst the shipping.</p> <p></p> <p>Lunched on board the Choice. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, being my birthday, had a party of friends consisting of J &amp; H Dale, H Harry, Mark, H Nicholas &amp; Drury &amp; spent a very pleasant day.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1167,"lock":null}
14:36:39.054 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/10/1221
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1221,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful mild spring morning. Wind fresh at about W by S. A great deal of damage done last night amongst the shipping.</p> <p></p> <p>Lunched on board the Choice. Dined at home at 5 o'clock, being my birthday, had a party of friends consisting of J &amp; H Dale, H Harry, Mark, H Nicholas &amp; Drury &amp; spent a very pleasant day.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1167,"lock":null}
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/11/1222
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1222,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful day. Quite spring weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>In consequence of late <span class=highlight_yellow>homes</span> etc last night &amp; did not breakfast &lsquo;<span class=highlight_yellow>till</span> 12 o'clock. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1168,"lock":null}
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/11/1222
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1222,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful day. Quite spring weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>In consequence of late <span class=highlight_yellow>homes</span> etc last night &amp; did not breakfast &lsquo;<span class=highlight_yellow>till</span> 12 o'clock. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":886,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1168,"lock":null}
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/2/12/1223
14:36:39.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1223,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A delightful morning. Quite spring, mild weather. A light air from about W.  Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Attended the whist club at H Harry's in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1169,"lock":null}
