14:36:39.076 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1251,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.4128694,-1.7044269,3a,75y,334.22h,84.55t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sdcOXJpS_PIRZCqIaJUw3sw!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2753-white-swan-alnwick.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>The White Swan at Alnwick</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":893,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1197,"lock":null}
14:36:39.076 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/14/1252
14:36:39.076 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1252,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":14,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind S by W. Got up early &amp; took gig to Newcastle. Joined the Alnwick coach at 10 o'clock &amp; arrived there 3 o'clock. Found a box with by blue <span class=highlight_yellow>susloop</span> etc at the White Swan. Got a billet at the Star with Potts &amp; two Reeds. Reported myself to the adjutant. Dined at the Keep at 6 o'clock &amp; in the evening went to the Theatre with Major Ogle. A very cold raw day. Heavy rain in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1198,"lock":null}
