14:36:39.082 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/22/1263
14:36:39.082 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1263,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning &amp; rather cool. Wind SE. Did not march to the pasture having been rain in the night &amp; ground very wet. Dined at the mess. Towsouille &amp; others strangers there. Afterwards went to the Bull which was very gay &amp; well attended. After the Bull, suppered with Potts</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1209,"lock":null}
