14:36:39.086 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/29/1271
14:36:39.086 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1271,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day. Wind NNE. The men delivered their clothing out store. After which they were all paid <span class=highlight_yellow>what</span> was due to them. I made ...</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1217,"lock":null}
14:36:39.086 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
