14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1271,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day. Wind NNE. The men delivered their clothing out store. After which they were all paid <span class=highlight_yellow>what</span> was due to them. I made ...</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1217,"lock":null}
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/29/1272
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1272,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... my company a present of 1/- to each man, 2/ to the corpral &amp; 21/- to the three sergeants:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got my clothes etc all packed up &amp; sent them home by Ellcots the Warkworth carrier. Dined at the mess &amp; being the last we spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day all regretting that we were to separate but hoping that we shall soon be <span class=highlight_yellow>personally</span>  called out.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Robert rode one of Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Potters</span> horses home.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1218,"lock":null}
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/29/1272
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1272,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... my company a present of 1/- to each man, 2/ to the corpral &amp; 21/- to the three sergeants:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got my clothes etc all packed up &amp; sent them home by Ellcots the Warkworth carrier. Dined at the mess &amp; being the last we spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day all regretting that we were to separate but hoping that we shall soon be <span class=highlight_yellow>personally</span>  called out.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Robert rode one of Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Potters</span> horses home.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1218,"lock":null}
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/30/1273
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1273,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NNE. Called &amp; left my card at Mr Carr's, Bondgate hall.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Mr Potts having offered me a seat in his carriage, we all lunched together at 1 o'clock at Mr Spousers. The ladies having previously been to see the castle. Started between 2 &amp; 3 o'clock &amp; reached Mr Joblings in Newcastle between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Had two glasses of spirits &amp; water which <span class=highlight_yellow>screwed</span> me. Got a gig &amp; reached Shields between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock. Called at the Mulstrum &amp; stayed there till 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1219,"lock":null}
14:36:39.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/30/1273
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1273,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind NNE. Called &amp; left my card at Mr Carr's, Bondgate hall.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Mr Potts having offered me a seat in his carriage, we all lunched together at 1 o'clock at Mr Spousers. The ladies having previously been to see the castle. Started between 2 &amp; 3 o'clock &amp; reached Mr Joblings in Newcastle between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Had two glasses of spirits &amp; water which <span class=highlight_yellow>screwed</span> me. Got a gig &amp; reached Shields between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock. Called at the Mulstrum &amp; stayed there till 4 o'clock in the morning.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1219,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/31/1274
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1274,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Did not rise till late. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Attended the whist club in the evening. Paid H Dale my contribution, this being the last night of the season &pound;1.4.6</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1220,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/31/1274
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1274,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Did not rise till late. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Attended the whist club in the evening. Paid H Dale my contribution, this being the last night of the season &pound;1.4.6</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1220,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/6/1243
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1243,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; light air at SE. Did not go to church. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1189,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/6/1243
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1243,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; light air at SE. Did not go to church. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1189,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/7/1244
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1244,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite summer weather. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS. Not yet gazetted. Bound <span class=highlight_yellow>J</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>io</span></font><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span></sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Hall</span> Beal as apprentice for 6 years at &pound;45. At the ship, carpenters still busy with the stern. Gave orders to build the cabin windows up &amp; to put up bulk heads for a sail cabin where the after lockers were. Dined on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Crives</span> with A Nicholas. At the Duke of York in the evening. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1190,"lock":null}
14:36:39.088 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/7/1244
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1244,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite summer weather. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS. Not yet gazetted. Bound <span class=highlight_yellow>J</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>io</span></font><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span></sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Hall</span> Beal as apprentice for 6 years at &pound;45. At the ship, carpenters still busy with the stern. Gave orders to build the cabin windows up &amp; to put up bulk heads for a sail cabin where the after lockers were. Dined on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Crives</span> with A Nicholas. At the Duke of York in the evening. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1190,"lock":null}
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/8/1245
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1245,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind S by W. Received a letter from Captain Crisp adj<font color=#BFBFBF>utant</font> of the regiment stating the Col<font color=#BFBFBF>onel</font> Coul<font color=#BFBFBF>son</font> having received a notification from the Duke of N<font color=#BFBFBF>orthamptonshire</font>  that my commission was preparing  &amp; that I must order my uniform etc &amp; hold myself in readiness to join. Attended a meeting at the North <span class=highlight_yellow>aems</span>, the room full, to petition both houses of parliament to pass the reform bill &amp; setting forth our approval of the measure. Went up to the ship. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS giving him a copy of the above mentioned letter. At the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1191,"lock":null}
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/8/1245
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1245,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind S by W. Received a letter from Captain Crisp adj<font color=#BFBFBF>utant</font> of the regiment stating the Col<font color=#BFBFBF>onel</font> Coul<font color=#BFBFBF>son</font> having received a notification from the Duke of N<font color=#BFBFBF>orthamptonshire</font>  that my commission was preparing  &amp; that I must order my uniform etc &amp; hold myself in readiness to join. Attended a meeting at the North <span class=highlight_yellow>aems</span>, the room full, to petition both houses of parliament to pass the reform bill &amp; setting forth our approval of the measure. Went up to the ship. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS giving him a copy of the above mentioned letter. At the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1191,"lock":null}
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/3/9/1246
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1246,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NNW. Walked out to Whitley &amp; called upon Mr J Wright &amp; returned home by Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth to dinner. Dr Drury, Charlton &amp; I had wine at Sears &amp; finished the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1192,"lock":null}
14:36:39.089 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
