14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1246,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NNW. Walked out to Whitley &amp; called upon Mr J Wright &amp; returned home by Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth to dinner. Dr Drury, Charlton &amp; I had wine at Sears &amp; finished the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1192,"lock":null}
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/1/1275
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1275,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Having been living so well for the last fortnight with the Regiment thought it necessary to take a dose of physic, therefore remained at home all the morning. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; in the evening called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1221,"lock":null}
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/1/1275
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1275,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. Having been living so well for the last fortnight with the Regiment thought it necessary to take a dose of physic, therefore remained at home all the morning. Spent the afternoon with Dr Drury &amp; in the evening called at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1221,"lock":null}
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/10/1286
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1286,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning having been showery during the night. Wind S. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; had a warm bath. Dined with J Tinley at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1232,"lock":null}
14:36:39.090 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
