14:36:39.098 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/2/1277
14:36:39.098 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1277,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very cold. Lockerand breakfasted with me &amp; we went up to Newcastle together by Duma coach. Called at Westgate Street, saw the Dixons and Emma Galbraith who was looking very well &amp; is spending her Easter holidays there. Wrote to WBS. Dined with D Dixon at Tom Fenwick in Charlotte Square. Met a party there. Slept at Miss <span class=highlight_yellow>Willi</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Bess</span></p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1223,"lock":null}
