14:36:39.099 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1299,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold morning. Wind NE. Paid into Chapmans the <span class=highlight_yellow>hote</span> for &pound;97.9. Gave Stephenson &pound;50. Got the pork, bread etc on board. Had a few friends to dine with me at 5 o'clock. <span class=highlight_yellow>veg</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Te</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nley's</span> Rudyard 15<sup>th</sup> Regiment Dick artillery J Wright &amp; Boswell.</p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1245,"lock":null}
14:36:39.099 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/22/1300
14:36:39.099 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1300,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but cool with a NE wind. Got a cask of rum on board the Hope. Ordered the men on shore as they refused to sign articles for less than &pound;3 per month. Stephenson at Newcastle clearing.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Ministries in a minority of eight upon Gen<font color=#BFBFBF>era</font>l  Gascoyne's amendment on the reform bill respecting English members. Attended a meeting at the George tavern called in consequence of the minister being in the minority for the purpose of explaining their determination to support them in their proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>grievances</span> &amp; not to give any candidate a vote until he promises to support reform.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Finished at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p><u> </u></p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1246,"lock":null}
14:36:39.099 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.100 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/22/1300
14:36:39.100 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1300,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but cool with a NE wind. Got a cask of rum on board the Hope. Ordered the men on shore as they refused to sign articles for less than &pound;3 per month. Stephenson at Newcastle clearing.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Ministries in a minority of eight upon Gen<font color=#BFBFBF>era</font>l  Gascoyne's amendment on the reform bill respecting English members. Attended a meeting at the George tavern called in consequence of the minister being in the minority for the purpose of explaining their determination to support them in their proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>grievances</span> &amp; not to give any candidate a vote until he promises to support reform.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Finished at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum.</p>\r\n<p><u> </u></p>","pageId":903,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1246,"lock":null}
14:36:39.100 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/23/1301
14:36:39.100 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1301,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold day &amp; blowing fresh from NNE &amp; sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it. Called at Chapmans, Mr Spence declines answering our note, but proposes continuing the <span class=highlight_yellow>loan</span> on my giving a bill upon WBS to have his acceptance, the <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> to be afterward agreed upon when I secure WBS's answer. Walked up to the ship, all ready for sea, excepting <span class=highlight_yellow>wind</span>. Towed her down to the low end of the town. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand in the afternoon &amp; at the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1247,"lock":null}
14:36:39.100 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
