14:36:39.101 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/24/1302
14:36:39.101 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1302,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind NNE &amp; much sea. A good deal of rain during the day. An account this morning of there being having prorogued parliament in person.  Dined at home. Took wine with the doctor &amp; finished at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1248,"lock":null}
14:36:39.101 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
