14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1303,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NNE. Paid by draft on executors account &frac12; years taxes &pound;14.7.11 &amp; on my own account {premium &pound;8.17, own account &pound;10.15, WBS &pound;5} &pound;24.12. Dined on board the Hope, H Harry &amp; Webb with me. Finished off at the Albion.</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1249,"lock":null}
14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/26/1304
14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1304,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy rainy day. Wind SE &amp; SSE. Some ships went to sea amongst them the Geronimi. We could not get men &amp; were therefore obliged to lay. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1250,"lock":null}
14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
