14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1304,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy rainy day. Wind SE &amp; SSE. Some ships went to sea amongst them the Geronimi. We could not get men &amp; were therefore obliged to lay. Dined at home. On board the Mr Shand. Spent the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":904,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1250,"lock":null}
14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/27/1305
14:36:39.102 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1305,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy &amp; rainy morning &amp; but little wind at SSW. Got our men this morning for &pound;2.17.6 per month &amp; have the ship out. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon the Hope sailed with a fresh breeze at SSE. Finished at the Albion. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1251,"lock":null}
