14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1305,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another foggy &amp; rainy morning &amp; but little wind at SSW. Got our men this morning for &pound;2.17.6 per month &amp; have the ship out. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon the Hope sailed with a fresh breeze at SSE. Finished at the Albion. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1251,"lock":null}
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/28/1306
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1306,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still dull &amp; looks like more rain. Called and saw Mr Spear who agreed to take out joint note payable at <span class=highlight_yellow>neis</span>. Leis for the loan of &pound;300 at 4 or 6 months. Wrote to WBS to that effect. Dined with the Committees of the Eligible &amp; United clubs. In the evening at the Malstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1252,"lock":null}
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/28/1306
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1306,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still dull &amp; looks like more rain. Called and saw Mr Spear who agreed to take out joint note payable at <span class=highlight_yellow>neis</span>. Leis for the loan of &pound;300 at 4 or 6 months. Wrote to WBS to that effect. Dined with the Committees of the Eligible &amp; United clubs. In the evening at the Malstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1252,"lock":null}
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/29/1307
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1307,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Went with Lockwood by Dunn's coach to Newcastle &amp; put up at the Turf Hotel where we also dined at the Wallsend Hunt dinner &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1253,"lock":null}
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/29/1307
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1307,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Went with Lockwood by Dunn's coach to Newcastle &amp; put up at the Turf Hotel where we also dined at the Wallsend Hunt dinner &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1253,"lock":null}
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/3/1278
14:36:39.103 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/3/1278
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1278,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning, but cool wind East. Took the 12 o'clock steamer &amp; got home to dinner at 2 o'clock. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; Cullercoat Sands. All immense numbers of people there. H Harry, Cunningham, Jebbs &amp; I took wine together at the Star &amp; Garter. Returned to the Sands in the evening &amp; had some <u>fun</u> there. Got home at 10 o'clock.</p>","pageId":898,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1224,"lock":null}
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/30/1308
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1308,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very rainy day. Wind continues from SE. The election for Newcastle took place. I went to the Guild Hall but I could not get near enough to the hustings to hear any part of the speeches. For Mr Ridley &amp; Mr Hodgson returned without opposition. Lucky fellows. Saw them chained. Had a lunch at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by Dunn. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":905,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1254,"lock":null}
14:36:39.104 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
