14:36:39.105 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1279,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<figure>\r\n  <a href=\"https://www.google.co.uk/maps/@55.0041194,-1.4447524,3a,75y,339.81h,100.97t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sNXfk0bvCxm_VYD96i4mOOQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?hl=en\" >\r\n    <img src=\"images/img2758-northumberland-alms-tynemouth.png\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n    <figcaption>Northumbrland Alms, Tynemouth</figcaption>\r\n  </a>\r\n</figure>","pageId":895,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":1225,"lock":null}
14:36:39.105 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1280
14:36:39.105 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1280,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind changed to WNW. Settled Robert's book &amp; paid him &pound;13.-1<sup>d</sup> my private expenses for the year up to this time. Looked into the Duke's court. Went to Tynemouth races. A great many people there. Dined at 4 o'clock at the Northumberland Alms with McBain &amp; the jury. Called in the evening at the Mulstrum. Wind changed to east.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1226,"lock":null}
14:36:39.105 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.106 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/4/1280
14:36:39.106 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1280,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind changed to WNW. Settled Robert's book &amp; paid him &pound;13.-1<sup>d</sup> my private expenses for the year up to this time. Looked into the Duke's court. Went to Tynemouth races. A great many people there. Dined at 4 o'clock at the Northumberland Alms with McBain &amp; the jury. Called in the evening at the Mulstrum. Wind changed to east.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1226,"lock":null}
14:36:39.106 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/5/1281
14:36:39.106 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1281,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. Turned out rather showery. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Jibbs &amp; afterwards went to the Sands to see the races. Lockerwood and Charlton gave us wine in the evening &amp; finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":899,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1227,"lock":null}
14:36:39.106 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
