14:36:39.107 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/4/8/1284
14:36:39.107 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1284,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with showers. Wind blowing fresh at SE. &amp; suddenly changed to SW. With most beautiful spring weather. J Cunningham &amp; I walked up to the Doctors garden &amp; round by Preston when I had some <span class=highlight_yellow>talk</span> with <span class=highlight_yellow>Moon</span>. Dined at home. Dined at home. Took a long walk in the afternoon round by Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1230,"lock":null}
