14:36:39.109 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/1/1309
14:36:39.109 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1309,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; all the appearance of more rain. Afterwards turned out a fine warm spring day. Walked to Cullercoats Sands. Ed Charlton dined with me. H Harry &amp; Sadler came in afterwards &amp; took wine. Sadler brought the account from the committee room of the Bell having retired. Finished off at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1255,"lock":null}
14:36:39.109 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
