14:36:39.109 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/10/1319
14:36:39.109 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1319,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind ENE. H Harry &amp; I walked by the river side through Howdon to Willington colliery and returned home by the turnpike.  The men at work with detachments of the yeomanry &amp; the 15<sup>th</sup> to protect them. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon walked up to Billy Mill &amp; took wine with Charlton's. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1265,"lock":null}
