14:36:39.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/16/1326
14:36:39.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1326,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. received a letter from WBS. Walked to the Doctor's garden. Gave H Harry &pound;11.7.6 which he paid for me on Saturday to Junior Hall, <span class=highlight_yellow>Brokerage</span> Archangel voyage. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine</p>","pageId":909,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1272,"lock":null}
