14:36:39.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/17/1327
14:36:39.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1327,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind S by E. H Harry Cunningham &amp; I took a long walk round by Burdon &amp; Percy Main collieries. The <span class=highlight_yellow>pitmen</span> in a very disturbed state. Dined with Dr Drury &amp; in the afternoon walked to Billy Mill to play a quoits &amp; took wine with Charlton. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1273,"lock":null}
