14:36:39.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/19/1329
14:36:39.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1329,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather, blowing fresh from the ESE. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Bradsham's</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>roping</span> in the afternoon playing at quoits &amp; took coffee in the evening at J Tinley's. Wrote to ask R B Reed of Brandon White House to spend next week with me.</p>","pageId":910,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1275,"lock":null}
