14:36:39.117 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1333,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; rather cold wind NNE. Dined with Junior Richardson &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races. Very good sport. Potts won the claret jug cards at the Mulstrum. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":911,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1279,"lock":null}
