14:36:39.118 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/24/1334
14:36:39.118 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1334,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind NE. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Lockwood dined with us &amp; we afterwards walked over to Shields races. Mostly excellent sport.</p>","pageId":912,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1280,"lock":null}
14:36:39.118 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
