14:36:39.122 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1340,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind ESE. Received a letter from WBS. At Tynemouth all the morning. Dined with Griffiths, RM &amp; Dick RA at the castle. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":913,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1286,"lock":null}
14:36:39.122 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/31/1341
14:36:39.122 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1341,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of delightful weather. Wind E by S. Took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; the Sands with Bess. Dined at 6 o'clock. At the Star &amp; Garter. With <span class=highlight_yellow>Mit</span>. Redhead who <span class=highlight_yellow>cosh</span> the dinner by <span class=highlight_yellow>locking</span> his pony to go to Eldon Square in &frac12; an hour. He did it in 33 minutes.</p>","pageId":913,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1287,"lock":null}
