14:36:39.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/4/1312
14:36:39.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1312,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine sprint morning. A light breeze at NE. Tom Smith left for Newcastle after breakfast. Took a walk to Cullercoat Sands &amp; dined with Lockwood &amp; in the evening attended the theatre to <span class=highlight_yellow>se</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow> beam</span>. At the Mustrum.</p>","pageId":906,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1258,"lock":null}
14:36:39.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
