14:36:39.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/5/9/1318
14:36:39.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1318,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most delightful day. Wind NE. Walked to Tynemouth. The mariners under <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rre</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ars</span> in case they should be wanted at the collieries. Dined at home. Drank punch on board the Douglas in the afternoon &amp; at the Musltrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":908,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1264,"lock":null}
