14:36:39.130 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/13/1354
14:36:39.130 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1354,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Received a letter yesterday from Stephenson of his arrival at <span class=highlight_yellow>Wyburg</span> on the 13<sup>th</sup> May &amp; his lower-hold being full at the date of his letter, the 20<sup>th</sup>. Went by steamer to Newcastle. I walked out to Benton to dine &amp; stay all night. Mrs Smith &amp; Fanny just arrived from Togston &amp; entered taking Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> back with them on Saturday</p>","pageId":917,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1300,"lock":null}
14:36:39.130 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
