14:36:39.132 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1360,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Went to church. Walked to Tynemouth. One company of the 60<sup>th</sup> marched for Newcastle. Lockerwood, J Rudyard &amp; Griffin dined with me at Tynemouth again in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":918,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1306,"lock":null}
