14:36:39.133 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1343,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind ENE. Walked to Tynemouth. H Harry, <span class=highlight_yellow>Neill</span> &amp; I Walked up &amp; spent the afternoon with Sadler. Returned in the evening &amp; called at the Mulstrum. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1289,"lock":null}
14:36:39.133 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/20/1361
14:36:39.133 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1361,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind about West. Gave Roberts a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans on my own account. H Harry &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle &amp; walked up to the course. The two last races very well contested. Very little company there <span class=highlight_yellow>ended</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>left</span> from <span class=highlight_yellow>there</span> usual. Dined at the Grand Stand. Walked into Newcastle again &amp; returned to Shields which we did not reach until 11 o'clock having been <span class=highlight_yellow>agreed</span> at St Peter's &amp; 3 &frac12; hours in coming down. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1307,"lock":null}
14:36:39.133 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/20/1361
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1361,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind about West. Gave Roberts a draft for &pound;5 for the house. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans on my own account. H Harry &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle &amp; walked up to the course. The two last races very well contested. Very little company there <span class=highlight_yellow>ended</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>left</span> from <span class=highlight_yellow>there</span> usual. Dined at the Grand Stand. Walked into Newcastle again &amp; returned to Shields which we did not reach until 11 o'clock having been <span class=highlight_yellow>agreed</span> at St Peter's &amp; 3 &frac12; hours in coming down. At the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1307,"lock":null}
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/21/1362
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1362,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind SW. Lunched with J Tinley who afterwards drove us up in his phaeton to the races. The <span class=highlight_yellow>racing</span> as good as could be. Returned to Tinley's to dinner at &frac12; past 7 o'clock</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1308,"lock":null}
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/21/1362
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1362,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy dull morning. Wind SW. Lunched with J Tinley who afterwards drove us up in his phaeton to the races. The <span class=highlight_yellow>racing</span> as good as could be. Returned to Tinley's to dinner at &frac12; past 7 o'clock</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1308,"lock":null}
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/22/1363
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1363,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. received a letter from Stephenson informing us of the ship's being released from quarantine on the Monday before she took the ground as she delivered in the old harbour at Mr Eade's warf. Bathed for the first time this season. Dined at home. H Harry, Richardson &amp; I went over the water to Bullocks &amp; had some <span class=highlight_yellow>peanalary</span>. At the Albion in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1309,"lock":null}
14:36:39.134 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/22/1363
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1363,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. received a letter from Stephenson informing us of the ship's being released from quarantine on the Monday before she took the ground as she delivered in the old harbour at Mr Eade's warf. Bathed for the first time this season. Dined at home. H Harry, Richardson &amp; I went over the water to Bullocks &amp; had some <span class=highlight_yellow>peanalary</span>. At the Albion in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":919,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1309,"lock":null}
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/23/1364
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1364,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind  SE having been west at night. Lunched with J Tinley who afterwards drove me, Major <span class=highlight_yellow>Garthwest</span> etc to the races which were but indifferent but attended by crowds of people. Got home to dinner at 7 o'clock in the evening. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1310,"lock":null}
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/23/1364
14:36:39.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1364,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind  SE having been west at night. Lunched with J Tinley who afterwards drove me, Major <span class=highlight_yellow>Garthwest</span> etc to the races which were but indifferent but attended by crowds of people. Got home to dinner at 7 o'clock in the evening. At the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1310,"lock":null}
14:36:39.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/24/1365
14:36:39.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1365,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine growing rain &amp; been showers during the night. Wind WNW. Glass fallen.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Paid &pound;14 into C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman'</font>s on account of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening walked to Tynemouth. At the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1311,"lock":null}
14:36:39.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
