14:36:39.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1365,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine growing rain &amp; been showers during the night. Wind WNW. Glass fallen.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Paid &pound;14 into C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman'</font>s on account of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening walked to Tynemouth. At the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1311,"lock":null}
14:36:39.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/25/1366
14:36:39.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1366,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with showers. Wind variable between NNE &amp; NNW. Received a letter from WBS from Dublin of his intention of being here tomorrow or Monday. Went over the water to enquire about the coach to York. Dined at home. Engaged writing etc. in the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening. A very rainy night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1312,"lock":null}
14:36:39.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/25/1366
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1366,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with showers. Wind variable between NNE &amp; NNW. Received a letter from WBS from Dublin of his intention of being here tomorrow or Monday. Went over the water to enquire about the coach to York. Dined at home. Engaged writing etc. in the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening. A very rainy night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1312,"lock":null}
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/26/1367
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1367,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fair. Wind fresh at N by E &amp; NNE. Crossed the water &amp; got on the coach for York westside at 8 o'clock where we arrived at 6 o'clock to dinner after a very pleasant drive without rain. Got an <span class=highlight_yellow>inside</span> in the march at &frac12; past 7 o'clock &amp; arrived at Hull at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. A beautiful moonlight night. Drank a glass of whiskey Toddy &amp; went to bed.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1313,"lock":null}
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/26/1367
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1367,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fair. Wind fresh at N by E &amp; NNE. Crossed the water &amp; got on the coach for York westside at 8 o'clock where we arrived at 6 o'clock to dinner after a very pleasant drive without rain. Got an <span class=highlight_yellow>inside</span> in the march at &frac12; past 7 o'clock &amp; arrived at Hull at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. A beautiful moonlight night. Drank a glass of whiskey Toddy &amp; went to bed.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1313,"lock":null}
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/27/1368
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1368,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. After breakfast went &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Garbertts</span>, met Stephenson on the road. Afterwards walked to the ship &amp; saw the merchant but would not freight until the ship is out. Dined on board. A heavy thunder storm in the afternoon &amp; continued to rain all day. Stephenson &amp; I in the evening walked round the docks etc &amp; finished with a glass of toddy at the <span class=highlight_yellow>Ina</span></p>","pageId":921,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1314,"lock":null}
14:36:39.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.139 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/27/1368
14:36:39.139 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1368,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind N by E. After breakfast went &amp; Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Garbertts</span>, met Stephenson on the road. Afterwards walked to the ship &amp; saw the merchant but would not freight until the ship is out. Dined on board. A heavy thunder storm in the afternoon &amp; continued to rain all day. Stephenson &amp; I in the evening walked round the docks etc &amp; finished with a glass of toddy at the <span class=highlight_yellow>Ina</span></p>","pageId":921,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1314,"lock":null}
14:36:39.139 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/28/1369
14:36:39.139 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1369,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull &amp; very sultry close morning. Wind N by W &amp; NNW. Called upon Martin Orr at the Garrison. Saw Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Garb</span><span class=highlight_yellow>utt</span> but declined fixing a foreign mail being expected &amp; the chance of freights being better. H French dined with me on board after having a long walk about the town. The ship out &amp; cleared this afternoon. Wrote to Bess B. Martin Orr &amp; his wife called upon me at the ship. Set H French <span class=highlight_yellow>part</span> of the way home &amp; amused myself the remainder of the evening by strolling round the town. Turned out a very rainy day.</p>","pageId":921,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1315,"lock":null}
14:36:39.139 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
