14:36:39.142 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/5/1346
14:36:39.142 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1346,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNE. Went to church. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Dined with J Tinley. At 5 o'clock met Cap<sup>t</sup><font color=#BFBFBF>ain</font> Glasscost &amp; L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Drickey of the <font color=#BFBFBF>HMS</font> Orestes, Major Mitchell &amp; Rudyard at the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":914,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1292,"lock":null}
