14:36:39.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1347,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning with slight rain &amp; blowing fresh from N by E &amp; good deal of sea on. Received a letter from WBS. Attended a meeting for the relief of the seamen out of employment, whose families are in great distress, subscribed a Guinea. Dined at home. Called at the Doctor's &amp; walked up to his garden &amp; spent the evening playing at quoits. At the Albion</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1293,"lock":null}
14:36:39.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/7/1348
14:36:39.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1348,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Afterwards turned out a most delightful day &amp; the wind again from the old quarter NE. Walked up to High Cheston &amp; called upon Mr Robson as bridegroom. Dined at home. At Tynemouth in the evening.. Took coffee with J Tinley.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1294,"lock":null}
14:36:39.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/7/1348
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1348,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Afterwards turned out a most delightful day &amp; the wind again from the old quarter NE. Walked up to High Cheston &amp; called upon Mr Robson as bridegroom. Dined at home. At Tynemouth in the evening.. Took coffee with J Tinley.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1294,"lock":null}
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/8/1349
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1349,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NW. Glass fallen &amp; more the appearance of rain. Received a letter from Emma Galbraith informing me of the holy days commencing on the 17<sup>th</sup>. <span class=highlight_yellow>But</span> glad to see her so much improved in her writing. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again &amp; Cullercoat Sands in the afternoon &amp; evening. At the Albion.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Towards noon the wind got into the old quarter NE again &amp; turned out a most beautiful day.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1295,"lock":null}
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/8/1349
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1349,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NW. Glass fallen &amp; more the appearance of rain. Received a letter from Emma Galbraith informing me of the holy days commencing on the 17<sup>th</sup>. <span class=highlight_yellow>But</span> glad to see her so much improved in her writing. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again &amp; Cullercoat Sands in the afternoon &amp; evening. At the Albion.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Towards noon the wind got into the old quarter NE again &amp; turned out a most beautiful day.</p>","pageId":915,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1295,"lock":null}
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/9/1350
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1350,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind W by N. Afterwards NE. H Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went again to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Saw Bess became friends again &amp; had a long walk with her. Got to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Mont</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>trcien</span> about 11 o'clock</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1296,"lock":null}
14:36:39.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1831/6/9/1350
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1350,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind W by N. Afterwards NE. H Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went again to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Saw Bess became friends again &amp; had a long walk with her. Got to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Mont</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>trcien</span> about 11 o'clock</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1296,"lock":null}
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/1/1372
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1372,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NNW. At Mr Garbutt's &amp; on board the ship. Got the remainder of her ballast. Went out with Mr Bell to dine with his partner J<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font><sup>r</sup> Wood. At Hezzle <font color=#BFBFBF>(</font><i><font color=#BFBFBF>Hessle</font></i><font color=#BFBFBF>, Hull</font><font color=#BFBFBF>),</font> met a party there</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1318,"lock":null}
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
