14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/10/1383
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1383,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after the rain, having been a good deal in the night 7 the appearance yet of more wind E by N &amp; ENE. At church in the morning. D Dixon called but we were out. Dined at home. Took tea with Messrs Harry, walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Very foggy &amp; damp. Finished at H Harry's with a glass of whiskey</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1329,"lock":null}
14:36:39.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
