14:36:39.152 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/21/1395
14:36:39.152 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1395,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Baker Kop Snowdon &amp; I walked down to <span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>aters</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ide</span> to finish, by the time we got there it began to rain heavily, which gave us a soaking. Had but poor sport. Killed about a dozen, not large but fine fish. Returned to dinner at &frac12; past 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":927,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1341,"lock":null}
