14:36:39.155 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/25/1401
14:36:39.155 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1401,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. After breakfast, Tom drove Ben &amp; I into Alnwick being fair day. Called upon Ian W Smith who with others of the family being very unwell, we did not go in. Called upon Captain <span class=highlight_yellow>Wund</span> Forster &amp; got home to dinner at 5 o'clock.</p>","pageId":928,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1347,"lock":null}
