14:36:39.156 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1402,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Walked down after breakfast to Amble &amp; fish the Granary Stream but without success. Ben G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> &amp; Rob S<font color=#BFBFBF>mith</font> with me afterwards. Ben &amp; I bathed &amp; then joined Tom at Amble. Looked over his fields there. Turnips in a very bad state. Got home to dinner at 3 o'clock. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ellenth</span> dined with us. Mrs Scott much better.</p>","pageId":929,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1348,"lock":null}
