14:36:39.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1376,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Started at 6 o'clock from the Cross Keys having taken an outside place &amp; arrived at York at 12 o'clock noon. Saw the interior of the Minster &amp; passed the afternoon in walking about the town &amp; banks of the river. Dined at the Black Swan at &frac12; past 5 o'clock and mounted the Shields mail at 9 o'clock. A fine evening.</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1322,"lock":null}
14:36:39.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/30/1407
14:36:39.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
