14:36:39.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/31/1408
14:36:39.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1408,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most delightful weather. Wind from the S &amp; E. At church in the morning. Dined at home. Lockerwood dined with me. H Harry came in &amp; took wine. At Tynemouth &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1354,"lock":null}
14:36:39.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
