14:36:39.163 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/7/8/1381
14:36:39.163 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1381,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SE. Went with WBS on board the City of Edinburgh to take his birth to London.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Bathed at 1 o'clock. Accompanied a party of officers to Wallsend and dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Hotts</span> a large party &amp; spent a very pleasant day. He was so kind as to send his carriage for us. At the Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":924,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1327,"lock":null}
