14:36:39.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1431,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind NW. Did not go to church. After lunch took a walk round by the Pier, the baths to the Itchen &amp; crossed the ferry to see PearTree Green. Returned to dinner</p>","pageId":936,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1377,"lock":null}
14:36:39.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/29/1432
14:36:39.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1432,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of delightful weather. Wind SW. Passed the morning in walking about, playing at billiards etc. Wrote to the Duke of Northumberland at court requesting him to grant me an interview &amp; complaining of my having been a second time passed for the purpose of Captains Loraiac &amp;  being placed over my head. Dined at Mr Lees</p>","pageId":936,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1378,"lock":null}
