14:36:39.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/8/30/1433
14:36:39.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1433,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind SW. Again engaged much the same as yesterday. Received a letter from Stephenson as which both Roads dated the 24<sup>th</sup> all well. The Lewis' &amp; Mr Carry dined with us. Major Falls of the 93<sup>rd</sup> &amp; Colonel Ogilvie came in the evening.</p>","pageId":936,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1379,"lock":null}
