14:36:39.180 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1454,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Slept in the house all the morning. Richmond called at 3 o'clock &amp; drove me out in his gig. Went round by Highgate &amp; Hampstead &amp; returned by Regent &amp; Hyde Park Home to dinner. Bob marsh also dined with us.</p>","pageId":943,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1400,"lock":null}
14:36:39.180 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1831/9/19/1455
14:36:39.180 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1455,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind SW. Expected Boswell up but he did not come until after I had started for the city. Went ...</p>","pageId":943,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1401,"lock":null}
