14:36:39.197 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1576,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind WSW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":982,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1520,"lock":null}
