14:36:39.203 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1587,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather still continues. Rather frosty with SW wind. Read a letter from WBS. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; Cullercoats. Dined at home. H French looked in in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1531,"lock":null}
