14:36:39.203 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/23/1588
14:36:39.203 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
14:36:39.203 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
