14:36:39.204 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1588,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; SSW. The Wallsend Harriers threw off at Tynemouth lodge H harry &amp; I went out to see them. Found a <span class=highlight_yellow>hade</span> in the plantation which they ran round by the dean &amp; lost in Hoggs garden. Dined at home, Gostling lunched with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night at the Albion &amp; with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1532,"lock":null}
14:36:39.204 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/24/1589
14:36:39.204 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
14:36:39.204 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/24/1589
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1589,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SW. Went out to South Shields. Called and left a pamphlet for Mr Hartley. Attended the court at the George. Mr Carr of Newcastle convicted of a breach of the coal <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span> act &amp; fined &pound;5. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1533,"lock":null}
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/25/1590
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
