14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/26/1591
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
14:36:39.205 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
