14:36:39.206 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/27/1592
14:36:39.206 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1592,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Frosty with showers of snow. Wind abated &amp; now from N by W &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Paid Mrs Brown &pound;6.1. by draft on Chapmans. Dined at home. Took wine with H French &amp; a party at the Albion &amp; went to the Theatre. In the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1536,"lock":null}
14:36:39.206 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
