14:36:39.206 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/28/1593
14:36:39.206 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1593,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Received the Hope's average papers from the Hope Club with the statement in very <span class=highlight_yellow>angust</span> one, not having allowed one the caulking to &pound;12.4.10. Dined at home. At Bess in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Whist Club at Mr Fenwicks, North<font color=#BFBFBF>umber</font>l<font color=#BFBFBF>an</font>d Square</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1537,"lock":null}
