14:36:39.207 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/29/1594
14:36:39.207 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1594,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather frosty. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth, the Sands &amp; Cullercoat. Mr Evington &amp; Lockwood dined with us and in the evening we went to Bess.</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1538,"lock":null}
14:36:39.207 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
