14:36:39.207 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/30/1595
14:36:39.207 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1595,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. A little frost in the air. Wind WSW. Walked up to Me Edwards dock to see Mr Evington &amp; the Alexander. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Spent the evening &amp; suppered with J H Richardson, a pleasant evening</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1539,"lock":null}
