14:36:39.208 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/1/31/1596
14:36:39.208 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1596,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather wind WSW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wine with Boswell. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; left Jobling &amp; Boswell there. Attended the assembly at the George at night. A very good one. 70 persons there</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1540,"lock":null}
14:36:39.208 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
