14:36:39.222 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/10/29/1862
14:36:39.222 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1862,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Mr Itdeston drove to Alnwick. Took the Couseiur coach to Togston. Got there to dinner a little after 3 o'clock. Tom Smith at Newcastle. The family glad to see me. A quiet rubber in the evening</p>","pageId":1023,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1805,"lock":null}
