14:36:39.243 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/12/13/1907
14:36:39.243 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1907,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The following commenced at 9 o'clock. Young took the lead &amp; kept all day 6/ ahead at the close. Dined at Barkers.</p>\r\n<p>A very rainy night</p>","pageId":1029,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1850,"lock":null}
