14:36:39.263 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1619,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Walked towards Tynemouth. Met Sadler &amp; a party, returned with them &amp; went up to the Point to dinner. Came down in the evening to the whist club. At home at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1563,"lock":null}
