14:36:39.264 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/24/1620
14:36:39.264 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1620,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Rather frosty. Wind WSW. Went over the water, called at Mr H Wright with an average bill for &pound;3.3.8 not at home. Dined at home &amp; at Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1564,"lock":null}
14:36:39.264 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
