14:36:39.265 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1622,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp cold unpleasant morning. Wind SE. Slept at D. Dixon's all night. Attended a meeting of the officers to pay the dinner bill &amp; exact fines. Took the steamer at &frac12; past 2 o'clock &amp; returned to Shields at 5 o'clock to dinner. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1566,"lock":null}
14:36:39.265 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/27/1623
14:36:39.265 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1623,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid a average bill Hope Club of &pound;14.10/- &amp; received one of &pound;3.3.8. I spent the evening with Bess. Jobling &amp; Boswell there</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1567,"lock":null}
14:36:39.265 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/27/1623
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1623,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning and cold. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid a average bill Hope Club of &pound;14.10/- &amp; received one of &pound;3.3.8. I spent the evening with Bess. Jobling &amp; Boswell there</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1567,"lock":null}
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/28/1624
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1624,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind W by S. After breakfast, H Hurry, Boswell &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle, attended the court &amp; heard the trial of the Liberty and <span class=highlight_yellow>plunter</span> when the Club of North Shields got a verdict against the latter. We afterwards dined at the Turf with Mr Richmond &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>witnessed</span>. I slept there all night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1568,"lock":null}
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/28/1624
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1624,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind W by S. After breakfast, H Hurry, Boswell &amp; I took the steamer to Newcastle, attended the court &amp; heard the trial of the Liberty and <span class=highlight_yellow>plunter</span> when the Club of North Shields got a verdict against the latter. We afterwards dined at the Turf with Mr Richmond &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>witnessed</span>. I slept there all night.</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1568,"lock":null}
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/29/1625
14:36:39.266 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1625,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. After breakfast  went  down to the Towns Court &amp; heard part of the trial in which H Wheatley was <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>defendant &amp; a verdict <font color=#BFBFBF>was </font>given against him. Walked about the town. Dined at the Turf &amp; returned to Shields by the &frac12; past 5 o'clock boat. Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1569,"lock":null}
