14:36:39.267 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/4/1600
14:36:39.267 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1600,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind  WSW blowing fresh. Wrote to WBS with a copy of the Harrisons policy got from Mr Car yesterday. Dined at home. Had some punch at the Albion with Richardson, French, Nicholson on Boswell. Called at bess. Spent the evening at the Albion with the above party.</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1544,"lock":null}
