14:36:39.268 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/5/1601
14:36:39.268 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1601,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing fresh at SW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. With Bess at night. Began to blow very hard from the SSE</p>","pageId":985,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1545,"lock":null}
