14:36:39.268 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/2/6/1602
14:36:39.268 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1602,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined at the Albion at 3 o'clock. Dinner given to H French by the party. A dull morning. Blowing hard &amp; has been all night. Nearly a gale from the SSE. Spent a very pleasant day at the theatre and the evening accepted J Tinley's bill for &pound;39 at 4 months.</p>","pageId":986,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1546,"lock":null}
