14:36:39.270 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
14:36:39.270 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/10/1635
14:36:39.270 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1635,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind variable between NW &amp; SW. Got up early &amp; went to Newcastle. Received &pound;1.4. of Mr Spencer, Hope's average. Returned to Shields to dinner but obliged by a letter from WBS to start for Newcastle again to see <span class=highlight_yellow>K Bend</span>. Got the bills returned to Shields &amp; sent them off by post to WBS. At the whist club at Doctor Drewy's</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1579,"lock":null}
14:36:39.270 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
