14:36:39.271 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/11/1636
14:36:39.271 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1636,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind WSW. Leadbottom attacked by the cholera. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock with Doctor Drewry. Leadbottom doing very well in the evening. Slept with Bess.</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1580,"lock":null}
