14:36:39.273 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1637,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind about S or S by E. Remained with Bess all day. Jobling came to dinner. Got home &amp; went to bed before 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1581,"lock":null}
14:36:39.273 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/3/13/1638
14:36:39.273 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1638,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. Wind SW. Leadbottom going on favourably, was down stairs last night. Determined not to dine with J Tindley or go to the Ball in consequence of the cholera. Dined at home. At Harrison's after &amp; with Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":991,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1582,"lock":null}
