14:36:39.315 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/18/1728
14:36:39.315 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1728,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind ___. After breakfast Reid &amp; I went by the steamer to Newcastle. Walked to the Racecourse. The running very bad. Dined at the stand. Walked back to Newcastle in the evening &amp; returned to Shields by steam. With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1672,"lock":null}
