14:36:39.316 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
14:36:39.316 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/6/21/1731
14:36:39.316 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1731,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went again to Newcastle by steam. Dined with Mr Dodds &amp; afterwards walked to the course. Poor running. Both cups won easily. The <span class=highlight_yellow>GoO</span> by Mary Cleveland &amp; the silver by Captain Potts. Returned to Mr Dodds &amp; got home by steam at 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1675,"lock":null}
14:36:39.316 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
