14:36:39.330 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/2/1743
14:36:39.330 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1743,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Beautiful weather. Wind SE. Began to canvass with Mr Bell &amp; continued at all day &amp; finished the town &amp; Tynemouth. Dined with Mr Robson at 8 o'clock, a large party including Mr bell. Spent a pleasant day.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Bathed this morning for the first time</p>","pageId":1006,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1686,"lock":null}
