14:36:39.330 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/7/20/1761
14:36:39.330 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1761,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but still blowing fresh from the NNE cold &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Engaged in getting voters to pay <span class=highlight_yellow>fees</span> &amp; taxes.  Captain Webb &amp; Mr Rippon dined with me. At the committee rooms &amp; at night with Bess.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>A letter from Stephenson</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1704,"lock":null}
