14:36:39.342 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1832/8/14/1786
14:36:39.342 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1786,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind west. Went to sea &amp; had a most delightful run to Seaham. Got our dinner on board &amp; afterwards spent a couple of hours on shore. Started at 4 o'clock &amp; turning quite calm. We did not get home until 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1012,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1729,"lock":null}
