14:36:39.477 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/5/17/2065
14:36:39.477 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
14:36:39.477 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
