14:36:39.491 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2097,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked round by the colliery &amp; Barnes. And afterwards to Amble where a Newcastle steam boat had arrived with a party. Commenced raining &amp; continued heavy for the rest of the day</p>","pageId":1082,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2037,"lock":null}
14:36:39.491 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
