14:36:39.491 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/dates/1834/6/19/2098
14:36:39.491 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2098,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Tom Smith drove Robert &amp; me to Felton <font color=#BFBFBF>where </font>we got upon the coach &amp; drove to the Race course. The sport very good. Mr Ord with Tomboy   won the gold cup again, having won it last year. Captain Potts won the Walls<font color=#BFBFBF>en</font>d Harrier Cup. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon drove me out to Benton where I dined &amp; stayed all night.</p>","pageId":1082,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2038,"lock":null}
