14:36:40.872 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1005,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day with puffs of wind at WSW. Went to Church in the morning. Stayed at home in the evening walked to Tynemouth in large afternoon blaze of company thence</p>","pageId":834,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":956,"lock":null}
