14:36:40.879 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":102,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day wind N by E. Went to Newcastle. Much disappointed in finding the Hope would not be laden in less than a fortnight or three weeks. Dined with Mr R<sup>t</sup> Airey &amp; returned home in the evening by steam</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":97,"lock":null}
