14:36:40.880 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1020,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with rain. Wind from SSW to WSW. Attended morning service. Dined at home. Sadler took his dinner with me. At Tynemouth in the evening &amp; spent an hour in the billiards room. A revolution in France</p>","pageId":838,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":971,"lock":null}
