14:36:40.882 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1025
14:36:40.882 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1025,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning having been rain during the night. Wind N by E &amp; the sea having risen put a stop to our fishery excursion. Dined at home. Hewes &amp; Robert Harry came in &amp; took wine with us. In the evening walked to Tynemouth. Suppered with H Harry</p>","pageId":840,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":976,"lock":null}
