14:36:40.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1037,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; appearance of rain. Wind NW. Received a letter from Stephenson dated Archangel  29<sup>th</sup> June &amp; 3<sup>rd</sup> July. All well. Turned out a very fine day. A Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth. J Tinley, C Meleur,AI &amp; K Harry dined with us at 5 o'clock. Finished the evening &amp; stayed all night at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":842,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":986,"lock":null}
14:36:40.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1038
14:36:40.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1038,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A Beautiful day. Wind NNE. Payed an <span class=highlight_yellow>averages</span> Hope Club &pound;10.2.1 Walked with J Tinley &amp; WBS to C <span class=highlight_yellow>Milncras</span> to dinner. Returned home in the evening</p>","pageId":842,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":987,"lock":null}
