14:36:40.890 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":104,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind changeable. From the east. Went to Tynemouth races. A great concourse of people. Poor sport. Dined afterwards with small party at Spurriers J Tenley in the chair, R Peart, H Harry, H Nicholson, J <span class=highlight_yellow>Kieenlyside</span> &amp; self</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":99,"lock":null}
