14:36:40.891 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1040,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. A fresh breeze at NNE &amp; sea upon the bar. A great many ships from Archangel &amp; America passed yesterday. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":843,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":989,"lock":null}
