14:36:40.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1045
14:36:40.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1045,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been a good deal of rain during the night. Wind west &amp; NW. William &amp; I walked to Preston to see Moor. A beautiful day. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> returned. Dined at home. In the evening walked to Tynemouth &amp; had a glass of whisky toddy with H Harry at Bell Wails.</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":993,"lock":null}
