14:36:40.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1046,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a good deal of rain during the night. Wind NW. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at the George with Mr Weatherby &amp; Mr Barker, being licencing day. A very pleasant party.</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":994,"lock":null}
