14:36:40.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1047
14:36:40.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1047,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NW. Dined at home. An idle day. A good many light ships got down. Received a letter from Stephenson of his arrival in London , the ship having sprung a leak in <font color=#BFBFBF>a </font>gale in the White sea. Made a great deal of water on her passage</p>","pageId":844,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":995,"lock":null}
