14:36:40.896 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":105,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair day, but very cold &amp; blowing strong from SSE &amp; the dust very unpleasant. Took an early dinner &amp; attended the races, better sport but not many people. Took tea at Tibbs</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":100,"lock":null}
