14:36:40.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1061
14:36:40.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1061,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind ENE.  Went by coach to Newcastle to meet Dixon, but did not settle with him. Took the steam boat &amp; landed at Walker. Saw Mrs Carr &amp; child. Dined with them &amp; returned to Shields by steam. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":847,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1009,"lock":null}
14:36:40.902 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
