14:36:40.903 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1065
14:36:40.903 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1065,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. Very heavy rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from the SSE. At church in the morning. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; I walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Saw the Hope off <span class=highlight_yellow>Sonter</span>. She soon got into the harbour. Went on board &amp; saw Stephenson. At the Duke &amp; Malstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":848,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1013,"lock":null}
