14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1075,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. 8 more keels came down. Dines at home. At the Duke in the evening</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1023,"lock":null}
14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
