14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1075,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. 8 more keels came down. Dines at home. At the Duke in the evening</p>","pageId":849,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1023,"lock":null}
14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1076
14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1076,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; blowing hard at SE. On board the Hope, got the remainder of her coals Dined at home. H Harry had <span class=highlight_yellow>pusieto</span> on board the Hope.  In the afternoon. Got the new mainsail on board &amp; bent, fits very well. Stove out this evening to go to sea, but having a foul anchor was prevented. A pity being a fierce NW wind. At the Duke.</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1024,"lock":null}
14:36:40.909 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1076
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1076,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; blowing hard at SE. On board the Hope, got the remainder of her coals Dined at home. H Harry had <span class=highlight_yellow>pusieto</span> on board the Hope.  In the afternoon. Got the new mainsail on board &amp; bent, fits very well. Stove out this evening to go to sea, but having a foul anchor was prevented. A pity being a fierce NW wind. At the Duke.</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1024,"lock":null}
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1077
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1077,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at WSW. The Hope got to sea about &frac12; past 6 o'clock. At 7 o'clock turned out &amp; walked to Tynemouth. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Pelors &pound;1.15. &amp; E Reed &frac14; wages &pound;1.8.6. Walked to Tynemouth to the sale of the Suffolk's stores. Dined at home. In the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked to the new Quay &amp; afterwards called at the Pig &amp; Whistle. Spent the evening at William Harrisons</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1025,"lock":null}
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1077
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1077,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a fresh breeze at WSW. The Hope got to sea about &frac12; past 6 o'clock. At 7 o'clock turned out &amp; walked to Tynemouth. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Pelors &pound;1.15. &amp; E Reed &frac14; wages &pound;1.8.6. Walked to Tynemouth to the sale of the Suffolk's stores. Dined at home. In the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked to the new Quay &amp; afterwards called at the Pig &amp; Whistle. Spent the evening at William Harrisons</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1025,"lock":null}
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1078
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1078,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning blowing fresh at NW. Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> came down &amp; spent the day with us. Finished the evening at H Harrys</p>","pageId":850,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1026,"lock":null}
14:36:40.910 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
