14:36:40.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1080,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; very like more rain. Wind SSW. Dined at home. After dinner walked with H Harry up to Tynemouth and took punch with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Cu</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nningham</span>. Suppered off oysters at the Marstrum</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1028,"lock":null}
