14:36:40.912 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1081,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":9,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning &amp; every appearance of rain. Wind west. Attended a court at the George &amp; lunched with Mr Hodgson. Dined at 4 o'clock with In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":851,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1029,"lock":null}
