14:36:40.915 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1086,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning. Wind SW. A great many light ships off the bar. Went to church. Dined at home. Took wine with Mr Allen. Walked to Tynemouth. In the evening. Saw Ann. H Harry spent the evening with me.</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1034,"lock":null}
