14:36:40.915 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1087,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind NW. Sent &amp; brought Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font> home. Mrs Man having died last night. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; saw the 80<sup>th</sup> inspected by General Bouverie Spent the evening with H Harry. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":852,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1035,"lock":null}
