14:36:40.918 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1092
14:36:40.918 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1092,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine morning. Wind WNW. Walked to the new quay &amp; round by Preston Lane. Dined at 3  o'clock with H Harry Miss R Fenwick, Metcalf &amp; Drury there. Spent a pleasant day. Got &pound;5 of Chapman</p>","pageId":853,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1040,"lock":null}
