14:36:40.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":11,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mr T Wright of Whitley park. Met a very large party &amp; returned to Shields at 9 o'clock &amp; went to the Theatre. Very cold day. Wind SE. Sea high</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":8,"lock":null}
14:36:40.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/110
14:36:40.922 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":110,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain last night during the day showers &amp; in the evening it came down in torrents. Wind variable from SS to NW. Not able to leave for Carlow, this morning being  Sunday, coach doesn't run, but shall start in the morning. Dined at home. At church in the morning.</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":105,"lock":null}
