14:36:40.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":110,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain last night during the day showers &amp; in the evening it came down in torrents. Wind variable from SS to NW. Not able to leave for Carlow, this morning being  Sunday, coach doesn't run, but shall start in the morning. Dined at home. At church in the morning.</p>","pageId":694,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":105,"lock":null}
14:36:40.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1100
14:36:40.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1100,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most beautiful weather. Wind SSW. The Hope arrived last night &amp; is laid upon the Lowlight shore. Did not go to church having taken a <span class=highlight_yellow>seidlity</span>. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Again in the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening at H Harry's</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1048,"lock":null}
