14:36:40.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1101
14:36:40.923 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1101,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Stephenson breakfasted with me &amp; we afterwards went by coach to Newcastle. Freights being so low I fixed the Hope to Load Holywell on my own account. Walked round by Bentow, saw Mrs Dixon &amp; proceeded to Billy Smith &amp; dined with Charlton. A wet evening</p>","pageId":855,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1049,"lock":null}
