14:36:40.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1103,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; a fresh breeze at SW Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; Elder in a sculler to the Point &amp; ate oysters &amp; spent the evening with Sadler. The Hope got 14 Keels today. A great many ships arrived</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1051,"lock":null}
14:36:40.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1104
14:36:40.924 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1104,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The fine weather continues with a fresh breeze at SW. The Hope finishes her loading &amp; took 17 Keels &amp; fine <span class=highlight_yellow>chal</span>. The 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>chat</span> over I took for the hours. Walked up to Benton to dinner. Had the beagles out &amp; killed a hare. Dixon &amp; J <span class=highlight_yellow>Jeutty</span> comfortable P.S. average Hope club &pound;2.19.2</p>","pageId":856,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1052,"lock":null}
