14:36:40.927 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1109
14:36:40.927 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1109,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning rather frosty. Wind N by W. Went to Newcastle by steam. Saw Mis Dixon &amp; Emma. The latter was taken to Miss Robertson's. I walked out with Dixon to Benton. Dined &amp; stayed all night. Received a letter from Richmond</p>","pageId":857,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1057,"lock":null}
