14:36:40.929 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1113,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning wind  light at WNW. Employed entering Hope's 2<sup>nd</sup> coal voyage in the book. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the club held at In<font color=#BFBFBF>spector</font> Dales</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1061,"lock":null}
