14:36:40.930 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1114
14:36:40.930 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1114,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather dull morning having been rain in the night. Blowing fresh at WNW. Having a bad swelled face, sent for the doctor who prescribed a dose of physic for me. Remained in the house all day. Blowing a gale of wind at NW</p>","pageId":858,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1062,"lock":null}
14:36:40.930 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
