14:36:40.942 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1138,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very fine weather. Wind NW. with frost. Walked with A Nicholson to Tynemouth. Called on Dr Drury for some <span class=highlight_yellow>cubebs</span>  having got c___d. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; in the evening called at the Malstrum to inform Seaton of my disaster</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1086,"lock":null}
