14:36:40.943 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1140,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Showering morning &amp; blowing hard from SE. Stephenson called, could not prevail on Mr Walker to send us coal down tomorrow to ensure us an earlier <span class=highlight_yellow>turey</span>. Dined at home. Got &pound;5 of chapman Took wine with I A Richardson at the Albion</p>","pageId":862,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1088,"lock":null}
14:36:40.943 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
