14:36:40.945 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1143
14:36:40.945 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1143,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Stormy weather, heavy rain &amp; blowing hard at SE Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it with an amount of rents. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; the Albion in the evening Gave notice of the Hope having 7 Keels on board</p>","pageId":863,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1091,"lock":null}
