14:36:40.945 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1143,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Stormy weather, heavy rain &amp; blowing hard at SE Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it with an amount of rents. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; the Albion in the evening Gave notice of the Hope having 7 Keels on board</p>","pageId":863,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1091,"lock":null}
14:36:40.945 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1144
14:36:40.945 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1144,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The wind still present from ESE but both it &amp; the sea much fallen. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>g</span><span class=highlight_yellow>esheding</span> a draft on chapmans for &pound;8.6.8 an average Premium Club. Walked up to Coble dean, carpenters busy with wind cap. Got 7 Keels more down, making 14. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; in the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":863,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1092,"lock":null}
