14:36:40.946 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1147
14:36:40.946 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1147,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing hard from the SE. Received an answer from Mr Coulter with the cago both for my <span class=highlight_yellow>seguaturn</span> &amp; refusing to make any allowance. Retuned it &amp; complaining of the <span class=highlight_yellow>enforshor</span> Cunningham &amp; A Nicholson dined With me on board the Hope. At the theater &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":864,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1095,"lock":null}
