14:36:40.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1153,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of much the same sort of weather with the fresh from the E &amp; E by S. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1101,"lock":null}
14:36:40.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1154
14:36:40.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1154,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been raining heavily all night &amp; still a very damp morning. Wind changed to N by W. In the house all the morning. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Suppered with H Harry</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1102,"lock":null}
14:36:40.950 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
