14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1154,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been raining heavily all night &amp; still a very damp morning. Wind changed to N by W. In the house all the morning. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Suppered with H Harry</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1102,"lock":null}
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1155
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1155,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Weather completely changed. A little sunshine at last. Wind W by N &amp; WNN. A large fleet of ships got to sea but too much swell on the bar to allow the Hope to sail, although some nearly her draught of water <span class=highlight_yellow>veateered</span> , but <span class=highlight_yellow>do</span><span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>t</span> down struck. Dined at home at the whist club at Rev<font color=#BFBFBF>erand</font> Richmonds in evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1103,"lock":null}
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1155
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1155,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Weather completely changed. A little sunshine at last. Wind W by N &amp; WNN. A large fleet of ships got to sea but too much swell on the bar to allow the Hope to sail, although some nearly her draught of water <span class=highlight_yellow>veateered</span> , but <span class=highlight_yellow>do</span><span class=highlight_yellow>w</span><span class=highlight_yellow>t</span> down struck. Dined at home at the whist club at Rev<font color=#BFBFBF>erand</font> Richmonds in evening</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1103,"lock":null}
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1156
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1156,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Although it was a most beautiful night at the home I left Rev<font color=#BFBFBF>erand</font> Richmonds &amp; frosty <span class=highlight_yellow>buk</span> soon after 12 o'clock the wind got to NE &amp; increased before daylight to a perfect gale, with heavy showers of sleet &amp; a very high sea on the bar/over</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1104,"lock":null}
14:36:40.951 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
