14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1156,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Although it was a most beautiful night at the home I left Rev<font color=#BFBFBF>erand</font> Richmonds &amp; frosty <span class=highlight_yellow>buk</span> soon after 12 o'clock the wind got to NE &amp; increased before daylight to a perfect gale, with heavy showers of sleet &amp; a very high sea on the bar/over</p>","pageId":865,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1104,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1157
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1157,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Stayed in the home all morning. Dined at home. Went to the newsroom in the afternoon. Very strong with heavy showers of snow, hail &amp; sleet. <span class=highlight_yellow>Guefal</span> got upon the Herd. Spent the evening at home. Turned out a fine clear night &amp; hard frost.</p>","pageId":866,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1105,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1157
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1157,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Stayed in the home all morning. Dined at home. Went to the newsroom in the afternoon. Very strong with heavy showers of snow, hail &amp; sleet. <span class=highlight_yellow>Guefal</span> got upon the Herd. Spent the evening at home. Turned out a fine clear night &amp; hard frost.</p>","pageId":866,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1105,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1158
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1158,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost with a little snow on the ground. Wind NW. On board the Hope &amp; the Lightning Government Steamer came down here with 150 marines for the garrison at Tynemouth. A beautiful <span class=highlight_yellow>copal</span> of elegantly fit up.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the theatre  with Hargraves beautiful &amp; bespeake of the Bachelors of <span class=highlight_yellow>Nosh</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span>. Finished off at the Albion. Sleet and rain at night.</p>","pageId":866,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1106,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1158
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1158,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost with a little snow on the ground. Wind NW. On board the Hope &amp; the Lightning Government Steamer came down here with 150 marines for the garrison at Tynemouth. A beautiful <span class=highlight_yellow>copal</span> of elegantly fit up.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home &amp; in the evening attended the theatre  with Hargraves beautiful &amp; bespeake of the Bachelors of <span class=highlight_yellow>Nosh</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span>. Finished off at the Albion. Sleet and rain at night.</p>","pageId":866,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1106,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1159
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1159,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet raw unpleasant morning. Wind W by N. The Hope got to sea in the afternoon without touching the bar, there being a great deal of sea on. Some had accounts of the ships that sailed on Saturday many struck very heavily on the bar &amp; some in consequence the crew not being able to <span class=highlight_yellow>Kup</span> them, foundered &amp; all the people drowned. At least we had an account of one &amp; another having run on shore. Dined at the Albion, a bed dance &amp; a very good one, spent a pleasant day. In visiting Bradshaw &amp; H Harry, chain &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>vi</span><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><span class=highlight_yellow>c</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span>. 12 percent</p>","pageId":866,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1107,"lock":null}
14:36:40.952 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
