14:36:40.958 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1170
14:36:40.958 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1170,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><u>Xmas day</u> After a most intense frost during the night, we have a heavy fall of snow. Wind NW. At the newsroom. Paris in a fearful state of excitement. The most fearing the decision of the peers well be in favour of the later. Herewith to WBS giving him an account of the weather here. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; dined with J Cunningham, family party. Spent a very pleasant day</p>","pageId":870,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1118,"lock":null}
