14:36:40.960 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1174
14:36:40.960 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1174,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning &amp; continuance of frost. Wind SW. Walked round by the <span class=highlight_yellow>ridges</span>, the ice so thickly covered with snow, the <span class=highlight_yellow>skating</span> bad. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; the Albion in the evening. At <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>e</span><span class=highlight_yellow>at</span><span class=highlight_yellow>re</span></p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1122,"lock":null}
