14:36:40.961 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1175
14:36:40.961 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1175,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frost this morning but slight. Mark Webb &amp; I set off to walk to Hartley with our guns, but by the time we reached Whetley it began to sleet &amp; rain so <span class=highlight_yellow>heavy</span> that we turned back but got wet before we got home. Dined at home &amp; attended the whist club in the evening. Was engaged to supper at Cheston with Lowrey but being such a stormy night did not go.</p>","pageId":871,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1123,"lock":null}
