14:36:40.969 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1191,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An unpleasant foggy morning. Wind NW. Shanks called &amp; I gave him a draft on Chapmans for &pound;18.18 his bill for new windless repairs to the Hope. Gave Stephenson a draft on Chapmans for &pound;30. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening. 5 keels came down. None yesterday.</p>","pageId":876,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1137,"lock":null}
14:36:40.969 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1192
14:36:40.969 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1192,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull foggy morning but rather frosty. Wind West. Got the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span> for the ship of Gibson. This voyage <span class=highlight_yellow>6</span> ____ @ 42/- went on board with the <span class=highlight_yellow>buf</span>. Gave <span class=highlight_yellow>Geo </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Stoss</span> &pound;2 on account. Five more keels came down this morning. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at the theatre in the evening. The last <span class=highlight_yellow>time</span> of the company performing this season. Engaged to dine with J <span class=highlight_yellow>Telbs</span> but did not go, rather unwell.</p>","pageId":877,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1138,"lock":null}
14:36:40.969 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
