14:36:40.985 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1224
14:36:40.985 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1224,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SSW. At church in the morning. Dined with H Harry. Received a letter from WBS. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1170,"lock":null}
14:36:40.985 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
