14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1224,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SSW. At church in the morning. Dined with H Harry. Received a letter from WBS. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1170,"lock":null}
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1225
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1225,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Strolled about the town until dinner at 2 o'clock at home. At the billiard room all the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1171,"lock":null}
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1225
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1225,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Strolled about the town until dinner at 2 o'clock at home. At the billiard room all the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1171,"lock":null}
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1226
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1226,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Dined at 1 o'clock with J Ridhard on board the Nautilus &amp; in the evening went to a party at J Cunningham's. Wrote a note yesterday to D Dixon requesting him to ask Colonel Coulston if he could give me any positive information about my commission.</p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1172,"lock":null}
14:36:40.986 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1226
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1226,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind SW. Dined at 1 o'clock with J Ridhard on board the Nautilus &amp; in the evening went to a party at J Cunningham's. Wrote a note yesterday to D Dixon requesting him to ask Colonel Coulston if he could give me any positive information about my commission.</p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1172,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1227
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1227,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A damp morning having been rain in the night. Wind WNW. Received a note from D Dixon, having seen Colonel Coulston who says I shall be in the regiment in a few days for a captaincy. Dined again on board the Nautilus &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1173,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1227
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1227,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A damp morning having been rain in the night. Wind WNW. Received a note from D Dixon, having seen Colonel Coulston who says I shall be in the regiment in a few days for a captaincy. Dined again on board the Nautilus &amp; at the Albion in the evening.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":887,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1173,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1228
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1228,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine morning blowing fresh at WNW. Went by the coach to Newcastle. Called at the club house to see Colonel Coulson who had left town in the morning. At D Dixons, saw Dixon &amp; the ladies. Called on young Bigger who gave me the names of the trader men in London who have the regulation patterns. Walked down from Newcastle. Met Dr Drury &amp; Mr Harrison near Mr Robson who were on their way to dine with Saddler at the Point &amp; prevailed on me to accompany them. At the whist club &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1174,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1228
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1228,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine morning blowing fresh at WNW. Went by the coach to Newcastle. Called at the club house to see Colonel Coulson who had left town in the morning. At D Dixons, saw Dixon &amp; the ladies. Called on young Bigger who gave me the names of the trader men in London who have the regulation patterns. Walked down from Newcastle. Met Dr Drury &amp; Mr Harrison near Mr Robson who were on their way to dine with Saddler at the Point &amp; prevailed on me to accompany them. At the whist club &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1174,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1229
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1229,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>Received a letter from WBS &amp; after breakfast went on board the Jane at his request to see Mr Brown to desire him not to clear the Harmony or of cleared to order the master to stop below Gravesend until after the 1 March when the coal duties are to be taken off.</p> <p></p> <p>Attended a meeting at the Commercial &amp; entered into resolutions to be followed up by petitions against the proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>carecase</span> of duty upon north American timber.</p> <p></p> <p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Suppered with H harry</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1175,"lock":null}
14:36:40.987 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1229
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1229,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind WNW.</p> <p></p> <p>Received a letter from WBS &amp; after breakfast went on board the Jane at his request to see Mr Brown to desire him not to clear the Harmony or of cleared to order the master to stop below Gravesend until after the 1 March when the coal duties are to be taken off.</p> <p></p> <p>Attended a meeting at the Commercial &amp; entered into resolutions to be followed up by petitions against the proposed <span class=highlight_yellow>carecase</span> of duty upon north American timber.</p> <p></p> <p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Suppered with H harry</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1175,"lock":null}
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/123
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":123,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind still from the North. Did not go to church. Read the service at home. Received a letter from William remitting a &pound;50 Bank Post bill. Took a long walk with Mr Vernon along the Athy road &amp; returned to dinner at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. The boys again with us. W W Fishbrown called upon me</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":113,"lock":null}
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/123
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":123,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day. Wind still from the North. Did not go to church. Read the service at home. Received a letter from William remitting a &pound;50 Bank Post bill. Took a long walk with Mr Vernon along the Athy road &amp; returned to dinner at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. The boys again with us. W W Fishbrown called upon me</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":113,"lock":null}
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1230
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1230,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Wrote to WBS to order all my clothes etc. for the North<font color=#BFBFBF>humbria</font> Regiment immediately, should I be in the <span class=highlight_yellow>Gagelle</span> which is expected. Took wine at the Albion with W C Wright etc. &amp; attended the club at Dr Drury's in the evening.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1176,"lock":null}
14:36:40.988 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1230
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1230,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Wrote to WBS to order all my clothes etc. for the North<font color=#BFBFBF>humbria</font> Regiment immediately, should I be in the <span class=highlight_yellow>Gagelle</span> which is expected. Took wine at the Albion with W C Wright etc. &amp; attended the club at Dr Drury's in the evening.</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":888,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1176,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1231
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1231,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p><p>Withdrew the &pound;500 insurance on the Hope from the Great Premium Club &amp; put it into the Eligible making &pound;1000 in that club. Left a written notice with Bulmers clerk to that effect.</p> <p></p> <p>A good deal of rain this evening.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1177,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1231
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1231,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p><p>Withdrew the &pound;500 insurance on the Hope from the Great Premium Club &amp; put it into the Eligible making &pound;1000 in that club. Left a written notice with Bulmers clerk to that effect.</p> <p></p> <p>A good deal of rain this evening.</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1177,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1232
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1232,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine day. Wind NNW. Must have been in the night NNE there being a deal of sea on the bar. Went to church in the morning. Sadler dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine with us. At the Multrum in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1178,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1232
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1232,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine day. Wind NNW. Must have been in the night NNE there being a deal of sea on the bar. Went to church in the morning. Sadler dined with me &amp; H Harry came in &amp; took wine with us. At the Multrum in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1178,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1233
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1233,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Much disappointed at not finding my name in the Gazette. Took a long walk with Cunningham round by Preston, Whitley, Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth. Wrote to WBS with an account of <span class=highlight_yellow>units</span>. Dined at Jebbs at 5 o'clock, a gentleman's party &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1179,"lock":null}
14:36:40.989 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1233
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1233,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Much disappointed at not finding my name in the Gazette. Took a long walk with Cunningham round by Preston, Whitley, Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth. Wrote to WBS with an account of <span class=highlight_yellow>units</span>. Dined at Jebbs at 5 o'clock, a gentleman's party &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1179,"lock":null}
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1234
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1234,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Blowing hard half a gale from NNE &amp; has been rain or snow during the night. Called upon the <span class=highlight_yellow>messrs</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Hdestorns</span>  at Mr Reeds. Dined at home &amp; in the evening went to the assembly which was a very good one. About 68 there. Got home at 4 o'clock. Paid Brown 16/ my subscription</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1180,"lock":null}
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1234
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1234,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>Blowing hard half a gale from NNE &amp; has been rain or snow during the night. Called upon the <span class=highlight_yellow>messrs</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>Hdestorns</span>  at Mr Reeds. Dined at home &amp; in the evening went to the assembly which was a very good one. About 68 there. Got home at 4 o'clock. Paid Brown 16/ my subscription</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1180,"lock":null}
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1235
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1235,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. Received a letter from WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Called upon &amp; had lunch with Jibbs. Dined at 5 o'clock with H Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1181,"lock":null}
14:36:40.990 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1235
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1235,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. Received a letter from WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Called upon &amp; had lunch with Jibbs. Dined at 5 o'clock with H Dale &amp; spent a very pleasant day</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":889,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1181,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1236
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1236,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS with his note for &pound;95.10 enclosed. Dined at home. Mr Lockwood to his dinner with me. In the evening at the club. The Samarang frigate got orders to go to <span class=highlight_yellow>Chathace</span> &amp; take all the mariners</p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1182,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1236
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1236,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS with his note for &pound;95.10 enclosed. Dined at home. Mr Lockwood to his dinner with me. In the evening at the club. The Samarang frigate got orders to go to <span class=highlight_yellow>Chathace</span> &amp; take all the mariners</p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1182,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1237
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1237,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing hard at WNW. The Samarang frigate sailed at 1 o'clock. Dined at home. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Twigell</span> &pound;2.14. <span class=highlight_yellow>tharp</span> 15/ <span class=highlight_yellow>coates</span> &pound;1.15/ <span class=highlight_yellow>Tygack</span> &pound;1.8. all for the Hope. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1183,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1237
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1237,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Blowing hard at WNW. The Samarang frigate sailed at 1 o'clock. Dined at home. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Twigell</span> &pound;2.14. <span class=highlight_yellow>tharp</span> 15/ <span class=highlight_yellow>coates</span> &pound;1.15/ <span class=highlight_yellow>Tygack</span> &pound;1.8. all for the Hope. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum in the evening.</p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1183,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1238
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1238,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A dull rainy morning. Wind NE. Received the Hope's <span class=highlight_yellow>assales</span> from WBS. Took the 11 o'clock steam boat &amp; went to Newcastle. Called to see Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Could learn nothing further with regard to our conversation. All as much in the dark &amp; suspense as myself. Saw Dixon &amp; the ladies in Westgate Street where I lunched. Received of the <span class=highlight_yellow>Hind</span><span class=highlight_yellow>h</span><span class=highlight_yellow>augh</span> &pound;36.0.9 being the difference between what the Hope made &amp; 11/- freight applied. Returned by steam by the 4 o'clock boat &amp; came home to dinner. Attended the club at Tibb's in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1184,"lock":null}
14:36:40.991 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:40.992 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1238
14:36:40.992 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1238,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A dull rainy morning. Wind NE. Received the Hope's <span class=highlight_yellow>assales</span> from WBS. Took the 11 o'clock steam boat &amp; went to Newcastle. Called to see Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Could learn nothing further with regard to our conversation. All as much in the dark &amp; suspense as myself. Saw Dixon &amp; the ladies in Westgate Street where I lunched. Received of the <span class=highlight_yellow>Hind</span><span class=highlight_yellow>h</span><span class=highlight_yellow>augh</span> &pound;36.0.9 being the difference between what the Hope made &amp; 11/- freight applied. Returned by steam by the 4 o'clock boat &amp; came home to dinner. Attended the club at Tibb's in the evening</p> <p></p></p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1184,"lock":null}
14:36:40.992 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1239
14:36:40.992 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1239,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><p>A thick damp morning. Wind SW. Did not go to church. Dined at home. In the evening at the Abbey &amp; Mulstrums</p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>\r\n<p><p></p></p>","pageId":890,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1185,"lock":null}
