14:36:40.995 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1243,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning &amp; light air at SE. Did not go to church. Dr Drury dined with me &amp; H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine. At the Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1189,"lock":null}
14:36:40.995 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1244
14:36:40.995 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1244,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite summer weather. Wind NW. Received a letter from WBS. Not yet gazetted. Bound <span class=highlight_yellow>J</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span></font><span class=highlight_yellow>n</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>io</span></font><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>r</span></sup> <span class=highlight_yellow>Hall</span> Beal as apprentice for 6 years at &pound;45. At the ship, carpenters still busy with the stern. Gave orders to build the cabin windows up &amp; to put up bulk heads for a sail cabin where the after lockers were. Dined on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Crives</span> with A Nicholas. At the Duke of York in the evening. Received a letter from WBS</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1190,"lock":null}
14:36:40.995 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
