14:36:40.996 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1246,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NNW. Walked out to Whitley &amp; called upon Mr J Wright &amp; returned home by Cullercoats &amp; Tynemouth to dinner. Dr Drury, Charlton &amp; I had wine at Sears &amp; finished the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":892,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1192,"lock":null}
14:36:40.996 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1247
14:36:40.996 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1247,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day. Wind SW. Went to Newcastle by steam &amp; ordered coals down on Monday. Enrolled <span class=highlight_yellow>H A </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Bealls</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>interviews</span> at the Custom House. Returned home to dinner. Dr Drewry &amp; Chartson dined with me. At the club in the evening.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1193,"lock":null}
14:36:40.996 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
