14:36:40.999 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1254,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":15,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cold evening. Appearance of rain. Wind SSW. Attended drill at 10 o'clock for an hour &amp; half. <span class=highlight_yellow>Portmonteau</span> arrived from town with my red coat etc. Attended drill at 2 o'clock again but for a short time in consequence of the rain. Turned out a very wet day. Dined at Messrs at 6 o'clock &amp; sat rather late.</p>","pageId":893,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1200,"lock":null}
