14:36:41.003 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1261,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather continues very fine. Parade as usual at 10 o'clock in the pasture &amp; again at 2 o'clock. Dined at mess. A large party, being stranger day. Mr Bussale of Broom, <span class=highlight_yellow>Pard</span> &amp; others there. Took tea with William Forster</p>","pageId":894,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1207,"lock":null}
