14:36:41.005 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1264
14:36:41.005 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1264,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold morning. Wind NE. At morning drill marched to the pasture &amp; back. Wrote to WBS &amp; attended afternoon parade at 2 o'clock in the pasture. Dined with <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> D </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Sucth</span></p>","pageId":895,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1210,"lock":null}
