14:36:41.006 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1267
14:36:41.006 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1267,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning. Wind E but with heavy showers of rain &amp; sleet. Continued raining very heavy all day, so that we could not have any parade. Dined at the mess</p>","pageId":896,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1213,"lock":null}
