14:36:41.009 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1272
14:36:41.009 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1272,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... my company a present of 1/- to each man, 2/ to the corpral &amp; 21/- to the three sergeants:</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got my clothes etc all packed up &amp; sent them home by Ellcots the Warkworth carrier. Dined at the mess &amp; being the last we spent a very pleasant &amp; jolly day all regretting that we were to separate but hoping that we shall soon be <span class=highlight_yellow>personally</span>  called out.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Robert rode one of Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Potters</span> horses home.</p>","pageId":897,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1218,"lock":null}
14:36:41.009 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
