14:36:41.013 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/128
14:36:41.013 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":128,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This day rather cooler. Wind NW with showers of rain. Engaged again all the morning in packing up &amp; separating the books that I take to England from those for sale. Called upon Dr Reed &amp; Dr Home. Dined at Mr Vernon's with the boys Received letter from fanny Smith</p>","pageId":695,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":118,"lock":null}
14:36:41.013 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
