14:36:41.016 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1286,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning having been showery during the night. Wind S. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon &amp; had a warm bath. Dined with J Tinley at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":900,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1232,"lock":null}
