14:36:41.018 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1291
14:36:41.018 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1291,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. The Hope arrived at 5 o'clock am. Went by Duma coach to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell &amp; Brown being the readiest time &amp; all other collieries being off work excepting Wellington, <span class=highlight_yellow>Pontop</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Jaasects</span>. Wrote to WBS. Dined at the Geo<font color=#BFBFBF>rge</font> Tavern being the annual dinner of the whist club.</p>","pageId":901,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1237,"lock":null}
