14:36:41.019 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1293
14:36:41.019 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1293,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning. Wind NW. Took a walk with H Harry up to the Hope, taking out the dung at Smiths Crane, proceeded round by Burdon Main, Chirton &amp; Dr Drury's garden. Home to dinner. In the afternoon again walked up to the Doctors garden. Played at Quoits &amp; finished the evening at the Albion</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1239,"lock":null}
