14:36:41.020 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1295
14:36:41.020 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1295,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":4,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The same sort of weather. Wind changeable. Went to Newcastle by Dunns coach. The collieries all off work, could get no coal. Took the Hope off Bell &amp; Brown's list. Returned by steam. Dined at home. In the afternoon at the news &amp; billiard rooms &amp; finished the evening at the Albion &amp; Mulstrum. H Harry wrote to Hull for a <span class=highlight_yellow>Wybung</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>chailer</span> for me.</p>","pageId":902,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1241,"lock":null}
