14:36:41.030 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1313
14:36:41.030 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1313,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning &amp; at last a change of wind having got from the NW. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; from thence by the sands to Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Weight. Wind changes to NNE with heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in one of which I was caught &amp; got nearly wet through.  Returned home to dinner. Spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":907,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1259,"lock":null}
