14:36:41.030 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1314,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":5,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but cold. Wind NW. heavy changed from NE from which <span class=highlight_yellow>ash</span> it has been blowing fresh all night with a heavy sea. Dined at home. At Dr Drury's in the afternoon &amp; in the evening went to the theatre, but the house was so badly attended that <span class=highlight_yellow>Kean</span> would not perform. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":907,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1260,"lock":null}
