14:36:41.049 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1352,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. The rain will do great good. The country being much in want of it. Wind E by S. Dined at home. Spent the afternoon on board the Telemachus, with Mr Bradshaw. At the Albion &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1298,"lock":null}
14:36:41.049 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1353
14:36:41.049 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1353,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW but in the middle of the day again changed to SE. Did not go to church. Dined at home. In the afternoon walked to Billy Mill &amp; took wine with Charlton. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening &amp; afterwards at the Commercial &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":916,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1299,"lock":null}
14:36:41.049 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
