14:36:41.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1358,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind about West. Received a letter from WBS from Carlow &amp; clear Stephenson's letter from Wyburg of his being loaded. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with H Harry. At the Duke of York &amp; Mulstrum</p>","pageId":918,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1304,"lock":null}
14:36:41.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1359
14:36:41.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1359,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SSW. A shower of rain about 1 o'clock. L<font color=#BFBFBF>ieutenan</font><sup>t</sup> Griffin RM took his dinner with me &amp; Webb came along afterwards. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. P<font color=#BFBFBF>ai</font><sup>d</sup> E Reid's mother &pound;2.6.9 balance of <span class=highlight_yellow>gegarayers</span> wages</p>","pageId":918,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1305,"lock":null}
14:36:41.051 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
