14:36:41.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1365,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine growing rain &amp; been showers during the night. Wind WNW. Glass fallen.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Paid &pound;14 into C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman'</font>s on account of ex<font color=#BFBFBF>ecut</font>ors. Dined at home. At the Albion in the afternoon &amp; in the evening walked to Tynemouth. At the Mulstrum at night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1311,"lock":null}
14:36:41.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1366
14:36:41.055 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1366,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with showers. Wind variable between NNE &amp; NNW. Received a letter from WBS from Dublin of his intention of being here tomorrow or Monday. Went over the water to enquire about the coach to York. Dined at home. Engaged writing etc. in the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening. A very rainy night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1312,"lock":null}
