14:36:41.056 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1366,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy day with showers. Wind variable between NNE &amp; NNW. Received a letter from WBS from Dublin of his intention of being here tomorrow or Monday. Went over the water to enquire about the coach to York. Dined at home. Engaged writing etc. in the afternoon &amp; at the Albion in the evening. A very rainy night.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1312,"lock":null}
14:36:41.056 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1367
14:36:41.056 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1367,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fair. Wind fresh at N by E &amp; NNE. Crossed the water &amp; got on the coach for York westside at 8 o'clock where we arrived at 6 o'clock to dinner after a very pleasant drive without rain. Got an <span class=highlight_yellow>inside</span> in the march at &frac12; past 7 o'clock &amp; arrived at Hull at &frac12; past 12 o'clock. A beautiful moonlight night. Drank a glass of whiskey Toddy &amp; went to bed.</p>","pageId":920,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1313,"lock":null}
