14:36:41.058 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1371,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":6,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NNW. Breakfasted with Orr &amp; his wife at the Garrison. Saw the armoury containing the arms of all the local militias etc of the district, about 20000. Walked up to the ship, a <span class=highlight_yellow>lighter</span> up with 40 tons of ballast. At Garbutt's, Wade not having got the deal <span class=highlight_yellow>counted</span> are unable to settle the freight. Dined on board. Walked about the town &amp; docks in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening with Orr. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":922,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1317,"lock":null}
