14:36:41.060 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1376
14:36:41.060 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1376,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":3,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Started at 6 o'clock from the Cross Keys having taken an outside place &amp; arrived at York at 12 o'clock noon. Saw the interior of the Minster &amp; passed the afternoon in walking about the town &amp; banks of the river. Dined at the Black Swan at &frac12; past 5 o'clock and mounted the Shields mail at 9 o'clock. A fine evening.</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1322,"lock":null}
14:36:41.060 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
