14:36:41.060 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1377
14:36:41.060 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1377,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind with the heat got to ENE. Arrived at Shields at 7 o'clock. Crossed the water &amp; got home in time to go to the Low Lights &amp; bath before breakfast. Dined at home. Being excessively sleepy, turned into bed for three hours. Walked after tea up to Preston through the fields to examine them &amp; see <span class=highlight_yellow>moors</span>. Went to the theatre in the evening &amp; afterwards called at the Mulstrum to see Bess</p>","pageId":923,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1323,"lock":null}
