14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1384,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind ESE. Very foggy. Ben &amp; I got on board a steamer &amp; went to Newcastle. Saw D Dixon. I walked with him out to Benton, dined &amp; in the evening walked through the country to Shields. Called at the Mustrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1330,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1385
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1385,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind ENE. Paid Gibson butcher. Wyburg &pound;8.6/-. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards out to Preston &amp; dined with Mr Wright. Walked home again in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1331,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1385
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1385,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of foggy weather. Wind ENE. Paid Gibson butcher. Wyburg &pound;8.6/-. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards out to Preston &amp; dined with Mr Wright. Walked home again in the evening. Called at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1331,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1386
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1386,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy &amp; damp morning. Wind NE. Cleared away towards noon. I joined Mr Ilderton &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>ofserted</span> in his <span class=highlight_yellow>canses</span> also promised him my vote. Dined with him &amp; party at the George at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1332,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1386
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1386,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant foggy &amp; damp morning. Wind NE. Cleared away towards noon. I joined Mr Ilderton &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>ofserted</span> in his <span class=highlight_yellow>canses</span> also promised him my vote. Dined with him &amp; party at the George at 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1332,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1387
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1387,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with the appearance of showers having been showers during the night. Wind SE. Ben Galbraith &amp; Robert set off in Dunn's gig to catch the Alnwick coach at Newcastle for Felton where Tom Smith's phaeton will meet them. I could not go having promised to continue my assistance to Mr Ilderton all day &amp; very successful. Sat down to dinner at 5 o'clock. Called at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1333,"lock":null}
14:36:41.065 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1387
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1387,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning with the appearance of showers having been showers during the night. Wind SE. Ben Galbraith &amp; Robert set off in Dunn's gig to catch the Alnwick coach at Newcastle for Felton where Tom Smith's phaeton will meet them. I could not go having promised to continue my assistance to Mr Ilderton all day &amp; very successful. Sat down to dinner at 5 o'clock. Called at the Albion in the evening.</p>","pageId":925,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1333,"lock":null}
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1388
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1388,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning &amp; been some rain. Wind ENE. A very heavy rain for an hour or so which prevented us beginning our canvas until near 11 o'clock commencing at the Wooden bridge &amp; canvassed all the upper part of the town. Milburn Place etc and were very successful. Lunched at Mr Barkers &amp; canvassed Tynemouth in the evening. Dined at 8 o'clock &amp; spent a jolly evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1334,"lock":null}
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1388
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1388,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning &amp; been some rain. Wind ENE. A very heavy rain for an hour or so which prevented us beginning our canvas until near 11 o'clock commencing at the Wooden bridge &amp; canvassed all the upper part of the town. Milburn Place etc and were very successful. Lunched at Mr Barkers &amp; canvassed Tynemouth in the evening. Dined at 8 o'clock &amp; spent a jolly evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1334,"lock":null}
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1389
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1389,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfasted early &amp; took the 8 o'clock steamer for Newcastle &amp; at 1 o'clock got upon the coach for Felton where I arrived at a little after 1 o'clock. Had an early dinner &amp; afterwards borrowed a nod of Melrose &amp; had a few hours fishing but little success. Walked down in the cool of the evening to Togston. Got there at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Found the Clutterbucks dining there.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1335,"lock":null}
14:36:41.066 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
