14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1389,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Breakfasted early &amp; took the 8 o'clock steamer for Newcastle &amp; at 1 o'clock got upon the coach for Felton where I arrived at a little after 1 o'clock. Had an early dinner &amp; afterwards borrowed a nod of Melrose &amp; had a few hours fishing but little success. Walked down in the cool of the evening to Togston. Got there at &frac12; past 6 o'clock. Found the Clutterbucks dining there.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1335,"lock":null}
14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/139
14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":139,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind WSW &amp; heavy showers of rain. Engaged part of the morning packing. Took a long walk with Mr Vernon &amp; returned to dinner</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":129,"lock":null}
