14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1390
14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1390,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind SW. Accompanied the family to church at Warkworth. We <span class=highlight_yellow>gin</span> then amused ourselves strolling about until dinner time. Mr Burn came up to <span class=highlight_yellow>wine</span> &amp; spent the evening.</p>","pageId":926,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1336,"lock":null}
14:36:41.067 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
