14:36:41.071 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/14
14:36:41.071 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":14,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott. Spent the evening with the Whist club. Lost 4/-. Wind SE with frost. Wrote to Sir D Smith</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":11,"lock":null}
