14:36:41.072 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":140,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Engaged in the morning at the house. Left Carlow about 2 o'clock in a post chase with Mr Vernon for Broomville where we arrived at dinner</p>","pageId":696,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":130,"lock":null}
