14:36:41.075 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1405
14:36:41.075 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1405,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":28,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... to London &amp;see the Duke told Colonel Coulson it was my intention. Went to the courts, excessively hot, glad to get out again after strolling about with T<font color=#BFBFBF>om</font> Smith &amp; Dixon. Returned to Shields to dinner at 5 o'clock. Attended Mr Alderton's Committee room in the evening. At the Albion &amp; Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1351,"lock":null}
