14:36:41.076 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1406,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but very hot weather. Gave a draft on <span class=highlight_yellow>Cols</span> for balance of Premium and Hope clubs &pound;4.7.1 also a draft for &pound;6.15 <span class=highlight_yellow>momo</span> to be paid tomorrow. Attended Mr Ilderton's Committee room and came <span class=highlight_yellow>after</span> Lenskill Street. Dined at home. At the Committee Room again in the afternoon. A fine shower of rain in the afterwards. At the theatre &amp; Mulstrum in the evening</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1352,"lock":null}
