14:36:41.076 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1407,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but very hot wind ESE. Had a cold bath in the sea before breakfast. Paid the people there <span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> &pound;5.15/-. At the Committee Room &amp; canvassing. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. Finished at the Albion.</p>","pageId":930,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1353,"lock":null}
