14:36:41.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":143,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning with fine spring showers. Left Captain Butlers &amp; returned to Carlow. Mr Vernon &amp; I dined at Mr Butlins &amp; met a very pleasant party</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":133,"lock":null}
14:36:41.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1430
14:36:41.087 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1430,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":8,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. We arrived at Southampton at &frac12; past 5 o'clock, very much fatigued having been waiting to sleep or lay on deck all night. After waiting two hours &amp; a half at the custom house, we were obliged to go home to breakfast without our luggage. Dined at the Lewises at Shirley. Colonel Ogilvie &amp; Captain Cobb there.</p>","pageId":935,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1376,"lock":null}
