14:36:41.092 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":144,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers day. Went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Free</span> Church in the morning &amp; afterwards walked to Crossleigh with the boys. Dined at the Jamesons</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":134,"lock":null}
14:36:41.092 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1440
14:36:41.092 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1440,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW &amp; warm. Took the Paddington Stage into the city. Went to the office, nothing there, at the Coal Exchange. Saw there Brown &amp; Fenwick. Walked out of the city. Called upon Bob Marsh, strolled round by Pall Mall, St James's Street &amp; Piccadilly to Richmond's to dinner.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Got to Nottingham place at &frac12; past 10 o'clock &amp; found WBS Mary &amp; Lee had arrived.</p>","pageId":938,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1386,"lock":null}
14:36:41.092 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
