14:36:41.093 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1442,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant morning. Heavy showers all day. Wind SW. Took a walk &amp; called upon Mr Lenskill &amp; Mr Ward. Met Captain Shepherd in the Burley Tea Arcade who has got appointed to the <font color=#BFBFBF>HMS </font>Melville 74 &amp; going out to the East Indies with <font color=#BFBFBF>admiral </font>Sir J<font color=#BFBFBF>ohn</font> Gore. Dined with Richmond at 6 o'clock to meet Mr &amp; Mrs Hoffman alias Mary Fletcher, his sister &amp; J Wrights</p>","pageId":939,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1388,"lock":null}
