14:36:41.099 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1455,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Rather cloudy. Wind SW. Expected Boswell up but he did not come until after I had started for the city. Went ...</p>","pageId":943,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1401,"lock":null}
