14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1477,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still blowing hard from the SSW. Several light ships got down &amp; must have had a good run. Lockwood &amp; I walked round by Tynemouth. H Nicholson &amp; Mark dined with me at 3 o'clock. In the evening attended <span class=highlight_yellow>Aldertons</span> Committee room &amp; afterwards with Bess</p>","pageId":952,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1423,"lock":null}
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1478
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1478,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind SW &amp; still looks like more rain. Walked to Preston to see Moor's brother who had not come down. Dined on board the Crisis with A Nicholson. In the evening we walked to Tynemouth at night with Bess</p>","pageId":952,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1424,"lock":null}
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
