14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1478,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind SW &amp; still looks like more rain. Walked to Preston to see Moor's brother who had not come down. Dined on board the Crisis with A Nicholson. In the evening we walked to Tynemouth at night with Bess</p>","pageId":952,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1424,"lock":null}
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1479
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1479,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind during the day varying between SE &amp; SE. At church in the morning. Saw Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Spencer</span> yesterday who agreed to renew our bill upon our rubbing off &pound;100 or &pound;150. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Called at Cunningham's Dr Drury there &amp; had some excellent glenlivet with them. Called afterwards at the castle, sat with the Marines &amp; at night again with Bess</p>","pageId":952,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1425,"lock":null}
14:36:41.112 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
