14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1479,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind during the day varying between SE &amp; SE. At church in the morning. Saw Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Spencer</span> yesterday who agreed to renew our bill upon our rubbing off &pound;100 or &pound;150. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon. Called at Cunningham's Dr Drury there &amp; had some excellent glenlivet with them. Called afterwards at the castle, sat with the Marines &amp; at night again with Bess</p>","pageId":952,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1425,"lock":null}
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/148
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":148,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Vernon &amp; I left Carlow by coach. Found it afterwards extremely hot &amp; dusty. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock &amp; dined with Sir C Vernon. Put up at Mackens Hotel</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":138,"lock":null}
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/148
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":148,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Vernon &amp; I left Carlow by coach. Found it afterwards extremely hot &amp; dusty. Got to Dublin at 5 o'clock &amp; dined with Sir C Vernon. Put up at Mackens Hotel</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":138,"lock":null}
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1480
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1480,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A letter from WBS</p>\r\n<p>A mild morning. Wind SW. A party of us went to Cullercoat Sands &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>found</span> ourselves at Rifle &amp; Pistol shooting at a target. Lunched at the castle &amp; at 4 o'clock dined with J Redhead &amp; Lockwood at the lodgings. I sent them a pair of soles. At night with Bess</p>\r\n<p>This days papers brought an account of the Reform Bill being thrown out of the Lords by a majority of 41. The debate did not conclude till &frac12; past 6 in the morning. Much excitement in London.</p>\r\n<p>A rainy afternoon &amp; night</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1426,"lock":null}
14:36:41.113 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1480
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1480,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A letter from WBS</p>\r\n<p>A mild morning. Wind SW. A party of us went to Cullercoat Sands &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>found</span> ourselves at Rifle &amp; Pistol shooting at a target. Lunched at the castle &amp; at 4 o'clock dined with J Redhead &amp; Lockwood at the lodgings. I sent them a pair of soles. At night with Bess</p>\r\n<p>This days papers brought an account of the Reform Bill being thrown out of the Lords by a majority of 41. The debate did not conclude till &frac12; past 6 in the morning. Much excitement in London.</p>\r\n<p>A rainy afternoon &amp; night</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1426,"lock":null}
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1481
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1481,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind W by S. Dined with H Nicholson on board the Crisis. J Wight, J Redhead &amp; Lockwood there. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1427,"lock":null}
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
