14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1481,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind W by S. Dined with H Nicholson on board the Crisis. J Wight, J Redhead &amp; Lockwood there. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1427,"lock":null}
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1482
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1482,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Went up in a gig to Newcastle. Called &amp; saw Emma Galbraith who was looking well. Payed Mrs Noakes for Emma G's board and education up to June &pound;39.10/-. Afterwards walked out to Benton where I dined &amp; stayed all night. Dixon Clark there, he slept in Newcastle to take the coach in the morning for Oxford. Tom Smith left them in the morning for Togston</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1428,"lock":null}
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1482
14:36:41.114 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1482,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Went up in a gig to Newcastle. Called &amp; saw Emma Galbraith who was looking well. Payed Mrs Noakes for Emma G's board and education up to June &pound;39.10/-. Afterwards walked out to Benton where I dined &amp; stayed all night. Dixon Clark there, he slept in Newcastle to take the coach in the morning for Oxford. Tom Smith left them in the morning for Togston</p>","pageId":953,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1428,"lock":null}
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1483
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1483,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful mild weather. Wind in the morning SW. Changed in the afternoon to SSE. Left Benton directly after breakfast &amp; walked out to Newcastle to meet Stephenson who arrived yesterday, fixed the hope to load Bell &amp; Dixons Walls, but won't get coals for upwards of a fortnight. Took the steamer to Shields.</p>\r\n<p>Found a letter from WBS with the Hopes freight account but no note, brokers commission being changed which WBS thought an error. Paid an average Eligible Club &pound;14.9.3 &amp; gave Stephenson &pound;20 to pay wages. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night. A rainy &amp; blowing night</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1429,"lock":null}
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1483
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1483,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful mild weather. Wind in the morning SW. Changed in the afternoon to SSE. Left Benton directly after breakfast &amp; walked out to Newcastle to meet Stephenson who arrived yesterday, fixed the hope to load Bell &amp; Dixons Walls, but won't get coals for upwards of a fortnight. Took the steamer to Shields.</p>\r\n<p>Found a letter from WBS with the Hopes freight account but no note, brokers commission being changed which WBS thought an error. Paid an average Eligible Club &pound;14.9.3 &amp; gave Stephenson &pound;20 to pay wages. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night. A rainy &amp; blowing night</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1429,"lock":null}
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1484
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1484,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but blowing hard from the SW. Gave Robert a draft on executors account for &frac12; years taxes &pound;9.5.2. Paid &pound;20 in executors account from my own. Money advanced me by WBS. Walked out &amp; called on Mr Robson. High Cheston. Dined at home at 5 o'clock &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1430,"lock":null}
