14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1485
14:36:41.115 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1485,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. Afterwards WNW. Went to Newcastle by steamer, called at Chapmans about their &pound;300 bill which they had negotiated upwards of a month ago. Returned by steam. Wrote to WBS. Dined with H Nicholson &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":954,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1431,"lock":null}
