14:36:41.116 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1487
14:36:41.116 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1487,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning blowing fresh at WNW. Went across the water to Shortridge's Glass works to order some claret glasses for Mr Lee according to patterns</p>","pageId":955,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1433,"lock":null}
14:36:41.116 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
