14:36:41.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1499,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning. Wind SW. Took a long walk with Mark to Tynemouth, Cullercoat Sands &amp; dined with Joblings at the George at 4 o'clock</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1445,"lock":null}
