14:36:41.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/15
14:36:41.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":15,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dined with Mrs Scott Went to the theatre in the evening. The bespeak of the Bachelors of North Shields for the benefit of Miss C Scsuton. A good house &pound;59.16/-. Play The Haunted Tower with Registers Officer &amp; High life below stairs, a very good company. Wind SSE. A heavy fall of snow, the latter part of the evening it thawed. Sea fallen</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":12,"lock":null}
