14:36:41.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/150
14:36:41.123 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":150,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Called upon Mr Syms &amp; Mr Grey, respecting the Athy property. But got no information. Mr Syms who was not at home. Went to the catholic association to hear O'Connell &amp; others speak. Was disappointed. Dined with Cha<sup>r</sup> Hurry. Young O'Connel dined with us. A heavy fall of rain [<font color=#D9D9D9>in</font>] the evening</p>","pageId":697,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":140,"lock":null}
