14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1500,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SW.</p>\r\n<p>After breakfast took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; went to church in the afternoon, again walked to Tynemouth. Jobling dined with me at 5 o'clock. Reconciled with <font color=#BFBFBF>Bess</font></p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1446,"lock":null}
14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
