14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1500,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind SW.</p>\r\n<p>After breakfast took a walk to Tynemouth &amp; went to church in the afternoon, again walked to Tynemouth. Jobling dined with me at 5 o'clock. Reconciled with <font color=#BFBFBF>Bess</font></p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1446,"lock":null}
14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1501
14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1501,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind West. After breakfast walked to Tynemouth &amp; with others. Amused ourselves on Cullercoat Sands practicing ball firing. Dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Mr Archer last night the owner of the planter to meet me at 11 o'clock on Tuesday morning to survey the damage.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1447,"lock":null}
14:36:41.124 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.125 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1501
14:36:41.125 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1501,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":10,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind West. After breakfast walked to Tynemouth &amp; with others. Amused ourselves on Cullercoat Sands practicing ball firing. Dined at home at 5 o'clock.</p>\r\n<p>Wrote to Mr Archer last night the owner of the planter to meet me at 11 o'clock on Tuesday morning to survey the damage.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1447,"lock":null}
14:36:41.125 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1502
14:36:41.125 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1502,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning blowing &amp; has been all night hard from the SW. Ob board the Hope. Mr Archer did not come to survey the damage but sent a letter with an estimate, offering me &pound;1.10 &amp; the old boom etc. Walked up &amp; saw him but did not agree, however afterwards determined to take it with an 18 inch plank.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1448,"lock":null}
14:36:41.125 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1502
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1502,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning blowing &amp; has been all night hard from the SW. Ob board the Hope. Mr Archer did not come to survey the damage but sent a letter with an estimate, offering me &pound;1.10 &amp; the old boom etc. Walked up &amp; saw him but did not agree, however afterwards determined to take it with an 18 inch plank.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home.</p>","pageId":957,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1448,"lock":null}
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1503
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1503,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind fresh from SW &amp; little rain.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson up to &amp; he settled with Mr Archer. Received 30/0 &amp; a deal plank. The ship got her beef on board. Sent WBS a round up. Walked up to Tynemouth. Saw Rifles march for Manchester. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Lockerwood came in &amp; took a glass of toddy with me.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1449,"lock":null}
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1503
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1503,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind fresh from SW &amp; little rain.</p>\r\n<p>Sent Stephenson up to &amp; he settled with Mr Archer. Received 30/0 &amp; a deal plank. The ship got her beef on board. Sent WBS a round up. Walked up to Tynemouth. Saw Rifles march for Manchester. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Lockerwood came in &amp; took a glass of toddy with me.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1449,"lock":null}
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1504
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
14:36:41.126 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.127 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1504
14:36:41.127 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1504,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been showers in the night. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>On board the Hope. Her loading not completed by two keels, thereby prevented getting to sea. Walked to Tynemouth. The two keels came down in the afternoon. Lockerwood came &amp; dined with me. At the whist club in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1450,"lock":null}
14:36:41.127 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1505
14:36:41.127 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1505,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Been showers in the night. Wind NW</p>\r\n<p>The Hope got to sea this morning's tide. Walked to Tynemouth and round by Whitley Park and called upon Mr J Wright. Dined with A Dale at 5 o'clock to meet the bridal party from Whitley park. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":958,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1451,"lock":null}
