14:36:41.128 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1507
14:36:41.128 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1507,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been showers in the night. A cold morning. Wind SW &amp; S by W. Did not go church. Walked round by Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Wrote to WBS. With Bess in the evening. A very wet night</p>","pageId":959,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1453,"lock":null}
14:36:41.128 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
