14:36:41.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1520,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of snow last night again. A complete thaw with sleet. Wind E by N. Paid average Eligible Club &pound;12. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; at night with Bess</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1466,"lock":null}
14:36:41.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1521
14:36:41.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1521,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. At the newsroom in the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening with Bess. Jobling there.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1467,"lock":null}
14:36:41.135 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1521
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1521,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful winter's morning. Hard frost &amp; wind NW. At the newsroom in the morning. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening with Bess. Jobling there.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1467,"lock":null}
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1522
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1522
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1522,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick damp morning having been rain with a SSE wind during the night. Wind now SW. Received a letter from WBS. Transferred from executors account at <span class=highlight_yellow>G's </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Ho</span> to mine &pound;150. Dined with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Th</span><span class=highlight_yellow>o</span> Wright, Whitley Park, a pleasant day.</p>","pageId":962,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1468,"lock":null}
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1523
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
14:36:41.136 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1523
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1523,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth with Boswell. Received a letter from Messrs Hurry &amp; co. The coals being all out on Saturday &amp; that they had found the leak to be in an open trennail hole between the timber under the starboard for chain about two feet below <font color=#BFBFBF>the </font>light water mark. Had plugged it up &amp; after heaving down &amp; driving a new trennail, expected she would be able to return to Shields without the necessity of being docked at Yarmouth.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1469,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1524
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1524,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; fresh breezes from WNW. Wrote to WBS with a list of ships that sailed before &amp; after the Hope. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess's. Jobling, H Hurry &amp; Boswell <font color=#BFBFBF>there</font>.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1470,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1524
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1524,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather &amp; fresh breezes from WNW. Wrote to WBS with a list of ships that sailed before &amp; after the Hope. Dined at home. At the billiard room &amp; at night at Bess's. Jobling, H Hurry &amp; Boswell <font color=#BFBFBF>there</font>.</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1470,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1525
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1525,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of mild weather. Wind WSW. Received a letter from Stephenson of his having got the leak stopped. The ballast alongside &amp; expecting to get away the next day. Gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;5 <span class=highlight_yellow>account</span> for self. Dined with Mr Harrison the brewer at 3 o'clock. At the whist club &amp; at night with Bess. Jobling went to South Shields</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1471,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1525
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1525,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of mild weather. Wind WSW. Received a letter from Stephenson of his having got the leak stopped. The ballast alongside &amp; expecting to get away the next day. Gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;5 <span class=highlight_yellow>account</span> for self. Dined with Mr Harrison the brewer at 3 o'clock. At the whist club &amp; at night with Bess. Jobling went to South Shields</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1471,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1526
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1526,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SW. gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;9.10 average Hope Club. Wind changed to SE. A great many ships got down. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. With Bess at night. Lockwood there</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1472,"lock":null}
14:36:41.137 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1526
14:36:41.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1526,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Wind SW. gave a draft on Ch<font color=#BFBFBF>apmans</font> for &pound;9.10 average Hope Club. Wind changed to SE. A great many ships got down. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. With Bess at night. Lockwood there</p>","pageId":963,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1472,"lock":null}
14:36:41.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1527
14:36:41.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1527,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but cold and wind SE. A great many light ships arrived <span class=highlight_yellow>ravenjot</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>this</span>. The Hope from Yarmouth quite light. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed her to load Bell&amp; Brown again to be loaded in 3 weeks,. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; attended the club. At night at <span class=highlight_yellow>Garthays</span></p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1473,"lock":null}
14:36:41.138 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
