14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1530,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather, rather frosty. Wind WNW.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Beall app<font color=#BFBFBF>renti</font><sup>ce</sup><sup> </sup> in advance &pound;1. Received a letter from Hurry &amp; Co Yarmouth with their accounts &amp; a bill for balance at 2 months for &pound;59.9.</p>\r\n<p>Walked with H Hurry &amp; Richardson up to Sadlers &amp; dined with him</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1476,"lock":null}
14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1531
14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
