14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1531,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":11,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet unpleasant morning. Wind NW by W. Received a letter from WBS. Engaged <span class=highlight_yellow>mitcalf</span><span class=highlight_yellow> dock</span> for the Hope. Walked up &amp; gave orders to bring her down, hauled into the stream. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. Tinley, Gostling, Captain Cuthbert, H Dale &amp; Jobling the party</p>","pageId":964,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1477,"lock":null}
14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1532
14:36:41.141 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1532,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp unpleasant morning. Wind WNW. The Hope got down to the dock gate. Took a walk &amp; Tynemouth. Got the Hope into dock at 2 o'clock, high tide.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at Home. At billiard room &amp; in the evening attended the whist club</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1478,"lock":null}
