14:36:41.142 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1535
14:36:41.142 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1535,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very foggy morning. Afterwards cleared away &amp; turned out fine. Wind W by N. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; at night with Bess.</p>","pageId":965,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1481,"lock":null}
