14:36:41.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1536
14:36:41.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1536,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Walked to Tynemouth. Jobley, Boswell &amp; H Harry dined with me on board the Hope. At Mr Atkinson's in the evening &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1482,"lock":null}
14:36:41.143 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
