14:36:41.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1538,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning. Been a great deal of rain during the night &amp; blowing hard from SSE. Delivered Hurry's account &amp; vouchers onto the Eligible Club. Down at the ship, the caulking to be finished &amp; ship out of dock in the evening. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1484,"lock":null}
14:36:41.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1539
14:36:41.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1539,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Received a letter from WBS. Attended the Eligible Club, but the committee did not meet. The secretary <span class=highlight_yellow>halveoir</span> told me they would advance me money on account. Left papers with them. Dined at Mr Reeds at 5 o'clock. A large party, went in the evening to the whist club &amp; finished off at Mr Atkinson</p>","pageId":966,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1485,"lock":null}
14:36:41.144 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
