14:36:41.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/154
14:36:41.145 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":154,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant day. Engaged the principle part of the morning with Mr Walker in reading over Bessy's marriage settlements etc. Paid Lamb &pound;51 being the balance with interest of his bill of &pound;100. Wrote to William asking him to act as sole guardian to the children</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":144,"lock":null}
