14:36:41.147 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1543,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind fresh from SE. Gave Stephenson a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapmans</font> &amp; Co for &pound;30. Got the accounts &amp; vouchers of Salvage etc. from Mr Stoke to give Mr Anderson of the Hope Club. Dined with Ben Wright.</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1489,"lock":null}
14:36:41.147 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1544
14:36:41.147 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
14:36:41.147 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1544
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1544,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A boisterous morning. Blowing hard from the W by S with showers. Went by steam to Newcastle. Two hours &amp; a half in going up. Gave Mr Anderson all the papers for the Hope Club to settle the average. Returned by steam. Dr Drury, Mr C Wright &amp; Ben Wright dined with me at &frac12; past 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":967,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1490,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1545
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1545
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1545,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW &amp; rather frosty. Being rather tired from last night's debauch, did not rise till near 12 o'clock. The Hope got her beef on board today, a <span class=highlight_yellow>quey</span> takes of <span class=highlight_yellow>thoor</span>. Dinner at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1491,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1546
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1546
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1546,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Accepted a bill for balance of premium (182). Great Premium Clun &pound;7.6.6 due 14 March. On board the Stokes, the remainder of her coals (4 keels) came down &amp; she finished her loading. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. The whist club in the evening. Called in at the widows at night &amp; saw the Hope go to sea at 1 o'clock in the morning.</p>\r\n<p>Wind WNW</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1492,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1547
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1547,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WSW. Paid the Hope's piolet &pound;1.16 &amp; to 3 men for getting the ship chain hawser which she was obliged to ship &amp; leave behind &amp; for placing it on shore 7/6.</p>\r\n<p>Gave a draft on C<font color=#BFBFBF>hapman</font>'s &amp; Co for self &pound;5</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. Joblings brothers with us.</p>\r\n<p>At the theatre &amp; with Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening blew a gale at SSE</p>","pageId":968,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1493,"lock":null}
14:36:41.148 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
