14:36:41.150 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":155,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer day. Engaged writing all morning. Took a walk with Mr Vernon. Returned home to dinner. The two Careys dined with us</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":145,"lock":null}
14:36:41.150 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1550
14:36:41.150 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1550,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind from the WSW. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>Hadawary</span> R<span class=highlight_yellow>ope</span>r for a twice laid warp 82 fathoms at 28/- &pound;7. Walked early out to Murton to see the Wallsend Harriers. Had but poor sport. Dined at 3 o'clock with Charlton at Billy Mill. Sat down 12 or 14 to an excellent col round of beef &amp; roast potatoes, drank a great deal of wine, had a quarrel with Craig who behaved like a blackguard. Got to Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Paid Red's Mother balance of &frac14; years wages &pound;2.9.3</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1496,"lock":null}
14:36:41.150 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
