14:36:41.151 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1551
14:36:41.151 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1551,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Found myself at Bess's this morning. Where I remained all day. Went home a little after 5 o'clock. Showed myself at the newsroom. Had two glasses of toddy with H Harry &amp; Charlton at the Albion &amp; returned in the evening to Bess's</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1497,"lock":null}
