14:36:41.151 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1552
14:36:41.151 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1552,"version":0,"year":1831,"month":12,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after rain. Wind about west. Walked to Tynemouth &amp; back to dinner at 2 o'clock. Jobling got down today. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; with Bess at night.</p>","pageId":969,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1498,"lock":null}
