14:36:41.155 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/156
14:36:41.155 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":156,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wrote to Mr Digan about the house in Dublin Street that I could give him no decisive answer. Hired a car &amp; drove up the mountain &amp; saw H Fitzmaurice about the bonds, who promised as soon as he could raise money upon his estates to pay them &amp; that on Sunday sennight he would give me some money on account of the interest, perhaps sooner. Returned to Mr Vernon to dinner</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":146,"lock":null}
14:36:41.155 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
