14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1564,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":4.0000,"text":"<div class=\"forward-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Note</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p>The following note appears at the front of the diary which appears to be a bet on a result in the 1832 General election</p>\r\n\r\n    <figure>\r\n      <img src=\"images/img2982-note-at-front-of-diary.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n      <figcaption>A note at the front of the diary</figcaption>\r\n    </figure>\r\n\r\n    <p>2/1 This Mr Bell is returned for the southern Division of the county the next election</p>\r\n    <p>A Richmond, Bank</p>\r\n    <p>Mr Webster bets him the same</p>\r\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n    <p>5/5 This Mr Bell is returned for the southern Division of the county</p>\r\n    <p>A C Wright</p>\r\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n    <p>Nov 1832</p>\r\n    <p>Mr Richmond has has half his bet</p>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1564
14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1564,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":4.0000,"text":"<div class=\"forward-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Note</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p>The following note appears at the front of the diary which appears to be a bet on a result in the 1832 General election</p>\r\n\r\n    <figure>\r\n      <img src=\"images/img2982-note-at-front-of-diary.jpg\" width=\"600px\" />\r\n      <figcaption>A note at the front of the diary</figcaption>\r\n    </figure>\r\n\r\n    <p>2/1 This Mr Bell is returned for the southern Division of the county the next election</p>\r\n    <p>A Richmond, Bank</p>\r\n    <p>Mr Webster bets him the same</p>\r\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n    <p>5/5 This Mr Bell is returned for the southern Division of the county</p>\r\n    <p>A C Wright</p>\r\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n    <p>Nov 1832</p>\r\n    <p>Mr Richmond has has half his bet</p>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1565
14:36:41.157 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1565,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine frosty day with a SW wind. Gave Robert leave to go &amp; spend the day at Benton. Went to church. Dined at home with Jobling. Had j<font color=#BFBFBF>u</font>n<font color=#BFBFBF>io</font>r <span class=highlight_lime>R. Maxwell</span> along to see him. A fine boy.</p>\r\n<p>H Harry came in &amp; spent the afternoon with us in the evening. We went to window Atkinson &amp; at night I was with Bess.</p>","pageId":972,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1509,"lock":null}
