14:36:41.158 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1567,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. A holyday in the town. Walked to Tynemouth etc. Dined at home. At the billiard room. At night at the Albion &amp; theatre. A very good house</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1511,"lock":null}
