14:36:41.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1568,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold damp morning. Wind ESE. A good deal of rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to WBS &amp; remitted him two promise notes &pound;142.15.6 &amp; &pound;71.2.2 to take up the Hopes cargo bill of &pound;211.12/-. Gave a draft on Chapmans for the amount of the bills. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; suppered with Lockwood</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1512,"lock":null}
14:36:41.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1569
14:36:41.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1569,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Engaged to dine with Charlton at Billy Mill at 2 o'clock. Thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Did not go to Charlton being unwell. Received from Eligible Club &pound;____ in notes at 2 months date 30 December which with Hurry &amp; Co's bill of &pound;59.9 making &pound;228.5/- I paid into Chapmans. Dined at home. <span class=highlight_yellow>Rec</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>eived</span></font> an <span class=highlight_yellow>Brt</span> Andersons acceptance at 2 months from 4. I am on account of average for &pound;50. I am on account of average for &pound;50</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1513,"lock":null}
14:36:41.159 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
