14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1569,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Engaged to dine with Charlton at Billy Mill at 2 o'clock. Thick foggy morning &amp; frosty. Wind WSW. Did not go to Charlton being unwell. Received from Eligible Club &pound;____ in notes at 2 months date 30 December which with Hurry &amp; Co's bill of &pound;59.9 making &pound;228.5/- I paid into Chapmans. Dined at home. <span class=highlight_yellow>Rec</span><font color=#BFBFBF><span class=highlight_yellow>eived</span></font> an <span class=highlight_yellow>Brt</span> Andersons acceptance at 2 months from 4. I am on account of average for &pound;50. I am on account of average for &pound;50</p>\r\n<p>With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1513,"lock":null}
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/157
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/157
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":157,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain during the whole of the day. Had some conversation with Mr Walker respecting the administrating to the property. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":147,"lock":null}
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1570
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1570,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost &amp; foggy. Wind SSW but I should think from the e<font color=#BFBFBF>ast</font> of sea. Wrote to Mr Anderson acknowledging the receipt of the &pound;50 bill</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening attended the whist club, With Bess at night who had submitted to be examined by Dr Horsley who pronounced her quite well &amp; therefore I must be free from disease</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1514,"lock":null}
14:36:41.160 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1570
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1570,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hard frost &amp; foggy. Wind SSW but I should think from the e<font color=#BFBFBF>ast</font> of sea. Wrote to Mr Anderson acknowledging the receipt of the &pound;50 bill</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At the billiard room in the evening attended the whist club, With Bess at night who had submitted to be examined by Dr Horsley who pronounced her quite well &amp; therefore I must be free from disease</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1514,"lock":null}
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1571
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1571,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Wind from the S &amp; E &amp; hard frost.</p>\r\n<p>Lunched at home. Dined at 6 o'clock with j<font color=#BFBFBF>unio</font>r Redhead at Tynemouth.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>\r\n<p>Paid the &pound;50 bill into my account at Chapmans</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1515,"lock":null}
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/1571
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1571,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters morning. Wind from the S &amp; E &amp; hard frost.</p>\r\n<p>Lunched at home. Dined at 6 o'clock with j<font color=#BFBFBF>unio</font>r Redhead at Tynemouth.</p>\r\n<p>With Bess at night</p>\r\n<p>Paid the &pound;50 bill into my account at Chapmans</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1515,"lock":null}
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1572
14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1572,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull damp morning. Wind E by S &amp; ESE. Been blowing very hard all night. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Tibbs eat his dinner with us. At the billiard room in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; attended the whist club at night at J Tinley's</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1516,"lock":null}
