14:36:41.161 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1573,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind SE &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Having taken a couple of pills last night I did not go to church. Lockwood dined with us at 2 o'clock. Spent the evening at Bess</p>","pageId":981,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1517,"lock":null}
