14:36:41.168 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1586
14:36:41.168 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1586,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuation of most beautiful weather. Wind SW. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him copies of the rent &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>chapenaus</span> book up to the end of the year. Dined at home. Drury &amp; Lockwood took some dinner with me. Called at Bess &amp; at night attended the Whist Club at H Hurries</p>","pageId":983,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1530,"lock":null}
