14:36:41.170 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1590,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind WSW. Took a most delightful walk with J Cunningham &amp; Mr Boswell to Tynemouth along the sands to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in well laden. Returned home to dinner. At the billiard room in the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; suppered at the Albion. With Bess at night</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1534,"lock":null}
