14:36:41.171 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1591,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most delightful weather and frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. At the billiard room in the afternoon. In the evening a sudden change in the weather came on a very heavy fall of snow &amp; sleet &amp; a gale of wind from the N &amp; E. Attended the whist club. Called at Bess but slept at home</p>","pageId":984,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1535,"lock":null}
