14:36:41.175 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":16,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy unpleasant day &amp; the thaw continuing, excessively wet and sloppy Received a letter from Dixon stating the impossibility of his assisting me (Promises much easier made than kept). Wind W&amp;SW. Sea fallen &amp; ship &amp; sailed</p>","pageId":687,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":13,"lock":null}
