14:36:41.176 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/160
14:36:41.176 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":160,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Settled with Mr Price for the sale of the furniture &amp; after paying his charges &amp; received from him a bill on Mr Conolly for &pound;18.17.6 at 2 Nov, payable at n<sup>o</sup> 1 Upper Orsmond Quay Dublin &amp; &pound;13.5.8 cash for balance. Dined at the Careys. Met Captain DeLacy &amp; Mr Nugent of the 30<sup>th</sup> &amp; went to a pleasant dinner at E Butlins in the evening &amp; kept up until after 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":698,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":150,"lock":null}
