14:36:41.187 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1621,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":2,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Northumbrian Regimental dinner at the Turf at 6 o'clock. A fine morning. Been a shower of rain. Wind WNW. Went to Newcastle by steam. Dined at 6 o'clock. 23 officers at dinner &amp; strangers. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>B</span><span class=highlight_yellow>eerrall</span> of Broom Park, D Dixon, I Cockson, Pollard, Lambert, Reed &amp; Small. Spent a pleasant day &amp; left the party before 1 o'clock in the morning. Some remained till 5 o'clock</p>","pageId":988,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1565,"lock":null}
