14:36:41.189 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1626
14:36:41.189 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1626,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, having been rain in the night &amp; appearance of more. Wind SW. Went over the water to see Mr Wheatley. Dined at home. At the billiard in the afternoon. Called at Bess &amp; in the evening attended the Whist Club</p>","pageId":989,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1570,"lock":null}
