14:36:41.192 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1632,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by S. Got two average bills returned for non-payment. Two on Mr Richmond = &pound;3 &amp; one on Mr Spence Newcastle for &pound;1.4. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. W C Wright came &amp; drank a bottle of wine with me, a bet.  Spent the evening with Bess</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1576,"lock":null}
