14:36:41.194 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1635
14:36:41.194 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1635,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind variable between NW &amp; SW. Got up early &amp; went to Newcastle. Received &pound;1.4. of Mr Spencer, Hope's average. Returned to Shields to dinner but obliged by a letter from WBS to start for Newcastle again to see <span class=highlight_yellow>K Bend</span>. Got the bills returned to Shields &amp; sent them off by post to WBS. At the whist club at Doctor Drewy's</p>","pageId":990,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1579,"lock":null}
