14:36:41.210 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1667
14:36:41.210 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1667,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather &amp; wind from the NE &amp; SE. Went to Newcastle by steam &amp; returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>dinner</span>. Could not do anything for the Hope. With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1611,"lock":null}
14:36:41.210 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
