14:36:41.211 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1667,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Cold weather &amp; wind from the NE &amp; SE. Went to Newcastle by steam &amp; returned to <span class=highlight_yellow>dinner</span>. Could not do anything for the Hope. With Bess in the evening</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1611,"lock":null}
14:36:41.211 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1668
14:36:41.211 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1668,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":4,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind NE. Mr Bird breakfasted with me &amp; came back for dinner. I signed a charter for S<sup>t</sup> Andrew &amp; sent it to WBS.</p>\r\n<p>Benton agricultural show. Dined with Charlton at Boggins. Did not go. Received a charter from the tees Co but refused it. At Bess</p>","pageId":995,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1612,"lock":null}
14:36:41.211 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
