14:36:41.225 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1699,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind still from the N by E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. At Tynemouth again in the afternoon. Took wine &amp; spent the evening at Tibbs. Called at Bess</p>","pageId":999,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1643,"lock":null}
14:36:41.225 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
