14:36:41.226 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1700
14:36:41.226 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1700,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning with a cool NNW wind. Afterwards got to NNE. Went to the coach to Newcastle&amp; got settled with the Hope Club <span class=highlight_yellow>and allowing</span> a calking. Called and saw Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>. Got home to dinner. With Bess at night.</p>\r\n<p>Heavy shower of rain &amp; hail</p>","pageId":1000,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1644,"lock":null}
