14:36:41.231 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/171
14:36:41.231 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":171,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The first thing in the morning called upon Mr Carmichael but being engaged made an appointment with for 1 o'clock. Walked down to see the guard returned at the castle. Much to my surprise, met captain <span class=highlight_yellow>flu </span><span class=highlight_yellow>ie</span> Butler. At 1 o'clock saw Mr C<font color=#BFBFBF>armichael</font> &amp; then went to Mr Stocks the Proctor who filled up a form for the children to sign that they are willing. I should administer (in my opinion very inconsistent), sent it off by post to Mr Vernon. Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":161,"lock":null}
14:36:41.231 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
