14:36:41.235 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1716,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still wet damp weather. Rained in the morning. Wind NE. Dined at 2 o'clock. Went out after dinner &amp; fished in the Pow Burn &amp; caught several trout with worm.</p>","pageId":1002,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1660,"lock":null}
