14:36:41.241 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1729,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning. Wind variable. Ceased raining during the day but very dull &amp; close. Woke at 11 o'clock by steam to Newcastle. Walked to the course, better sport than yesterday. Returned in the evening by a gig. At Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1673,"lock":null}
