14:36:41.242 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
