14:36:41.242 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":173,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day &amp; very warm. Engaged with Mr Carmichael &amp; wrote to Mr Vernon for leases etc. Received the documents which I sent by post on Saturday for the children to sign. Dined at Mackens. Much fatigued with my days work. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":699,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":163,"lock":null}
14:36:41.242 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1730
14:36:41.242 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1730,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind NE. Went up to Newcastle by steam &amp; walked to the course. The racing better today. When there had a heavy thunder storm which made it very wet &amp; uncomfortable. Returned by steam on the evening &amp; had supper at home having had no dinner</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1674,"lock":null}
