14:36:41.243 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1731,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Went again to Newcastle by steam. Dined with Mr Dodds &amp; afterwards walked to the course. Poor running. Both cups won easily. The <span class=highlight_yellow>GoO</span> by Mary Cleveland &amp; the silver by Captain Potts. Returned to Mr Dodds &amp; got home by steam at 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1675,"lock":null}
14:36:41.243 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1732
14:36:41.243 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1732,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":6,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy day. Wind SE. A draft on Chapmans for <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr Mid</span> &pound;16 <span class=highlight_yellow>Pduct</span> on Hope's bill for coal freight to <span class=highlight_yellow>Swenmundr</span> &pound;38.11.10 dated 5 June at 60 days.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><font size=2.5pt color=#BFBFBF>Sanderson</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font>Ilderton <font color=#BFBFBF>MP </font>came down. I dined with him at the George &amp; he in this evening, addressed the electors.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>With Bess</p>","pageId":1004,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1676,"lock":null}
