14:36:41.256 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":176,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day. At the courts in the morning getting petition drawn out. Went to Mr Stocks &amp; signed a bond &amp; to my dismay was told it was also necessary I should also have two friends to give bond, for where am I to find them, being a stranger in Dublin. Paid for Bond stamp 20/- fee to council 21/- &amp; advanced Mr Carmichael &pound;5 Dined at Mackens</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":166,"lock":null}
