14:36:41.258 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1761,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather but still blowing fresh from the NNE cold &amp; sea high.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Engaged in getting voters to pay <span class=highlight_yellow>fees</span> &amp; taxes.  Captain Webb &amp; Mr Rippon dined with me. At the committee rooms &amp; at night with Bess.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>A letter from Stephenson</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1704,"lock":null}
14:36:41.258 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1762
14:36:41.258 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1762,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning &amp; NE wind. Received a letter from Harman &amp; Co <span class=highlight_yellow>losed</span><span class=highlight_yellow> one</span> with Stephenson's Wyburg bill for <span class=highlight_yellow>aucblane</span> dated the 30<sup>th</sup> June at 3 months for &pound;51</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At Harrison's in the afternoon. At Bell's committee room in the evening &amp; with Bess at night</p>","pageId":1008,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1705,"lock":null}
14:36:41.258 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
