14:36:41.263 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1771,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind from the E. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Bess &amp; Jobling at June Laptons. Walked to Tynemouth gave us the afternoon &amp; spent the evening &amp; night with Bess in the barracks having taken lodgings there for a few days</p>","pageId":1010,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1714,"lock":null}
