14:36:41.275 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1796
14:36:41.275 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1796,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind fresh from the Westward. Went over the water &amp; fished for <span class=highlight_yellow>hornests</span> &amp; was successful. Cunningham dined with me &amp; J H Richardson came &amp; took wine of which we had rather too much. With Bess at night.</p>","pageId":1013,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1739,"lock":null}
14:36:41.275 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
