14:36:41.292 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":183,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day with a few light showers of rain. Mr Walker received the L<font color=#BFBFBF>ord</font> Chancellors orders from Mr Carmichael &amp; served Mrs Falkener with a copy &amp; notice. Entered into an agreement with Mr Digan to grant him a lease when legally authorized of the house in Dublin street &amp; gave him possession upon his paying one year's rent in advance reg:&pound;35 less &pound;2 allowed him for the difference in time between the 30<sup>th</sup> May the day the lease is to be taken from to this day. Dined with Dr Reed</p>","pageId":700,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":173,"lock":null}
