14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1854
14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1854,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NW. The Fenwick left for Newcastle. The family went to church. I stopped at home.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1797,"lock":null}
14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
