14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1854,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind NW. The Fenwick left for Newcastle. The family went to church. I stopped at home.</p>","pageId":1021,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1797,"lock":null}
14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1855
14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1855,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr Ilderton drove to <span class=highlight_yellow>toroles</span> &amp; left us at Ildeston Cottage. Went out shooting &amp; had very good sport. Dined at the cottage at 5 o'clock. I slept all night in cots</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1798,"lock":null}
14:36:41.304 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
