14:36:41.305 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1855,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr Ilderton drove to <span class=highlight_yellow>toroles</span> &amp; left us at Ildeston Cottage. Went out shooting &amp; had very good sport. Dined at the cottage at 5 o'clock. I slept all night in cots</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1798,"lock":null}
14:36:41.305 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/1856
14:36:41.305 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1856,"version":0,"year":1832,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Went out at 8 o'clock &amp; shot &lsquo;till 2 o'clock &amp; had pretty fair sport. Dined at the cottage. The coach being full, we were obliged to walk, expecting to meet the carriage on the road, but again disappointed. Did not get home until after 7 o'clock quite tired</p>","pageId":1022,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1799,"lock":null}
14:36:41.305 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
