14:36:41.331 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/191
14:36:41.331 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":191,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another hot summers day. Called at Mr Carmichael's &amp; from the difficult situation in which I am placed, determined upon asking my brother to come to Ireland &amp; going to Carlow tomorrow there to remain until I either see him or have a letter from him in answer to one I wrote this day. Wrote also to Mrs Scott. Dined at Mackens &amp; went to the Lying In Hospital Gardens where there was an immense assembly of company</p>","pageId":701,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":181,"lock":null}
