14:36:41.344 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":1936,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An incessant rain since yesterday morning &amp; still continues. Wind from the South &amp; East. Left Richmond's after breakfast in his gig for Denton where I dined &amp; then Charlton drove me to Newcastle &amp; we took the <span class=highlight_yellow>omnibus</span> for Shields. At the club. Rope received from Mr Paxton for WBS &pound;30 &amp; gave it to me</p>","pageId":1066,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1877,"lock":null}
