14:36:41.371 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":1990,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, blowing hard from the WSW. Went to Newcastle with Emma Galbraith. Booked her place in the High Flyer to London with Mr &amp; Mrs Batson. Returned by steam with R  Ilderton. Dined with J Tinley &amp; attended the sales of the Hope, put up at &pound;1000 &amp; no bidders</p>","pageId":1071,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1931,"lock":null}
