14:36:41.379 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2005,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":3,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Nearly agreed to sell Mr Watson the Hope for &pound;1100. Took a long walk with Dr Fenwick round by Chirton, Billy Mill, Murton, Preston &amp; Home to dinner at Dr F<font color=#BFBFBF>enwick</font>'s at 5 o'clock. At the Albion in the evening</p>","pageId":1073,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":1946,"lock":null}
