14:36:41.404 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2061,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p><a href=\"https://heatonhistorygroup.org/2026/03/10/benton-park-country-estate-to-housing-estate/\">Benton Park: country estate to housing estate</a></p>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
14:36:41.404 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2062
14:36:41.404 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2062,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Mr &amp; Mrs Ilderton drove us over to Ilderton. They stopped to attend Mr Howey's sale. Robert &amp; I went on in the carriage to Benton beyond Wooler. I walked from there to West Newton &amp; fished down the Glen, beautiful stream but had poor sport, being a bright day &amp; water fine. Suppered at Benton &amp; went by coach at &frac12; past 11 o'clock to the GameKeepers Cottage at Ildeston to sleep. Excessively fatigued</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2002,"lock":null}
