14:36:41.405 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2064,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful morning. Amused ourselves shooting rooks. After lunch Bob Ilderton rode to Alnwick. Heavy showers of hail &amp; rain in the afternoon</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2004,"lock":null}
14:36:41.405 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
