14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2065,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Mr Ilderton drove Robert am me into Alnwick &amp; we got the coach at 12 o'clock &amp; arrived at Newcastle at &frac12; past 4 o'clock. Dined a7 staid all night with Dr Fenwick. Heavy rain all day. R Ilderton dined at the club house</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2005,"lock":null}
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2066
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2066
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2066,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. The Doctor &amp; I breakfasted with R Ilderton at the Turks Head and afterwards came down to Shields by steam. Received a letter from &amp; wrote to WBS. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley at 5 o'clock. Much surprised to find the Doctor there, having left him in Newcastle. Captain Beckham 19<sup>th</sup> Regiment &amp; the Curate there</p>","pageId":1078,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2006,"lock":null}
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2067
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
14:36:41.406 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2067
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2067,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW. Saw Mr Thompson of South Shields who would not offer &pound;1000 for the Hope, also Mr Watson &amp; Harrison, the brewer who did  but I declined. Spoke to J Young about the payment of his bill for &pound;100 &amp; he offered to take &pound;50 at present.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>R Ilderton came down to dinner &amp; we afterwards went to Shields races which were very good &amp; many people there.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2007,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2068
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
