14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2068,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind W by N. Received a letter from Mr Watson offering me &pound;1005. Called upon him &amp; agreed to take it. R Ilderton &amp; yound Fenwick came down &amp; dined with me &amp; afterwards went to South Shields races which were pretty good. Finished at the Albion</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2008,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2069
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/2069
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2069,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine summer's morning. Wind NE &amp; SE. Mr Watson after being on board the ship, called &amp; signed the agreement for the purchase at &pound;1005. Dined at home at 4 o'clock. At C Cockwells. Walked to Tynemouth, at Southerns. Met Bess.</p>","pageId":1079,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2009,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/207
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":207,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It began very early in the morning to rain &amp; blow hard &amp; it increased to a heavy gale. Nearly all on board sick. Obliged about 12 o'clock to lay to not being able to see land or make the floating light. The weather so thick. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock made the light &amp; got into Liverpool at 3 o'clock after a very stormy passage across of 20 hours and landed very wet. Got Emma to bed, much exhausted from the fatigues &amp; sickness. We stopped at the Angel Inn</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":197,"lock":null}
14:36:41.407 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
