14:36:41.410 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2075,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":5,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather &amp; blowing fresh from the NE &amp; sea high. H Hurry dined with me. At the Pig &amp; Whistle. Took tea with C Cockrill. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening &amp; fresh. At the Albion.</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2015,"lock":null}
14:36:41.410 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
