14:36:41.412 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":208,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":7,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A deluge of rain which continued all day. Left Liverpool for Leeds at 5 o'clock where we arrived about 6 o'clock. Poor Emma much annoyed by an eruption on the skin with great heat &amp; itching like the nettle rash from the heat &amp; sickness on board the steam boat. Took tea &amp; slept at Greaves</p>","pageId":702,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":198,"lock":null}
