14:36:41.414 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2083
14:36:41.414 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2083,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":6,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Mr Ilderton drove me over to Ilderton. Bob &amp; Tom rode. Left Mr I there &amp; we went out to the Glen to fish &amp; had pretty fair sport considering the weather. Sent some trout to Dr Drury  &amp; so tired that we stopped &amp; slept at Wooler Cottage</p>","pageId":1080,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2023,"lock":null}
