14:36:41.461 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2186,"version":0,"year":1834,"month":9,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful autumnal &amp; harvest weather. Wind WNW. Went with H Hurry by steam up to the Regatta at the Kings Meadows. Never was out in a more beautiful day. A most lively &amp; animated seem, the river covered with boats &amp; the banks with gaily dressed people &amp; carriages. Finished at the Albion &amp; H Hurry's</p>","pageId":1091,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2126,"lock":null}
