14:36:41.513 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2298
14:36:41.513 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2298,"version":0,"year":1835,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. <span class=highlight_yellow>Six</span> Charles Grey came to the George having offered himself for the borough. His Addressed the election in a beautiful &amp; eloquent speech &amp; declined coming forward this, but explained his determination to do so the next election. Dined at the George with his committee &amp; spent a pleasant day. <span class=highlight_yellow>Jn</span><span class=highlight_yellow> Liver Kill</span> too unwell to attend</p>","pageId":1105,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2238,"lock":null}
