14:36:41.520 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2310
14:36:41.520 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2310,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":4.0000,"text":"<p>... took a long stroll down the New <span class=highlight_yellow>Ky</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Prosped</span>, the fashionable &amp; finest street in Pitusby. It is about 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>wests</span> in length &amp; having <span class=highlight_yellow>trus</span> on each side between the froth pavement &amp; road which adds much to its beauty. Returned to our lodgings about 11 o'clock completely knocked up &amp; foot sore.</p>","pageId":749,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2250,"lock":null}
