14:36:41.525 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2322
14:36:41.525 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2322,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":20,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... get at them. Bob &amp; I much annoyed having made certain of having a comfortable dinner &amp; bed on show &amp; talked over our plans of future proceedings. He having determined to stay a few days at Shields &amp; take his passage in some other vessel.</p>\r\n<p>The wind &amp; sea being right aft, we soon passed Huntcliff foot again &amp; at 8 o'clock left Flamborough Head bearing west distant 2 or 3 miles.</p>\r\n<p>A great many light ships in Burlington Bat as we passed.</p>\r\n<p>Ship made a great deal of water during the day</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2262,"lock":null}
14:36:41.525 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
