14:36:41.526 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":2323,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":22,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... struggled hard to prevent it escaping. I felt that &quot;Richard was himself again&quot; &amp; no longer the prospect for the present of ruin &amp; a jail before me. At 4 o'clock pm we brought up abreast of the Navy Hospital, within a short distance of the shore, blowing a heavy gale from the SW &amp; rejoiced that we had got into such a snug roadstead, instead of being at sea at night</p>\r\n<p>Such tempestuous &amp; unsettled weather for the time of year I don't remember. This is the fourth gale we have experienced since leaving Elseneur &amp; although it is such a short distance to the river, I almost despair of reaching without some disaster for bad luck seems to thwart us, whichever way we steer.</p>\r\n<p>Bob &amp; I turned in a little after 8 o'clock. The gale rather encased with rain</p>","pageId":768,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2263,"lock":null}
14:36:41.526 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/2324
14:36:41.526 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":2324,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":28,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... were compelled to give the ship the whole chain. Wind WNW &amp; cloudy. Dismal weather with rain. A light ship close by us drove &amp; another broke his chain &amp; sun down the river. Continued blowing hard all day with heavy showers of rain &amp; squalls &amp; towards evening the wind got to about N by W but the tide not answering. <span class=highlight_yellow>Till</span> near dark, we lay still, indeed it blew too hard to think of getting under way &amp; one or two vessels that weighed were soon obliged to bring up again</p>","pageId":770,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2264,"lock":null}
14:36:41.526 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
