14:36:41.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/234
14:36:41.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":234,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":7,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. The Hope got safe down from the spout having taken in 13 keels &amp; 6 char. The remainder followed her down &amp; we got to sea about &frac12; past 1 o'clock PM wind about NE but very little of it so that we did not get much beyond Sunderland before dark. Gave Richardson &amp; Davidson notice of appeal against the land tax for the property in Shields &amp; Preston. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":704,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":222,"lock":null}
14:36:41.529 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
