14:36:41.535 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/248
14:36:41.535 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":248,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet &amp; disagreeable day. Wind SW. Took the Paddington coach into the city. Called at Lees &amp; left the policy of the Hope Club. Dined at I Loblengs, a large party</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":236,"lock":null}
14:36:41.535 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
