14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":248,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet &amp; disagreeable day. Wind SW. Took the Paddington coach into the city. Called at Lees &amp; left the policy of the Hope Club. Dined at I Loblengs, a large party</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":236,"lock":null}
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/249
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":249,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery day. Wind from NW to N Went into the city at &frac12; past 11 o'clock by the Paddington stage. With some difficulty got the Hope sold at 30/s Walked out of the city with William &amp; dined with Richmond, met Rob Jobling Played at whist &amp; won 4/-</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":237,"lock":null}
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
