14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":249,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery day. Wind from NW to N Went into the city at &frac12; past 11 o'clock by the Paddington stage. With some difficulty got the Hope sold at 30/s Walked out of the city with William &amp; dined with Richmond, met Rob Jobling Played at whist &amp; won 4/-</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":237,"lock":null}
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/25
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":25,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An extremely fine mild day. Wind varying between SE &amp; W. Dined at home Agreed with the washerwoman to take my cloths by the quarter at 1 &frac12; guinea</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":22,"lock":null}
14:36:41.536 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
