14:36:41.537 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":25,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An extremely fine mild day. Wind varying between SE &amp; W. Dined at home Agreed with the washerwoman to take my cloths by the quarter at 1 &frac12; guinea</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":22,"lock":null}
14:36:41.537 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/250
14:36:41.537 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":250,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day. Wind West Walked round the Regents park. Took an early dinner with Richmond who afterwards drove me down to Stanmore to stay the night. Left town at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. A beautiful evening. Took tea and went to bed in good time.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":238,"lock":null}
