14:36:41.537 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/251
14:36:41.537 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":251,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine Day. Hot summer weather. Richmond &amp; I after breakfast took a long walk. Upon our return found Mr &amp; Mrs Lumly had arrived. Mr &amp; Mrs Griffiths also came down before dinner &amp; Jobling came after we had sat down. We spend a very aggregable &amp; pleasant  day &amp; returned to town  in the evening.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":239,"lock":null}
