14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":251,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly fine Day. Hot summer weather. Richmond &amp; I after breakfast took a long walk. Upon our return found Mr &amp; Mrs Lumly had arrived. Mr &amp; Mrs Griffiths also came down before dinner &amp; Jobling came after we had sat down. We spend a very aggregable &amp; pleasant  day &amp; returned to town  in the evening.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":239,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/252
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":252,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day, wind west. Went into the city by a Paddington stage. On the market,  coal lower. Walked out of the city. Dined at 6 o'clock with Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Whenbury</span> in Gower Street; a quiet party only Richmond there. He &amp; I went in the evening to Vauxhall Gardens to meet Bob Marsh, Vincent &amp; William. A great many people there, but of the inferior classes. Got home between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":240,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/252
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":252,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A hot day, wind west. Went into the city by a Paddington stage. On the market,  coal lower. Walked out of the city. Dined at 6 o'clock with Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Whenbury</span> in Gower Street; a quiet party only Richmond there. He &amp; I went in the evening to Vauxhall Gardens to meet Bob Marsh, Vincent &amp; William. A great many people there, but of the inferior classes. Got home between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":240,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/253
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":253,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, but exceedingly hot. Wind SE. Breakfasted with Richmond who afterwards drove me into the city &amp; then to Stone Stairs &amp; we went on board the Hope. Took a Paddington stage home. Dressed &amp; dined at Joblings. A large party.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":241,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/253
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":253,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, but exceedingly hot. Wind SE. Breakfasted with Richmond who afterwards drove me into the city &amp; then to Stone Stairs &amp; we went on board the Hope. Took a Paddington stage home. Dressed &amp; dined at Joblings. A large party.</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":241,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/254
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":254,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day. Wind SE. left town at 9 o'clock am. By the Portsmouth coach with Bob Marsh, where we arrived at &frac12; past 5 o'clock, crossed over by the steam boat to Ryde to stay with Mr Lee. Dined between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Mr Lee living at Navarino House, beautifully. Situated about &frac12; a mile west of the town, upon the side of the hill which descended to the sea of which it commands a most beautiful view, with the mainland, Portsmouth</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":242,"lock":null}
14:36:41.538 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.539 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/254
14:36:41.539 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":254,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful day. Wind SE. left town at 9 o'clock am. By the Portsmouth coach with Bob Marsh, where we arrived at &frac12; past 5 o'clock, crossed over by the steam boat to Ryde to stay with Mr Lee. Dined between 7 &amp; 8 o'clock. Mr Lee living at Navarino House, beautifully. Situated about &frac12; a mile west of the town, upon the side of the hill which descended to the sea of which it commands a most beautiful view, with the mainland, Portsmouth</p>","pageId":706,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":242,"lock":null}
14:36:41.539 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/255
14:36:41.539 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":255,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":8,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A glorious day. Wind east. Got up before 7 o'clock &amp; bathed. Breakfasted at Mr Lees at Navarino House. At 11 o'clock went on the pier to see the Regatta, but dull work, being small boats. Dined with Mr Lee &amp; afterwards attended the Ball at the Library, a very poor one &amp; company bad. Not a pretty girl in the room.</p>","pageId":707,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":243,"lock":null}
14:36:41.539 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
