14:36:41.541 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":26,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A remarkably fine mild day. Wind W &amp; W by N. Dined at home. In the evening at a Quadrille party at Mrs J Tenleys. A very pleasant dance. Upwards of 100 there &amp; kept it up till 3 o'clock</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":23,"lock":null}
