14:36:41.543 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":264,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind fresh from the NE. After taking an early breakfast F Barclay, Bob Marsh &amp; I embarked in the Geo<font color=#BFBFBF>rge</font> IV steam boat &amp; went to see Southampton, stopping &frac12; home at Cowes on the way, &amp; after spending a very pleasant day returned to Ryde to dinner. William left for Town</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":248,"lock":null}
14:36:41.543 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/265
