14:36:41.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":27,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine mild day. Wind W &amp; WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined at home. In the evening at the theatre</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":24,"lock":null}
