14:36:41.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/270
14:36:41.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":270,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind ESE blowing fresh. Took a walk after breakfast with Captain Lewis &amp; Marsh across the <span class=highlight_yellow>Daffers</span> to the wood from which is a very beautiful  view. Played a few games at billiards with the Captain. Spent the evening as usual at Navarinos</p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":254,"lock":null}
14:36:41.546 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
