14:36:41.548 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":273,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Wind still blowing hard from the SW but finer weather. Received a letter from William &amp; wrote to Turner at London about the packages. Took a walk with Rebecca &amp; Laura &amp; Bob Marsh over the <span class=highlight_yellow>Daffers</span></p>","pageId":708,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":257,"lock":null}
