14:36:41.549 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/278
14:36:41.549 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":278,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of uncommonly fine weather. Wind SSE. Captain &amp; Mrs Lewis, Laura, B<font color=#BFBFBF>ob</font> Marsh &amp; I took a sail to &amp; up Portsmouth Harbour round all the men-of-war. Went on board the Royal George Yacht and returned to dinner much gratified &amp; delighted with our excursion.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":262,"lock":null}
