14:36:41.551 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":282,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SE. After breakfast Rebecca, Mrs Lewis, Lee and the girls &amp; I went in the Isis to Portsmouth on board the Melville man-of-war. Captain Hill &amp; much gratified &amp; pleased with the beautiful order she was in &amp; after lunching with Mrs Hill, returned to Ryde, delighted with our sail. The 1<sup>st</sup> Lieutenant got his promotion this day after 21 years hard service.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":266,"lock":null}
