14:36:41.552 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/283
14:36:41.552 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":283,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful day. Wind SW. Went to church in the morning &amp; heard a very poor commonplace sermon from a Mr Moors. Walked upon the pier in the afternoon. Mr &amp; Mrs <span class=highlight_yellow>Gve</span> Lee &amp; Miss Jane Lee dined at Navarinos. Wind changed with <span class=highlight_yellow>a</span> some rain at night</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":267,"lock":null}
