14:36:41.552 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/284
14:36:41.552 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":284,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine warm day. Wind SW with a few light showers in the morning. Bob Marshes &amp; I had a most delightful bath after breakfast. The Brocklebank steamer arrived from Brighton on an excursion of pleasure loaded with passengers between 2 &amp; 3 rd, principally trades people in appearance. Lots of vulgarity, pipes &amp; &quot;heavy wet&quot;. Played a few games of billiards.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":268,"lock":null}
