14:36:41.553 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":285,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW. Remained in the house until after lunch. In the afternoon strolled about the town. Went to a Quadrille party at the library in the evening. Very well attended &amp; good company. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":269,"lock":null}
