14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":286,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most extraordinary fine weather, with wind SW. Strolled about the pier &amp; town</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":270,"lock":null}
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/286
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":286,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of most extraordinary fine weather, with wind SW. Strolled about the pier &amp; town</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":270,"lock":null}
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/287
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":287,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A glorious day. Not a cloud to be seen. Wind SW. After breakfast Lewis, Fanny, Bob Marsh took a boat &amp; sailed round to Brading Harbour. Much pleased with the views of the country &amp; coast &amp; delighted with our sail. Got back at &frac12; past 3 pm. Received a letter from William of the arrival of the Hope but too late for yesterdays market.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":271,"lock":null}
14:36:41.554 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
