14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":288,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind SW to W. After breakfast walked to Binstead parsonage, about 1 mile, from Naravinos. In my opinion the prettiest &amp; most picturesque place in the island. The grounds laid out with great taste &amp; kept in the highest order. The views from them very fine. Wrote to William of my intention to be in town on Sunday.</p>","pageId":709,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":272,"lock":null}
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/289
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":289,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning. Wind NW to SW. Cleared up before 12 o'clock &amp; turned out a pleasant day. Booked outside place by the Rocket coach from tomorrow morning. Received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 32/3</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":273,"lock":null}
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
