14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":289,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":9,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning. Wind NW to SW. Cleared up before 12 o'clock &amp; turned out a pleasant day. Booked outside place by the Rocket coach from tomorrow morning. Received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 32/3</p>","pageId":710,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":273,"lock":null}
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/29
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":29,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of mild weather. Wind NW. Opened two accounts at chapmans WBS &amp; JRS Executors &amp; JRS private. Dined at home &amp; drank tea at Mr Deightoughe , not well</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":26,"lock":null}
14:36:41.555 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
