14:36:41.560 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":30,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. The air rather cool. Wind NW. Went over the water &amp; called upon Mr Heatley . Dined at Mr Tibbs, Tynemouth</p>","pageId":688,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":27,"lock":null}
14:36:41.560 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
