14:36:41.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/305
14:36:41.562 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":305,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine &amp; extremely mild day. Wind W by S. At church morning &amp; afternoon. Dined with Mrs Scott. Went in the evening to the Quakers meeting to hear a woman preach; a tolerable discourse.</p>","pageId":711,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":289,"lock":null}
