14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":315,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of beautiful weather &amp; very mild for the season. Wind SW. Out shooting all the morning. Killed a 1 &frac12;  brace of birds. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Culling</span> also out &amp; killed 2 &frac12; braces &amp; a hare.</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":298,"lock":null}
14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/316
14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":316,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; WSW. Mr Culley left us this morning. Out shooting from 12 o'clock to 3 o'clock towards Amble &amp; killed 2 &frac12; braces. Shot very well today. Tom &amp; Fanny drove this morning to Brinkburn. Fanny remained there &amp; Tom returned in the evening. Sent a brace of birds to Mrs Scott and a brace to J Tinley</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":299,"lock":null}
