14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":316,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather. Wind SW &amp; WSW. Mr Culley left us this morning. Out shooting from 12 o'clock to 3 o'clock towards Amble &amp; killed 2 &frac12; braces. Shot very well today. Tom &amp; Fanny drove this morning to Brinkburn. Fanny remained there &amp; Tom returned in the evening. Sent a brace of birds to Mrs Scott and a brace to J Tinley</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":299,"lock":null}
14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/317
14:36:41.568 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":317,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather exceedingly fine. Wind SW. Out shooting all this morning. Birds very wild. Did not kill one. Shot a hare. Sent it with 2 &frac12; braces of birds to Mrs Scott, I Tinby &amp; Mr Mark. Tom also out today &amp; killed 1 &frac12; braces. Mr Elliott dined &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":712,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":300,"lock":null}
