14:36:41.573 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":328,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A delightful day. Wind, but little in the morning at NW, afterwards changed to SE. Robert Brown left us for Brinkburn. Tom Smith drove him beyond Felton. Went out shooting but had no sport. Birds wild &amp; scent bad.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":311,"lock":null}
14:36:41.573 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/329
14:36:41.573 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":329,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cool morning &amp; thick weather. Wind SE. Walked twice to the colliery. Miss M Watson came up &amp; dined at Togston. Played at whist in the evening</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":312,"lock":null}
14:36:41.573 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
