14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":333,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather still cold &amp; wind SSE. Received a letter from William to attend Birds meeting at Newcastle. Went up but the commissioners would not allow our claim. Returned home to dinner. Drank tea at J Tinleys.</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":316,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/334
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
