14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":334,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day. Wind NE. At church in the morning. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Mrs Scott,</p>","pageId":713,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":317,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/335
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":335,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day. Very stormy with sleet &amp; hail. Wind in the morning NE &amp; changed to SE. On board the Hope. Tom &amp; Fanny Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith arrived from Togston.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":318,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
