14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":335,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day. Very stormy with sleet &amp; hail. Wind in the morning NE &amp; changed to SE. On board the Hope. Tom &amp; Fanny Smith &amp; Emma Galbraith arrived from Togston.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":318,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/336
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
14:36:41.576 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/336
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":336,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very frosty cold day. Wind WSW. The Hope got 4 keels down today. Dined at home. Robert made a bad collection of rents.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":319,"lock":null}
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/337
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":337,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant &amp; raw cold day. Wind SSW. The Hope got all her coals today, but being thick weather and poor prospect, did not go to sea. Mrs Matthews &amp; Miss Liddell drank tea with us. Gave Stephenson &pound;8. To my astonishment a writ of arrest was opened against me by Bland, Dunn the tailor partners . Very unhandsome conduct as William had called upon him to settle the account before I left town.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":320,"lock":null}
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/337
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":337,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant &amp; raw cold day. Wind SSW. The Hope got all her coals today, but being thick weather and poor prospect, did not go to sea. Mrs Matthews &amp; Miss Liddell drank tea with us. Gave Stephenson &pound;8. To my astonishment a writ of arrest was opened against me by Bland, Dunn the tailor partners . Very unhandsome conduct as William had called upon him to settle the account before I left town.</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":320,"lock":null}
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/338
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":338,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly cold damp unpleasant day. Thick weather &amp; wind SE &amp; SSE. The Smiths left us for Togston. Wrote to William. Dined with Mrs Scott. In the evening at the card club. Won 4/-. The Hope not got out. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":321,"lock":null}
14:36:41.577 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
