14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":338,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An exceedingly cold damp unpleasant day. Thick weather &amp; wind SE &amp; SSE. The Smiths left us for Togston. Wrote to William. Dined with Mrs Scott. In the evening at the card club. Won 4/-. The Hope not got out. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":321,"lock":null}
14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/339
14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":339,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw damp day. A few loaded ships got out [in] the morning tide with a poor prospect. Wind SE blowing fresh all day. Several light ships got down. The Hope still in the harbour. <span class=highlight_yellow>Wellington</span> coals 45/- at Wednesdays market. Only 7 ships there</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":322,"lock":null}
14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
