14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/34
14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":34,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but cold. Wind SSW. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":31,"lock":null}
14:36:41.578 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
