14:36:41.579 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/341
14:36:41.579 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":341,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A heavy fall of rain with wind at ESE in the afternoon. It got to E &amp; NE with a deluge of rain. Dined at home. No ships sailed. Received a letter from William of his having paid Bland, the tailor my bill with costs &pound;35.9.10</p>","pageId":714,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":324,"lock":null}
