14:36:41.583 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":349,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant day, but blowing hard from SSW. On board the Amity. Went over the water to see Mr P Laing respecting Che Harry's account, but did not see him, he being in London. Dined at home. Suppered with H Harry. Received a letter from William.</p>","pageId":715,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":332,"lock":null}
14:36:41.583 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/35
14:36:41.583 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":35,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day &amp; mild. Wind SSW to WSW. Engaged in the morning in examining my father's old papers &amp; accounts in search of the Ariel's vouchers and burning such papers as were out of date &amp; useless. Dined at home &amp; at the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":32,"lock":null}
14:36:41.583 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
