14:36:41.597 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":38,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day, Wind WSW. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley &amp; boys. Dined at home</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":35,"lock":null}
