14:36:41.597 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/380
14:36:41.597 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":380,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Xmas day. A fine day. Wind SSW. Went to church in the morning &amp; afterwards walked up to Benton to dinner &amp; stayed all night. Wrote to William to take the Hope off risk of British Club</p>","pageId":718,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":363,"lock":null}
14:36:41.597 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
