14:36:41.599 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":385,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Rather thick. Wind SW. Dined at home. Paid into Chapmans on my own account &pound;10.11.2</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":368,"lock":null}
14:36:41.599 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
