14:36:41.603 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":391,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day &amp; cold. Very <span class=highlight_yellow>appearance</span> of a change of weather. Wind NNW &amp; N. Went to church morning &amp; afternoon. Dined at J Tinley's. Geo &amp; Mrs Heddek there.</p>","pageId":719,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":373,"lock":null}
