14:36:41.603 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/392
14:36:41.603 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":392,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Wind NE. Cols &amp; sea high at night, a little snow &amp; frost. Dined at home. Received a letter from William. Engaged most of the morning in the office writing. Mrs Dixon brought Emma home.</p>","pageId":720,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":374,"lock":null}
