14:36:41.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/404
14:36:41.609 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":404,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winters day. Ground covered with snow, but not much of a frost. Wind at NNW. Called  upon Mr Ferguson &amp; got some drawings for copying, engaged in it all afternoon. Dined at home. Mrs Scott down stairs in one of her bad humours &amp; very disagreeable. Attended the whist club at <span class=highlight_yellow>Drewgs</span>. Paid Reed apprentice 7/- cost week board &amp; lodgings.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":386,"lock":null}
