14:36:41.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":410,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day. A continuance of frost &amp; snow and a gale of wind SE &amp; SSE, sea high. A few loaded ships put back. Dined at home. Spent the evening at J Tinleys. Paid Reed a week's lodging 7/-.</p>","pageId":721,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":392,"lock":null}
14:36:41.612 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
