14:36:41.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/412
14:36:41.613 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":412,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Hard frost. Wind NW. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home &amp; took wine with A Metcalf</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":394,"lock":null}
