14:36:41.617 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":42,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, but turned out fine. Wind S by W. On board the Hope all the morning got cables upon deck, found them in fair order. Dined with Dr Drury.  Whist club in evening</p>","pageId":689,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":39,"lock":null}
14:36:41.617 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/420
14:36:41.617 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":420,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty day &amp; sharp frost. Wind W by S. Engaged part of the morning drawing. Took a walk round by the ship. Found all <span class=highlight_yellow>right</span>, Stephenson on board waiting for Mr Cleths to survey her for the Premium Club. Dinned with Mr Chapman of <span class=highlight_yellow>Elseneur</span> at the Commercial. A French &amp; W Boswell came and took wine. Went to the theatre, Crooks benefit, a fair house&amp; the last night of performance for the season. Got &pound;5 of Chapman for self.</p>","pageId":722,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":402,"lock":null}
14:36:41.617 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
