14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":424,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning. Wind W by N. Paid Brown for <span class=highlight_yellow>oakeun</span> &amp; for Hope's buffet &amp; the year &pound;21. Dined at I Fenwicks, Preston Villa, a party of 18</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":406,"lock":null}
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/425
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/425
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":425,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind NNW. Employed the first of the morning in drawing. Went to the <span class=highlight_yellow>news</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>jbetenaid</span> room. Dined at home. In the evening at the club at J Tinley's. Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Walowstegs</span> ship that Fenwick fixed by Mr Allen in Quebec &amp; East coast at the shipowners rates.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":407,"lock":null}
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/426
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
14:36:41.619 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/426
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":426,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning, having been a great deal of rain during the night. Wind NNW. Mrs Scott very ill. Wind variable during the day between NNW &amp; N by E. At church in the morning. The newspapers countenancing the speeding in Parliaments of the news as to declaring their intention  to grant Catholic emancipation which caused a great sensation here, but particularly to the <span class=highlight_yellow>incomcas</span> to it in both houses of parliament. Dined at J Tinley's. The two Carrs there.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":408,"lock":null}
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/427
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/427
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":427,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind NW. Engaged in the morning drawing. Dined at home. Went over the water &amp; joined H Harry, Boswell, French &amp; Nicolson at Bullocks &amp; took wine. Went to the theatre in the evening at North Shields. Received a letter from William. Mrs Scott suffering dreadful pain.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":409,"lock":null}
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/428
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":428,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; wind NW. Mrs Scott in great pain last night. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans for private use. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined in the Commercial, the <span class=highlight_yellow>Limited</span> &amp; Eligible Clubs. Sat very late.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":410,"lock":null}
14:36:41.620 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/428
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":428,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning &amp; wind NW. Mrs Scott in great pain last night. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans for private use. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined in the Commercial, the <span class=highlight_yellow>Limited</span> &amp; Eligible Clubs. Sat very late.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":410,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/429
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":429,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Attended the meeting of the Master Mariners, when the rules were read over &amp; adopted. Walked up to Milburn's Place to see the ship. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":411,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/429
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":429,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Attended the meeting of the Master Mariners, when the rules were read over &amp; adopted. Walked up to Milburn's Place to see the ship. Dined at home. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":411,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/43
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":43,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day, Wind West. Brought the Hope down to the Low Light shore to get her ballast out and agreed with a man to repair &amp; refit all the rigging for &pound;10</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":40,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/43
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":43,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine day, Wind West. Brought the Hope down to the Low Light shore to get her ballast out and agreed with a man to repair &amp; refit all the rigging for &pound;10</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":40,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/430
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":430,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning, but damp having been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind NW. A meeting held of the committees of clubs to demand an explanation of Joe Elder for fixing his ship below the rates of freight determined upon by shipowners. <span class=highlight_yellow>It is</span> not the first time he has been guilty of such dishonest practices. He could not <span class=highlight_yellow>explain</span> himself &amp; unless Mr Bell cancels the charter, which will be known tomorrow, Eldess ships will be turned out of the clubs, the proper way of treating such fellows. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club &amp; afterwards went to a large bridal party at Tom Wrights</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":412,"lock":null}
14:36:41.621 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/430
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":430,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning, but damp having been a great deal of rain in the night. Wind NW. A meeting held of the committees of clubs to demand an explanation of Joe Elder for fixing his ship below the rates of freight determined upon by shipowners. <span class=highlight_yellow>It is</span> not the first time he has been guilty of such dishonest practices. He could not <span class=highlight_yellow>explain</span> himself &amp; unless Mr Bell cancels the charter, which will be known tomorrow, Eldess ships will be turned out of the clubs, the proper way of treating such fellows. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club &amp; afterwards went to a large bridal party at Tom Wrights</p>","pageId":723,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":412,"lock":null}
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/431
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":431,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite mild &amp; spring weather. Wind WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined with the Friendly club at the George Tavern where we had a handsome dinner &amp; spent a pleasant evening. Saw Ann <span class=highlight_yellow>Mallot</span></p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":413,"lock":null}
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/431
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":431,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Quite mild &amp; spring weather. Wind WNW. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Dined with the Friendly club at the George Tavern where we had a handsome dinner &amp; spent a pleasant evening. Saw Ann <span class=highlight_yellow>Mallot</span></p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":413,"lock":null}
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/432
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":432,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Called at D Dixons. Found Mrs Dixon about to set off for Shields to see Mrs Scott. Called at G Dunn &amp; Sons &amp; refused to load their coals without being upheld. Afterwards walked down to Shields. Dined at Mrs Reeds with a large party. The bridal party Mr &amp; Mrs Tom Wright there. Attended the whist club at A Metcalf. Paid R Brown the account &pound;4.10/-</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":414,"lock":null}
14:36:41.622 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/432
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":432,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Called at D Dixons. Found Mrs Dixon about to set off for Shields to see Mrs Scott. Called at G Dunn &amp; Sons &amp; refused to load their coals without being upheld. Afterwards walked down to Shields. Dined at Mrs Reeds with a large party. The bridal party Mr &amp; Mrs Tom Wright there. Attended the whist club at A Metcalf. Paid R Brown the account &pound;4.10/-</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":414,"lock":null}
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/433
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":433,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning with the appearance of rain &amp; blowing fresh at WNW. Mrs Scott in a devil of a humour blowing every person up right &amp; left. I think her mind must be affected. Went to church. Took a family dinner with A Harry. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Met Bell Jervis for the first time.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":415,"lock":null}
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/433
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":433,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild morning with the appearance of rain &amp; blowing fresh at WNW. Mrs Scott in a devil of a humour blowing every person up right &amp; left. I think her mind must be affected. Went to church. Took a family dinner with A Harry. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Met Bell Jervis for the first time.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":415,"lock":null}
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/434
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":434,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calm wind about West. Walked to the ship &amp; ordered the sails &amp; small stones on board. About noon it turned very thick weather &amp; the wind suddenly changed to NE with heavy rain that lasted all night</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":416,"lock":null}
14:36:41.623 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/434
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":434,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; calm wind about West. Walked to the ship &amp; ordered the sails &amp; small stones on board. About noon it turned very thick weather &amp; the wind suddenly changed to NE with heavy rain that lasted all night</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":416,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/435
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":435,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning it having been a great deal of rain &amp; sleet during the night. Wind NNW changeable during the day to ENE &amp; NE. Went down to the ship. The committee on board surveying stores for the Hope club. Dined at J Tinleys with a party of gentlemen. We all afterwards went to the ball. Only 52 there, but a pleasant dancing ball. Ordered a new mainstaysail for the Hope.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":417,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/435
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":435,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning it having been a great deal of rain &amp; sleet during the night. Wind NNW changeable during the day to ENE &amp; NE. Went down to the ship. The committee on board surveying stores for the Hope club. Dined at J Tinleys with a party of gentlemen. We all afterwards went to the ball. Only 52 there, but a pleasant dancing ball. Ordered a new mainstaysail for the Hope.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":417,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/436
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":436,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind WNN &amp; looks like more rain. Turned very cold towards afternoon &amp; wind changed to SE &amp; S by E. Went to Newcastle but everything very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. Returned home to dinner.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":418,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/436
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":436,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind WNN &amp; looks like more rain. Turned very cold towards afternoon &amp; wind changed to SE &amp; S by E. Went to Newcastle but everything very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. Returned home to dinner.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":418,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/437
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":437,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind SW. Has been some rain in the night. Received a letter from the committee of the Hope Club ordering us to get a new <span class=highlight_yellow>lamp</span> &amp; next winter a new foresail. Also now four new ballast shovels. Engaged all the morning writing to William &amp; the Galbraiths. Found Mrs Craig in a chaise &amp; went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Walls</span> to dine with Mr J Wright, a large party of 18. Spent a pleasant day &amp; had the best port wine I ever tasted in my life. Got home at 12 o'clock.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":419,"lock":null}
14:36:41.624 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/437
14:36:41.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":437,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Wind SW. Has been some rain in the night. Received a letter from the committee of the Hope Club ordering us to get a new <span class=highlight_yellow>lamp</span> &amp; next winter a new foresail. Also now four new ballast shovels. Engaged all the morning writing to William &amp; the Galbraiths. Found Mrs Craig in a chaise &amp; went to <span class=highlight_yellow>Walls</span> to dine with Mr J Wright, a large party of 18. Spent a pleasant day &amp; had the best port wine I ever tasted in my life. Got home at 12 o'clock.</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":419,"lock":null}
14:36:41.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/438
14:36:41.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":438,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Mr mark &amp; I took a walk along the Herd sand. Dined at home. Suppered at Mr Bradshower</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":420,"lock":null}
14:36:41.625 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/438
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":438,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW. Mr mark &amp; I took a walk along the Herd sand. Dined at home. Suppered at Mr Bradshower</p>","pageId":724,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":420,"lock":null}
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/439
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":439,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW At 10 o'clock am wind suddenly changed to SE with thick fog &amp; very raw and cold. Went to Newcastle by coach but could not get anything for the Hope. Called at Mrs Dixon's. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at A Dales. Received a letter from J Young demanding payment of their claims upon W &amp; J Scott which we shall most certainly not accede to, he having agreed to take the <span class=highlight_yellow>comporation</span> with the other creditors.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":421,"lock":null}
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/439
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":439,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SW At 10 o'clock am wind suddenly changed to SE with thick fog &amp; very raw and cold. Went to Newcastle by coach but could not get anything for the Hope. Called at Mrs Dixon's. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club at A Dales. Received a letter from J Young demanding payment of their claims upon W &amp; J Scott which we shall most certainly not accede to, he having agreed to take the <span class=highlight_yellow>comporation</span> with the other creditors.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":421,"lock":null}
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/44
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":44,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day, Wind SE. On board the Hope in moorings. Got the rigging all down, a fire lighted in the cabin &amp; hold partly scraped &amp; cleared. Dined at the vicars &amp; met a very pleasant party. Received a letter &amp; wrote to William</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":41,"lock":null}
14:36:41.626 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
