14:36:41.627 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":44,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold day, Wind SE. On board the Hope in moorings. Got the rigging all down, a fire lighted in the cabin &amp; hold partly scraped &amp; cleared. Dined at the vicars &amp; met a very pleasant party. Received a letter &amp; wrote to William</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":41,"lock":null}
14:36:41.627 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/440
14:36:41.627 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":440,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind E by N. About 10 o'clock am it began to rain very heavy &amp; continued all the morning. Went to church. Dined with J Tinley</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":422,"lock":null}
14:36:41.627 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
