14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":445,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind SSW. Dined at home. In the evening attended a large party at Mr J Fenwicks, Preston Villa, about 120 there, a dinner.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":427,"lock":null}
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/446
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":446,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold foggy morning. Wind SW. Drove up to Newcastle with Mr Tinley, called upon Mrs Dixon, went to the Quay side, but could not do anything for the Hope. Returned to Shields by steam boat. Dined with J Tinley &amp; went to the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":428,"lock":null}
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/446
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":446,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold foggy morning. Wind SW. Drove up to Newcastle with Mr Tinley, called upon Mrs Dixon, went to the Quay side, but could not do anything for the Hope. Returned to Shields by steam boat. Dined with J Tinley &amp; went to the whist club at Mr Richmonds in the evening.</p>","pageId":725,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":428,"lock":null}
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/447
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
14:36:41.629 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/447
14:36:41.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":447,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW &amp; cool, rather frosty during the night. Went to church. On my return found Mr Dixon, Bell Smith &amp; Tom had come down to see Mrs Smith. In the afternoon walked to Tynemouth &amp; called upon Mr Jackson 80<sup>th</sup> regiment. In the evening at the Mulstrum. Had all <span class=highlight_yellow>Laserio</span></p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":429,"lock":null}
14:36:41.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/448
14:36:41.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":448,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SE &amp; E by S. Went to Newcastle by steam. Could do nothing for the Hope. Walked up to Westgate Street &amp; the billiard rooms. Returned to Shields to dinner. Spent the latter part of the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":430,"lock":null}
14:36:41.630 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
