14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/45
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":45,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>An extremely cold &amp; frosty day. Wind SSE &amp; every appearance of bad weather At church in the morning - Young King preached. Dined at home. At night blew a gale of wind. A heavy sea on the bar. Wrote to Bessy &amp; Captain Lewis</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":42,"lock":null}
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
