14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/450
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":450,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind NE. Tom &amp; Bell Smith started for Togston. I returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Went to a small party in the evening at Mr Marks</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":432,"lock":null}
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
