14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":450,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A raw cold morning. Wind NE. Tom &amp; Bell Smith started for Togston. I returned to Shields by steam to dinner. Went to a small party in the evening at Mr Marks</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":432,"lock":null}
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/451
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":451,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NE. Wrote to J Young that we were made to pay him &amp; his father's lie <span class=highlight_yellow>leaedind</span> but no more. Added a postscript to J Tindley's letter to William. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":433,"lock":null}
14:36:41.631 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
