14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":451,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind NE. Wrote to J Young that we were made to pay him &amp; his father's lie <span class=highlight_yellow>leaedind</span> but no more. Added a postscript to J Tindley's letter to William. Dined at home. Attended the whist club in the evening.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":433,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/452
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":452,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold. Wind NNE. Walked up to the ship. George <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> employed rigging her with only the <span class=highlight_yellow>apprentice</span> of the little boy Ned Reed. <span class=highlight_yellow>For</span> a very fine young man, only been seven coal voyages &amp; is as good as any man. Dined at home. Saw poor Richard Brown who I much fear has not long to live.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":434,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/452
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":452,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cold. Wind NNE. Walked up to the ship. George <span class=highlight_yellow>Slofs</span> employed rigging her with only the <span class=highlight_yellow>apprentice</span> of the little boy Ned Reed. <span class=highlight_yellow>For</span> a very fine young man, only been seven coal voyages &amp; is as good as any man. Dined at home. Saw poor Richard Brown who I much fear has not long to live.</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":434,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/453
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":453,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle but evening continues very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. An immense number of people at Newcastle, having been to see the unfortunate woman <span class=highlight_silver>Jane </span><span class=highlight_silver>Jameson</span> hanged for the murder of her mother. Returned home by steam to dinner. Attended the whist club at J Dale's. Met Jane Thompson for the first time at Jenny Maxwells</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":435,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/453
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":453,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. Wind NW. Went by coach to Newcastle but evening continues very dull &amp; could do nothing for the Hope. An immense number of people at Newcastle, having been to see the unfortunate woman <span class=highlight_silver>Jane </span><span class=highlight_silver>Jameson</span> hanged for the murder of her mother. Returned home by steam to dinner. Attended the whist club at J Dale's. Met Jane Thompson for the first time at Jenny Maxwells</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":435,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/454
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":454,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but rather dull. Wind NW. Took physic &amp; could not go to church. Wrote to Mr P Lacing respecting C Harry's claim. At the <span class=highlight_yellow>grange man</span> Sunderland. Dined at home. The newspapers today filled with <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Puls</span> expositions of the measures of <span class=highlight_yellow>ministise</span> for the relief of the Catholics. Took wine in the evening with H Harry &amp; J Lunning have at the Albion. Afterwards called at the Mulstrum &amp; saw Bell Jarvis !!!!</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":436,"lock":null}
14:36:41.632 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.633 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/454
14:36:41.633 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":454,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but rather dull. Wind NW. Took physic &amp; could not go to church. Wrote to Mr P Lacing respecting C Harry's claim. At the <span class=highlight_yellow>grange man</span> Sunderland. Dined at home. The newspapers today filled with <span class=highlight_yellow>Mr </span><span class=highlight_yellow>Puls</span> expositions of the measures of <span class=highlight_yellow>ministise</span> for the relief of the Catholics. Took wine in the evening with H Harry &amp; J Lunning have at the Albion. Afterwards called at the Mulstrum &amp; saw Bell Jarvis !!!!</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":436,"lock":null}
14:36:41.633 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/455
14:36:41.633 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":455,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW. On board the Hope. Brought some beef <span class=highlight_yellow>6.0.6 at 4 o'clock</span>. Dined at Mr Allen's &amp; suppered in the evening at the George with a party. An Oyster supper. Kept it up very late. Paid &pound;1.4/- entrance for Friday C Club. Got &pound;5 of Chapmans</p>","pageId":726,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":437,"lock":null}
