14:36:41.635 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/46
14:36:41.635 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":46,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very stormy cold day with a heavy fall of snow. Busy with the rigging at the ropery. A heavy sea upon the bar, Wind SE by S. Dined at home. Wrote to Messrs Lees &amp; Co</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":43,"lock":null}
