14:36:41.639 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":468,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Most beautiful weather. Rather frosty &amp; wind SSE &amp; SE. Came down to Shields by steamer &amp; changed my cloths. Received a letter from William with one to J Tinley. Returned by steam to Newcastle &amp; again dined and stayed all night with D Dixon. Mrs Coll Dixon dined with us</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":450,"lock":null}
14:36:41.639 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/469
14:36:41.639 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":469,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp &amp; unpleasant cold morning, blowing fresh  from the SE. Some loaded ships put back. Gave J Tinley, William's letter. My cold so much worse today &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>allofother</span> so unwell that I was obliged to lay up &amp; take physic.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":451,"lock":null}
14:36:41.639 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
