14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":469,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp &amp; unpleasant cold morning, blowing fresh  from the SE. Some loaded ships put back. Gave J Tinley, William's letter. My cold so much worse today &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>allofother</span> so unwell that I was obliged to lay up &amp; take physic.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":451,"lock":null}
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/47
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":47,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather very wintery and cold. Wind E by NE &amp; snow showers. Dined at home. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":44,"lock":null}
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
