14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":47,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather very wintery and cold. Wind E by NE &amp; snow showers. Dined at home. Mrs Scott very ill</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":44,"lock":null}
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/470
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":470,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but the wind still from the SE. Confined myself entirely to the house in consequence of my cold.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":452,"lock":null}
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
