14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":470,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but the wind still from the SE. Confined myself entirely to the house in consequence of my cold.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":452,"lock":null}
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/471
14:36:41.640 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":471,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Frosty weather. Wind changed to NW. Walked to the newsroom about 2 o'clock &amp; read the papers. Wind in the afternoon changed to about N by E &amp; NNE. The Lady Jane sailed for the <span class=highlight_yellow>fishery</span>. Gave Mrs Scott her &frac14; year annuity &pound;75</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":453,"lock":null}
