14:36:41.641 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":472,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day, rather cool. Wind ENE to SSE. At the newsroom &amp; walked to Milburn Place with Mr Mark. Mrs Dixon came down to see Mrs Scott &amp; dinner. Attended the whist club for the last time this season.</p>","pageId":728,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":454,"lock":null}
14:36:41.641 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/473
