14:36:41.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":476,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning having been a little rain. Wind E. Went over to Sunderland with Captain Bunbury &amp; Jackson of the 80<sup>th</sup>. Allen Davies of the artillery to dine at the Mulstrum &amp; spent a pleasant day. The Hope got to London on Friday afternoon.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":458,"lock":null}
14:36:41.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/477
14:36:41.643 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":477,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":3,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A wet morning &amp; cool. Wind NE with showers of snow towards the middle of the day. Jackson &amp; I returned from Sunderland. Dined at Mr Matthews, a party.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":459,"lock":null}
