14:36:41.644 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/479
14:36:41.644 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":479,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather with showers of snow &amp; wind NNW. Although a heavy swell upon the bar &amp; occasionally breaking, several ships got to sea. Dined at home. In the evening at the Jarvis's with Bell.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":461,"lock":null}
