14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":48,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Exceedingly cold weather &amp; frosty. Wind variable between SE &amp; SSW. Dined at home &amp; at a party at Mrs Recds in evening. Sent to William their promissory notes at 12.18 &amp; 24 months to Messrs Lees for &pound;400, 400 &amp; 450 dated  11 feb 1828</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":45,"lock":null}
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/480
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":480,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A clear frosty morning. Wind NW. received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 38/6  8/3 for <span class=highlight_yellow>Town by</span> = to <span class=highlight_yellow>7</span> freight <span class=highlight_yellow>eneserable</span> work. Dined at home. Slept all night with Bell Jervis at her sisters.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":462,"lock":null}
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
