14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":480,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A clear frosty morning. Wind NW. received a letter from William of the sale of the Hope at 38/6  8/3 for <span class=highlight_yellow>Town by</span> = to <span class=highlight_yellow>7</span> freight <span class=highlight_yellow>eneserable</span> work. Dined at home. Slept all night with Bell Jervis at her sisters.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":462,"lock":null}
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/481
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":481,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind WNW. Got home to breakfast after sleeping with Bell Jarvis. The wind in the afternoon changed to SE. Several ships sailed for America &amp; the Baltic. The XYZ <span class=highlight_yellow>Ld</span><span class=highlight_yellow> the soles run</span>.  Dined with J Tinley, Ian Carr married to Sam Barton &amp; got home this morning attended the whist club at H Dales.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":463,"lock":null}
14:36:41.645 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
