14:36:41.646 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":481,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful mild morning. Wind WNW. Got home to breakfast after sleeping with Bell Jarvis. The wind in the afternoon changed to SE. Several ships sailed for America &amp; the Baltic. The XYZ <span class=highlight_yellow>Ld</span><span class=highlight_yellow> the soles run</span>.  Dined with J Tinley, Ian Carr married to Sam Barton &amp; got home this morning attended the whist club at H Dales.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":463,"lock":null}
14:36:41.646 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/482
14:36:41.646 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":482,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp morning wind SSE. Turned out very wet. Wrote to William. Wind changed in the afternoon to SE. Found myself very queer this morning in consequence of late hours &amp; last night at the Dales. Stayed in the house all day. In the evening at the newsroom &amp; called at the Mulstrum &amp; gave Bennett a <span class=highlight_yellow>turn</span>.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":464,"lock":null}
14:36:41.646 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
