14:36:41.647 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/483
14:36:41.647 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":483,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull wet morning. Wind E. Engaged in the house reading until 12 o'clock. Called upon J Hearn about his bell for the Hope, but he was not at the sail-loft. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":465,"lock":null}
