14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":485,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull thick morning &amp; turned out wet. Wind NW. Heard from Mr Stephenson the Hope was out on Monday &amp; going to take in dung. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":729,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":467,"lock":null}
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/486
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":486,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by E &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Bowies Brittania arrived in the harbour this morning without the Captain Mr W Bowie on board. Supposed to have jumped out of the cabin window when off the bar. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon joined me &amp; returned home in the evening.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":468,"lock":null}
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/486
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":486,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind S by E &amp; heavy sea upon the bar. Bowies Brittania arrived in the harbour this morning without the Captain Mr W Bowie on board. Supposed to have jumped out of the cabin window when off the bar. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon joined me &amp; returned home in the evening.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":468,"lock":null}
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/487
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":487,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather moderating and fair having been very strong all night. Wind about E by S. Several ships arrived this morning. Among them the Hope having left London on Tuesday. A schooner loaded with grain got upon the hard Sand, the sea higher than has been this winter. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>Townty</span><span class=highlight_yellow> main</span> again the price <span class=highlight_yellow>20/ chat</span> &amp; to be applied 8/6 freight. Returned by steam to dinner. Wind changed to SW &amp; then to SE.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":469,"lock":null}
14:36:41.648 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.649 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/487
14:36:41.649 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":487,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather moderating and fair having been very strong all night. Wind about E by S. Several ships arrived this morning. Among them the Hope having left London on Tuesday. A schooner loaded with grain got upon the hard Sand, the sea higher than has been this winter. Went to Newcastle &amp; fixed the Hope to load <span class=highlight_yellow>Townty</span><span class=highlight_yellow> main</span> again the price <span class=highlight_yellow>20/ chat</span> &amp; to be applied 8/6 freight. Returned by steam to dinner. Wind changed to SW &amp; then to SE.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":469,"lock":null}
14:36:41.649 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/488
14:36:41.649 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":488,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fair morning. Wind WNW. About 11 o'clock began to rain. Drew &pound;40 out of Chapmans to pay wages &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>hadesmens</span> bells for the Hope. Mr Mark <span class=highlight_yellow>sit </span>took our dinner on board. Wind got to ESE again. Attended the whist club at R Pearts. Wrote to William.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":470,"lock":null}
14:36:41.649 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
