14:36:41.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":492,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This morning dry weather but <span class=highlight_yellow>still</span> blowing hard all night &amp; still continuing from SSE &amp; S by E. The Hope moved down to a tier below the library to load up. Dined at home. Wrote the secretary of the Hope Club to reduce the value of the Hope to &pound;1600.</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":474,"lock":null}
14:36:41.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/493
14:36:41.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":493,"version":1,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A&nbsp;very&nbsp;wet&nbsp;morning.&nbsp;Wind&nbsp;SW.&nbsp;On&nbsp;board&nbsp;the&nbsp;Hope.&nbsp;She&nbsp;got&nbsp;two&nbsp;keels&nbsp;down&nbsp;today&nbsp;making&nbsp;15.&nbsp;Dined&nbsp;on&nbsp;board.&nbsp;Dr&nbsp;Drewery&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;W&nbsp;Peart&nbsp;with&nbsp;me.&nbsp;A&nbsp;great&nbsp;many&nbsp;ships&nbsp;got&nbsp;to&nbsp;sea&nbsp;this&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;The&nbsp;wind&nbsp;changed&nbsp;to&nbsp;S&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;S&nbsp;by&nbsp;E.&nbsp;Poor&nbsp;R&nbsp;Brown&nbsp;died&nbsp;today.&nbsp;A&nbsp;serious&nbsp;loss&nbsp;to&nbsp;his&nbsp;family.&nbsp;</p>","pageId":730,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":475,"lock":null}
14:36:41.652 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
