14:36:41.654 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":498,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Wind SSE. Dixon &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Befry</span> came down from Beaton &amp; the foreman &amp; I attended the remains of poor Rich Brown to the grave with his three youngest boys. I returned with them to dine &amp; stay all night at Benton.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":480,"lock":null}
