14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":5,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... as every man must do, who keeps there grand maxim in view &quot;Do onto others as you would they should do unto you&quot;, he who attends to this well , never get far wrong &amp; thank god so far I feel I can apply the quotation &quot;mens conscia recti&quot; to myself indeed . I am made to feel it by the kind &amp; friendly manner in which every person receive me I hope I deserve it, I do not know that I ever did an injury to anyone certain never intentionally.</p>\r\n<p>However there is one person whose conduct has indeed been that of a friend &amp; such a friend as seldom is met with &amp; I cannot omit recording it here &amp; were I ever to forget it should indeed be ungrateful &amp; unworthy of every kind feeling. John Tinley is the man who could feel for the misfortunes of another. He it was who paved the way for our emancipation from all difficulties. Where is the friend that would have acted as he did? I fear not to be found. He came forward not a friend in words but in deeds. He made not promises, nor exacted hopes &amp; expectations, to disappoint &amp; blast them when called upon. He saw our situation, he volunteered his services as security, without which we could have effected nothing &amp; thus has the primary cause of our accomplishing all that has been done. He thought he knew us &amp; I hope has not been deceived. This is what I call friendship, true &amp; sincere, not according to the worldly acceptation &amp; profanation of the word, but friendship in the true spirit &amp; meaning of the word.</p>\r\n<p>I yesterday, the last day of the old year, dined with this my excellent friend &amp; accompanied him Miss Barton A party to the ball &amp; spent a very pleasant evening &amp; thus ended the old &amp; began the new year merrily. I hope it is a good omen. Today I again dined with J Tinley to meet Mr Waldie to a very agreeable party.</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":2,"lock":null}
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/50
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":50,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The weather changed, a fine mild day &amp; rapid thaw wind W to NW. Dined at Mr Wrights. Several ships sailed</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":47,"lock":null}
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/50
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":50,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The weather changed, a fine mild day &amp; rapid thaw wind W to NW. Dined at Mr Wrights. Several ships sailed</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":47,"lock":null}
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/500
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":500,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another cold morning. Wind easterly. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley. In the evening called upon Mr J Young &amp; had a long conversation both with him about taking our dividend without surveying. Also he did not seem so determined in his opposition. He desired me to see H Dale &amp; talk to him.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":482,"lock":null}
14:36:41.655 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/500
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":500,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another cold morning. Wind easterly. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with J Tinley. In the evening called upon Mr J Young &amp; had a long conversation both with him about taking our dividend without surveying. Also he did not seem so determined in his opposition. He desired me to see H Dale &amp; talk to him.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":482,"lock":null}
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/501
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":501,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather &amp; ENE wind. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; R Peart &amp; drank whisky on board the Ardineaple  steamer Captain Cunningham. On our return when the boat reached the shore, Cunningham stumbled &amp; falling upon me, we both rolled overboard. Got a good dunking. Wrote to Mrs Scott of my determination not to make her an allowance.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":483,"lock":null}
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/501
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":501,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of cold weather &amp; ENE wind. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went with H Harry &amp; R Peart &amp; drank whisky on board the Ardineaple  steamer Captain Cunningham. On our return when the boat reached the shore, Cunningham stumbled &amp; falling upon me, we both rolled overboard. Got a good dunking. Wrote to Mrs Scott of my determination not to make her an allowance.</p>","pageId":731,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":483,"lock":null}
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/502
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":502,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but still cool &amp; wind NE &amp; ENE. Walked with H Harry to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Received a letter from William of the arrival &amp; sale of the Hope on Wednesday at 27/- = to 6/6 freight. This well I'm <span class=highlight_yellow>upheld</span> 8/6. Answered the letter desiring him to tender the Hope to the Gafs Co. to carry coal at &pound;9 a keel or 21/6 freight Newcastle <span class=highlight_yellow>cha</span>. Attended the whist club at Tibbs. Got &pound;5 of Chapman. <span class=highlight_yellow>Paid</span> steam boat for Hope 30/- <span class=highlight_yellow>aformenbec</span> 20/- washing 31/6</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":484,"lock":null}
14:36:41.656 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/502
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":502,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning but still cool &amp; wind NE &amp; ENE. Walked with H Harry to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Received a letter from William of the arrival &amp; sale of the Hope on Wednesday at 27/- = to 6/6 freight. This well I'm <span class=highlight_yellow>upheld</span> 8/6. Answered the letter desiring him to tender the Hope to the Gafs Co. to carry coal at &pound;9 a keel or 21/6 freight Newcastle <span class=highlight_yellow>cha</span>. Attended the whist club at Tibbs. Got &pound;5 of Chapman. <span class=highlight_yellow>Paid</span> steam boat for Hope 30/- <span class=highlight_yellow>aformenbec</span> 20/- washing 31/6</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":484,"lock":null}
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/503
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":503,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Quite summer weather. Wind S &amp; changed before 12 o'clock to SE. Attended morning service. Dined at home at 2 o'clock &amp; afterwards walked to Tynemouth with H Harry. On our return had a bottle of port at the George. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":485,"lock":null}
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/503
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":503,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Quite summer weather. Wind S &amp; changed before 12 o'clock to SE. Attended morning service. Dined at home at 2 o'clock &amp; afterwards walked to Tynemouth with H Harry. On our return had a bottle of port at the George. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":485,"lock":null}
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/504
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":504,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning. Wind N by W. In the house all the morning. Mrs Dixon brought Emma down again. Dined at house. In the evening went up to the castle &amp; played a rubber at Dacres rooms.  With rum I think!!!</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":486,"lock":null}
14:36:41.657 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/504
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":504,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning. Wind N by W. In the house all the morning. Mrs Dixon brought Emma down again. Dined at house. In the evening went up to the castle &amp; played a rubber at Dacres rooms.  With rum I think!!!</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":486,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/505
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":505,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning &amp; blowing fresh from the N &amp; W by N and increased to a very heavy gale of wind varying between NNW and NNE which brought on a tremendous sea, a small sloop in coming in got upon the Heard Sand. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":487,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/505
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":505,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A showery morning &amp; blowing fresh from the N &amp; W by N and increased to a very heavy gale of wind varying between NNW and NNE which brought on a tremendous sea, a small sloop in coming in got upon the Heard Sand. Dined at home.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":487,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/506
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":506,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The gale has continued all night with showers of snow with a tremendous sea. Wind continues the same as yesterday. The gales abated towards evening. Dined at home. In the evening with Bell Jarvis</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":488,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/506
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":506,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The gale has continued all night with showers of snow with a tremendous sea. Wind continues the same as yesterday. The gales abated towards evening. Dined at home. In the evening with Bell Jarvis</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":488,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/507
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":507,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; again calm Weather. Wind NW by N. Went to Newcastle by steamer to dine with Mr R <span class=highlight_yellow>Arsey</span> in Eldon Square. Spent a very pleasant day &amp; returned to Shields. In the evening took Mr Dacres <font color=#BFBFBF>&amp;</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font><span class=highlight_yellow>RA</span> with me. Tom Smith &amp; his mother arrived at Dockwray Square today.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":489,"lock":null}
14:36:41.658 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.659 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/507
14:36:41.659 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":507,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":4,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; again calm Weather. Wind NW by N. Went to Newcastle by steamer to dine with Mr R <span class=highlight_yellow>Arsey</span> in Eldon Square. Spent a very pleasant day &amp; returned to Shields. In the evening took Mr Dacres <font color=#BFBFBF>&amp;</font><font color=#BFBFBF> </font><span class=highlight_yellow>RA</span> with me. Tom Smith &amp; his mother arrived at Dockwray Square today.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":489,"lock":null}
14:36:41.659 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/508
14:36:41.659 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":508,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind NW walked about the town with Tom Smith the principle part of the morning. Dined at home &amp; took a walk to Tynemouth after dinner. Accepted <span class=highlight_yellow>In</span> Hearn's bill for &pound;34.7/- at 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>mo</span><span class=highlight_yellow>nth</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span> dated 27 April, due 30 July, for repairing Hope's sails. A most extraordinary bill.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":490,"lock":null}
14:36:41.659 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
