14:36:41.660 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":51,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day &amp; a little frost in the air. Wind WNW. A few ships sailed. Dined at home. A letter from William &amp; answered</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":48,"lock":null}
