14:36:41.660 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/510
14:36:41.660 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":510,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning after a few showers of rain during the night. Wind W by S. Tom Smith, Emma &amp; I went to church &amp; after <font color=#BFBFBF>[the] </font>service, Tom &amp; I walked up through the country to Benton, dined &amp; stayed all night. A very windy day &amp; unpleasant walking.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":492,"lock":null}
