14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":510,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild morning after a few showers of rain during the night. Wind W by S. Tom Smith, Emma &amp; I went to church &amp; after <font color=#BFBFBF>[the] </font>service, Tom &amp; I walked up through the country to Benton, dined &amp; stayed all night. A very windy day &amp; unpleasant walking.</p>","pageId":732,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":492,"lock":null}
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/511
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":511,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. But still blowing hard from the NW. Amused ourselves for a short time in the plantations with the beagles. Mrs Dixon took us into Newcastle in the carriage. Tom Smith transacted his business there &amp; we afterwards walked down to St Anthon's to see a sloop he had purchased for his colliery. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner.</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":493,"lock":null}
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/511
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":511,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A pleasant morning. But still blowing hard from the NW. Amused ourselves for a short time in the plantations with the beagles. Mrs Dixon took us into Newcastle in the carriage. Tom Smith transacted his business there &amp; we afterwards walked down to St Anthon's to see a sloop he had purchased for his colliery. Returned to Shields by steam to dinner.</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":493,"lock":null}
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/512
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":512,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine spring morning with showers. Wind SSW. Several light ships arrived. Tom &amp; Mrs Smith left us this morning for Benton. Dined at home. Accepted a bill at 3 <span class=highlight_yellow>months</span> dated 16 April for polices &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Insurance</span> 1 &amp; 2 coal voyages in general Premium Club &pound;13.7.10. With Bell Jervis in the evening</p>","pageId":733,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":494,"lock":null}
14:36:41.661 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
