14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/520
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":520,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind SE. The Hope gone up to the spout this tide. Walked with Captain Webb up to the Hope &amp; dined on board</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":502,"lock":null}
