14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":520,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind SE. The Hope gone up to the spout this tide. Walked with Captain Webb up to the Hope &amp; dined on board</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":502,"lock":null}
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/521
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":521,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind W by N. Changed to SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Gave the fitter the Hope's monthly bill. Called upon J Hodgson &amp; returned to dinner. In the evening a little rain.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":503,"lock":null}
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/521
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":521,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind W by N. Changed to SW. Went by steam to Newcastle. Gave the fitter the Hope's monthly bill. Called upon J Hodgson &amp; returned to dinner. In the evening a little rain.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":503,"lock":null}
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/522
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":522,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fine spring weather. Wind NE. Mr Mark, Mr Sadler &amp; I walked up to Cramlington Spout. Found the Hope hauling off &amp; she shortly after proceeded down the river having only taken in 14 keels. Dined with Mr Sadler. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":504,"lock":null}
14:36:41.665 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/522
14:36:41.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":522,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fine spring weather. Wind NE. Mr Mark, Mr Sadler &amp; I walked up to Cramlington Spout. Found the Hope hauling off &amp; she shortly after proceeded down the river having only taken in 14 keels. Dined with Mr Sadler. With Bell Jarvis in the evening.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":504,"lock":null}
14:36:41.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/523
14:36:41.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":523,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers morning. Wind ENE. Received a letter from William agreeing to offer Younger 10/- in the &pound;. Drew &pound;20 out of Chapman. &pound;15 for Stephenson &amp; &pound;5 for self. Drew &pound;5 more in the afternoon. Stephenson wanting &pound;20. Dined at home. In the evening called upon A Dale to propose to join Younger's 10/- in full. Dale <span class=highlight_yellow>sacfe</span> for Younger, who I afterwards found much to my relief of mind had agreed to our proposal. Spent the evening with Mr Allen. With Bell Jervis.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":505,"lock":null}
14:36:41.666 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/523
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":523,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful summers morning. Wind ENE. Received a letter from William agreeing to offer Younger 10/- in the &pound;. Drew &pound;20 out of Chapman. &pound;15 for Stephenson &amp; &pound;5 for self. Drew &pound;5 more in the afternoon. Stephenson wanting &pound;20. Dined at home. In the evening called upon A Dale to propose to join Younger's 10/- in full. Dale <span class=highlight_yellow>sacfe</span> for Younger, who I afterwards found much to my relief of mind had agreed to our proposal. Spent the evening with Mr Allen. With Bell Jervis.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":505,"lock":null}
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/524
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":524,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SE. The Hope was loaded on Friday but we could not go to sea in consequence of Young business. Determined not to sail until the morning tide. Walked to Tynemouth with H Harry. Took a warm bath. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Mr Dadler took wine with me. Wrote to William of my intention to sail ...</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":506,"lock":null}
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/524
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":524,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SE. The Hope was loaded on Friday but we could not go to sea in consequence of Young business. Determined not to sail until the morning tide. Walked to Tynemouth with H Harry. Took a warm bath. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; Mr Dadler took wine with me. Wrote to William of my intention to sail ...</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":506,"lock":null}
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/525
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":525,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>At 3 o'clock am got under way &amp; sailed from Shields with a westerly breeze &amp; fine weather. At 10 o'clock am becalmed off Sunderland, the wind having got round to SE. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock the breeze freshened a little but we made little way, being ebb tide. At 10 o'clock <span class=highlight_yellow>we</span> went to bed, the ship being abreast of the Tees</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":507,"lock":null}
14:36:41.667 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/525
14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":525,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>At 3 o'clock am got under way &amp; sailed from Shields with a westerly breeze &amp; fine weather. At 10 o'clock am becalmed off Sunderland, the wind having got round to SE. Between 1 &amp; 2 o'clock the breeze freshened a little but we made little way, being ebb tide. At 10 o'clock <span class=highlight_yellow>we</span> went to bed, the ship being abreast of the Tees</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":507,"lock":null}
14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/526
14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":526,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>has been blowing pretty fresh all night from the SE &amp; SSE. Got up at 8 o'clock am. The ship abreast of <span class=highlight_yellow>Hunt</span><span class=highlight_yellow>c</span><span class=highlight_yellow>li</span><span class=highlight_yellow>f</span><span class=highlight_yellow>f</span> Foot. The wind the same but moderate &amp; fine weather. Anne very unwell, but more frightened not having been at sea before. Towards evening wind very calm again. Turned in at 10 o'clock.  The ship in <span class=highlight_yellow>a very</span> little wind.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":508,"lock":null}
