14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/527
14:36:41.668 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":527,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NE. Turned out a 8 o'clock am. The ship off Robin Hoods but the ebb tide &amp; heavy SE swell setting against us drove us <span class=highlight_yellow>back</span> to Whitby. In the afternoon with the <span class=highlight_yellow>fload</span> a better breeze spring up &amp; set us ahead again &amp; 10 o'clock pm bed time, we were off Scarborough. A fine moonlit night.</p>","pageId":734,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":509,"lock":null}
