14:36:41.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":535,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of fine weather. Wind NE. Wrote to Mr Vernon to send <span class=highlight_yellow>Inspector</span> Galbraith to London. Walked into the city. Attended <span class=highlight_yellow>changers</span>. Did nothing. Dined with Richmond.</p>","pageId":735,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":517,"lock":null}
14:36:41.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/536
14:36:41.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":536,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":5,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning but fine weather. Wind still NE &amp; ENE. Mr Lee drove me into the city. Attended the local exchange. Sold 63 more of the Hope's coals. Went to the Royal Ex. Could not fix. Walked out of the city. Dined at Mr Lees. Mr &amp; Bob Marsh &amp; F Barclay there.</p>","pageId":736,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":518,"lock":null}
14:36:41.672 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
