14:36:41.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/540
14:36:41.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":540,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most beautiful morning. Wind NW. Walked into the city. Saw Ann. Fixed the Hope for Petersburg with Mr Hubbard ar 26/-. <span class=highlight_yellow>&amp; </span><span class=highlight_yellow>iow</span><span class=highlight_yellow> for fellow</span>. Walked to Mr Lees to dinner. Bob Marsh there, he &amp; the guests having been to Kensington gardens</p>","pageId":736,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":522,"lock":null}
14:36:41.674 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
