14:36:41.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":549,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; a fresh breeze from NW. Walked into the city with William. Got a new hat at Olipharts. Called for Bob Marsh &amp; we afterwards went by water to the Hope. Walked home to dinner</p>","pageId":737,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":527,"lock":null}
14:36:41.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/55
14:36:41.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":55,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind WSW. Got the Hope flats finished caulking &amp; blocks stowed. Brought a new mainmast of Miles Forster at &pound;7.10 per load less discount = &pound;20.11. Dined at home. At Mrs Clarks in evening a party</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":52,"lock":null}
14:36:41.679 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
