14:36:41.685 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":56,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A damp day. A little rain in the morning. Wind SE. A few ships arrived. Carpenters at work caulking the upper works. Dined at home. In the evening at whist club. Mr Macarthy called to say he was going to send the <span class=highlight_yellow>Brolog</span> Loves, to my brother</p>","pageId":690,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":53,"lock":null}
