l}
14:36:41.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/569
14:36:41.689 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":569,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":6,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out at &frac12; 7 o'clock. Found the ship still in sight of Falsterbo, having been working to windward all night &amp; made but little progress, <span class=highlight_yellow>wind</span> fast. After breakfast read the service &amp; lessons of the day. Just before I got upon deck, the XYZ passed us homeward bound, with a fine breeze &amp; studdingsails set. We continued working to westward the whole of the day. At 9 o'clock took our gin &amp; water &amp; went to bed.</p>","pageId":743,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":546,"lock":null}
