14:36:41.698 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":586,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out very early. The morning having to be on board the steam boat at 9 o'clock. After breakfast went on shore to the Custom House, got all our luggage &amp; an officer to accompany us to the steamer or otherwise it would have had to be searched again before we put it on board. The <span class=highlight_yellow>gunr</span> desk &amp; we left at Mr Williamsons a very respectable shopkeeper's until our return. At 9 o'clock we <span class=highlight_yellow>sent</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>asked</span> for Petersburg having a beautiful morning for our ... </p>","pageId":748,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":561,"lock":null}
