14:36:41.700 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":59,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring day. Wind S. Returned to Dockwray Square, found Mrs Scott not quite so well. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":56,"lock":null}
14:36:41.700 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/590
14:36:41.700 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":590,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":4,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... a head, exclusive of wine.</p>\r\n<p>In the evening we took a stroll. On our return to our lodgings, rather tired, &amp; thirsty, finished a bottle of beer, a couple of glasses of grog &amp; went to bed.</p>","pageId":751,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":565,"lock":null}
14:36:41.700 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
