14:36:41.709 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/607
14:36:41.709 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":607,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but windy &amp; dusty. This being the <font color=#BFBFBF>[day] </font>of St Peter &amp; St Paul, is a general holiday here &amp; services in all the churches. Mr Lindsey his friend Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Miggete</span>, Bob &amp; I walked out at 12 o'clock for a stroll. Looked into the Catholic Church where they were just concluding the service, their singing seemed to be good. Returned to my lodgings about 3 o'clock, leaving Bob to prolong his walk &amp; had a snooze being tired. Dined at the German Club at &frac12; past 5 o'clock. In the evening Bob &amp; I ...</p>","pageId":755,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":574,"lock":null}
14:36:41.709 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
