14:36:41.713 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":616,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Immediately after breakfast to <span class=highlight_yellow>drivzkeys</span> &amp; went to the Arsenal where we found the Baron had been as good as his word. A soldier was in waiting for us, who took us over the different departments. They were very busy making brass cannon. The machinery for boring &amp; polishing them very beautiful. Several rooms ...</p>","pageId":757,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":580,"lock":null}
