14:36:41.720 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":63,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine spring day. Wind SW. Dined at home &amp; at the whist club in the evening. Mrs Smith left us for Togston. Brought a trysailmast &amp; gib boom for &pound;4.12.6 &amp; got them on board</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":60,"lock":null}
