14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":636,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":30,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>In the evening light winds &amp; inclined to calm. Turned in before 10 o'clock after a glass of grog</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":598,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/637
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":637,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather and light breezes from WNW. During the whole of the morning mainly calm, barely going 2 knots with rather a strong sea. In the evening about 5 o'clock the wind got to the ENE &amp; increased to a fine breeze. The ship going about 4 &amp; 5 knots &amp; from midnight to 4 o'clock the wind blew so fresh she increased her rate to 6 knots. This fine breeze continued all night.</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":599,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/637
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":637,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":7,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather and light breezes from WNW. During the whole of the morning mainly calm, barely going 2 knots with rather a strong sea. In the evening about 5 o'clock the wind got to the ENE &amp; increased to a fine breeze. The ship going about 4 &amp; 5 knots &amp; from midnight to 4 o'clock the wind blew so fresh she increased her rate to 6 knots. This fine breeze continued all night.</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":599,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/638
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":638,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 7 o'clock. A fine morning. After a few hours rain  &amp; a beautiful breeze the whole of the night. At 8 o'clock am the wind changed to SE obliged us to get in lower studding sails. At 2 o'clock the wind got to S by W strong breezes &amp; hazy weather &amp; rain, very cold, more like November than August. At 6 o'clock close in with Gothland Ostergarmholm light house N &frac12; W distant about 12 miles. Tacked ship blowing fresh with a heavy head sea. Between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock discussed our grog &amp; turned in.</p>\r\n<p>This afternoon the Dido of Hull captain ____ passed astern of us. We hoisted our colours &amp; he answered</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":600,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/638
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":638,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at &frac12; past 7 o'clock. A fine morning. After a few hours rain  &amp; a beautiful breeze the whole of the night. At 8 o'clock am the wind changed to SE obliged us to get in lower studding sails. At 2 o'clock the wind got to S by W strong breezes &amp; hazy weather &amp; rain, very cold, more like November than August. At 6 o'clock close in with Gothland Ostergarmholm light house N &frac12; W distant about 12 miles. Tacked ship blowing fresh with a heavy head sea. Between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock discussed our grog &amp; turned in.</p>\r\n<p>This afternoon the Dido of Hull captain ____ passed astern of us. We hoisted our colours &amp; he answered</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":600,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/639
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":639,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at our usual hour. Finer weather, wind NE &amp; strong sea, but still cool. At noon by observation lat:57.8N  Wind WNW. The strong sea preventing us making more than 2 or 3 knots. Read service &amp; lessons for the day. In the afternoon wind NW &amp; blowing fresh, only going from 3 to 4 knots. A few ships in company. Amongst them Bowies Malvina. At 4 o'clock took in top gallants sails. Bob &amp; I very tired of this slow work.</p>\r\n<p>Between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock finished a couple of glasses of warm grog &amp; turned in hoping to sleep better than last night. The tallow casks making a most infernal creaking. Obliged to get the state room port light caulked, a pretty considerable quantity of water having come in &amp; wet my bed</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":601,"lock":null}
14:36:41.724 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/639
14:36:41.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":639,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up at our usual hour. Finer weather, wind NE &amp; strong sea, but still cool. At noon by observation lat:57.8N  Wind WNW. The strong sea preventing us making more than 2 or 3 knots. Read service &amp; lessons for the day. In the afternoon wind NW &amp; blowing fresh, only going from 3 to 4 knots. A few ships in company. Amongst them Bowies Malvina. At 4 o'clock took in top gallants sails. Bob &amp; I very tired of this slow work.</p>\r\n<p>Between 9 &amp; 10 o'clock finished a couple of glasses of warm grog &amp; turned in hoping to sleep better than last night. The tallow casks making a most infernal creaking. Obliged to get the state room port light caulked, a pretty considerable quantity of water having come in &amp; wet my bed</p>","pageId":762,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":601,"lock":null}
14:36:41.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/64
14:36:41.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":64,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":2,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day day. Wind N by E. Finished with the rigging. Dined at home. At Mrs Greenhows in the evening</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":61,"lock":null}
14:36:41.725 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
