14:36:41.730 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/65
14:36:41.730 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":65,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day. Wind N. Went to Newcastle &amp; signed bond for Register. Dined at J Tindley, a large party. Paid carpenters &pound;9.12/- - Riggers &pound;7. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":62,"lock":null}
14:36:41.730 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
