14:36:41.732 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":654,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning at a little before 8 o'clock after a very boisterous night, the wind having increased to more than half a gale with a tremendous sea, right aft so that we made good way, though at the sacrifice of our comfort. Everything above &amp; below being wet &amp; in confusion. At 5 o'clock this morning a tremendous heavy sea pooped us, stove &amp; carried away our jolly boat &amp; alarmed us so much fearing it had stove in the dark lights &amp; if it had so happened we of course should have been waterlogged. Knowing the delicate state of the <span class=highlight_yellow>archboard</span>, where she was making a great deal of water, the fear of another heavy sea striking us kept me in a very uncomfortable state the whole of the day. Towards evening however both wind &amp; sea fell considerably. We have been going today from 6&frac12;  to 7 knots. Ship laboured very much &amp; made a deal of water. We consider we have got this evening considerably to the westward of the Naze of Norway, say 50 miles.</p>\r\n<p>A great deal of water having come into ...</p>","pageId":766,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":616,"lock":null}
14:36:41.732 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/655
14:36:41.732 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":655,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>More moderate weather. Wind NE. A fine breeze. Ship going about 4 knots. Let reefs out of the top sails, set top gallants sails, <span class=highlight_yellow>square mainsail free</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>topmasts </span><span class=highlight_yellow>liering</span><span class=highlight_yellow> sail</span> &amp; gib.</p>\r\n<p>Read the duty &amp; Lessons of the day.</p>\r\n<p>The mainsail being split, unbent it &amp; got up another. The breeze rather freshened. This afternoon at NNE &amp; B by E. In the evening took a reef in each topsail &amp; stowed topgallant sails.</p>\r\n<p>Between 9 &amp; 10 turned in, being by my calculation about 100 miles from the Land</p>","pageId":766,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":617,"lock":null}
14:36:41.732 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/655
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":655,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>More moderate weather. Wind NE. A fine breeze. Ship going about 4 knots. Let reefs out of the top sails, set top gallants sails, <span class=highlight_yellow>square mainsail free</span>, <span class=highlight_yellow>topmasts </span><span class=highlight_yellow>liering</span><span class=highlight_yellow> sail</span> &amp; gib.</p>\r\n<p>Read the duty &amp; Lessons of the day.</p>\r\n<p>The mainsail being split, unbent it &amp; got up another. The breeze rather freshened. This afternoon at NNE &amp; B by E. In the evening took a reef in each topsail &amp; stowed topgallant sails.</p>\r\n<p>Between 9 &amp; 10 turned in, being by my calculation about 100 miles from the Land</p>","pageId":766,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":617,"lock":null}
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/656
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":656,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning much disappointed at not finding ourselves within 20 miles of land, which we should have been had the wind continued as it was last night. But unfortunately it has changed in the night to NW &amp; NW by W &amp; we are now only going 3 knots. The weather fine, but cloudy. Hope we shall have a change before night for I'm anxious to land at Shields.</p>","pageId":766,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":618,"lock":null}
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/656
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":656,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up this morning much disappointed at not finding ourselves within 20 miles of land, which we should have been had the wind continued as it was last night. But unfortunately it has changed in the night to NW &amp; NW by W &amp; we are now only going 3 knots. The weather fine, but cloudy. Hope we shall have a change before night for I'm anxious to land at Shields.</p>","pageId":766,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":618,"lock":null}
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/657
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":657,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>We are now about 80 miles from the land, returning about SW. Continued this course. Ship making a deal of water.</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":619,"lock":null}
14:36:41.733 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
