14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":657,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":17,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>We are now about 80 miles from the land, returning about SW. Continued this course. Ship making a deal of water.</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":619,"lock":null}
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/658
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":658,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull couldy morning with rain fresh breeze etc W by N going only 3 &frac12;  knots. At &frac12; past 6 o'clock being thick hazy weather we made Huntcliff foot at least we concluded it to be so. This at first we thought it Tynemouth. We lay the ship to with her head off.</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":620,"lock":null}
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/658
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":658,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull couldy morning with rain fresh breeze etc W by N going only 3 &frac12;  knots. At &frac12; past 6 o'clock being thick hazy weather we made Huntcliff foot at least we concluded it to be so. This at first we thought it Tynemouth. We lay the ship to with her head off.</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":620,"lock":null}
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/659
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":659,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>This morning thick weather the land in sight like a fog bank, but clearing away we found it for certain to be Huntcliff foot, bearing west about five miles. During the morning light <span class=highlight_yellow>wind</span> variable &amp; in the afternoon calm with tremendous heavy rain, thunder &amp; lightning. At night the wind being from the NE light breeze &amp; I very unwell with <span class=highlight_yellow>scumalign</span>. The ship short of Stocks as water coals &amp; pump gear out of order &amp; considering she might reach shields, by daylight, we determined to work to windward &amp; turned in for the night.</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":621,"lock":null}
14:36:41.734 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
