14:36:41.735 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":66,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine but cold day. Wind N by E. At church in the morning. Walked to Tynmouth in the afternoon. Dined at home</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":63,"lock":null}
