14:36:41.735 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/660
14:36:41.735 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":660,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":8,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Turned out this morning between 5 &amp; 6 o'clock found the ship turning to windward off Marsden Rock blowing hard from N by E. The wind having increased during the night with a high sea. At about 9 o'clock, the breeze increasing &amp; no chance of us reaching Tynemouth of getting on shore. Even if we had, we bore away for London much to our chagrin &amp; disappointment having had Shields Dockwray Square <span class=highlight_yellow>etc</span> in view &amp; not able to ...</p>","pageId":767,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":622,"lock":null}
