14:36:41.745 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/682
14:36:41.745 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":682,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning. Wind SSW. I accompanied Miss Watt to church, but might as well have been at home for anything I heard of the sermon. A large consignment Dined at 6 o'clock. Mr Philips. Watt's landlord dined with us. Spent a quiet evening. It began to rain soon after church &amp; continued heavy all day which confined us to the house.</p>","pageId":772,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":642,"lock":null}
