14:36:41.747 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/687
14:36:41.747 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":687,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":8,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>.. got into a stage at 6 o'clock &amp; went down to Greenwich &amp; dined with G Watt, it being his wife's birthday. Returned to town in the evening.</p>","pageId":773,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":645,"lock":null}
14:36:41.747 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
