14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":698,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been raining very heavy all night. Weather thick. Wind NE. Packed my cloths up. Took a packing coach &amp; went down to the office. Paid &pound;4.12. for 23 gallons of rum at 4/ per gallon. William paid it out of &pound;30 I gave him to place to my <span class=highlight_yellow>Chapmans account</span>. William &amp; I got on board the Pearl Gravesend boat. He accompanied me as far as Woolwich where he landed &amp; I proceeded to the ...</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":656,"lock":null}
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/699
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":699,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing a gale of wind from the NNE all night &amp; continued with rain all day. Amused ourselves during the morning strolling about Purfleet &amp; playing at billiards. Got our ballast on board &amp; hauled from the wharf about 5 o'clock. Weighed anchor &amp; sailed down to the Tower. Hope when we brought up for the night. Blowing a gale of wind. Finished a couple of glasses of whiskey punch, smoked a pipe &amp; turned in at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":657,"lock":null}
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/699
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":699,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing a gale of wind from the NNE all night &amp; continued with rain all day. Amused ourselves during the morning strolling about Purfleet &amp; playing at billiards. Got our ballast on board &amp; hauled from the wharf about 5 o'clock. Weighed anchor &amp; sailed down to the Tower. Hope when we brought up for the night. Blowing a gale of wind. Finished a couple of glasses of whiskey punch, smoked a pipe &amp; turned in at 9 o'clock</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":657,"lock":null}
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/7
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":7,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Went to Newcastle by coach to see Dixon Dixon for the purpose of having some conversation with him, respecting his promise of assisting me, but it being Millington Colliery pay day, he was so late in returning home I had no opportunity of speaking. I however invited myself to dine &amp; stay all night tomorrow. Got home to dinner at 5 o'clock Fine day &amp; cold. Wind NW</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":4,"lock":null}
14:36:41.753 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/7
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":7,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Went to Newcastle by coach to see Dixon Dixon for the purpose of having some conversation with him, respecting his promise of assisting me, but it being Millington Colliery pay day, he was so late in returning home I had no opportunity of speaking. I however invited myself to dine &amp; stay all night tomorrow. Got home to dinner at 5 o'clock Fine day &amp; cold. Wind NW</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":4,"lock":null}
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/70
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":70,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day, frosty, with snow showers, Wind NE. A heavy sea upon the bar The surveyor saw the Hope's keel. Paid R Brown &pound;6.5 for trysail etc. Dined at home. Whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":67,"lock":null}
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/70
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":70,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A winters day, frosty, with snow showers, Wind NE. A heavy sea upon the bar The surveyor saw the Hope's keel. Paid R Brown &pound;6.5 for trysail etc. Dined at home. Whist club in the evening</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":67,"lock":null}
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/700
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":700,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning. Wind about NNE. Got under way about 6 o'clock &amp; ran down to the <span class=highlight_yellow>Warp</span> where we brought up about &frac12; past 9 o'clock am.  Turned out an uncommonly fine day &amp; warm. About 12 o'clock the wind got to the NNW then NW &amp; after dinner to W by S &amp; WSW. When we got our anchor up, but being little wind, did not make much way. At about 8 o'clock being dark &amp; not able to see the buoy of the middle, we brought up for the night. Several ships in company.</p>\r\n<p>At 9 o'clock smoked a pipe, wet both eyes &amp; turned in. A good deal annoyed at not being able to proceed, there being a fine breeze.</p>","pageId":775,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":658,"lock":null}
14:36:41.754 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
