14:36:41.758 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":709,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":9,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but cool. Wind N by W &amp; a sea upon the bar. Heavy rain during the day. Dined at home. Drank tea &amp; played a rubber at I Craig's</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":667,"lock":null}
