14:36:41.758 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":71,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Weather changed. Wind NW. A shower of snow in the morning &amp; afterwards turned over a wet day. A few ships got to sea. Dined at home A letter from William</p>","pageId":691,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":68,"lock":null}
