14:36:41.760 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":712,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NE. Afterwards turned out pleasant. Captain Webb &amp; I walked to Whitley Park &amp; called upon Mr J Wright. Returned by Cullercoats &amp; the sands through Tynemouth. Dined at 2 o'clock. At the <span class=highlight_yellow>Mallard</span> soon in the afternoon. At &frac12; past 7 o'clock went to meet Ann but she was not at the place of appointment. Drank tea &amp; spent the evening with Miss Tinley. Playing at cards with the boys. Wind changed. Rained in the evening to SE</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":670,"lock":null}
