14:36:41.761 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/714
14:36:41.761 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":714,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The early part of the morning very fine but afterwards turned dull &amp; like rain. Wind WNW blowing hard in the afternoon at W. Went to church in the morning. Mrs Dixon Fanny &amp; Bell Smith came down to see Mrs Scott. In the afternoon walked down to Tynemouth &amp; dined at 5 o'clock. <span class=highlight_yellow>Note from William</span>. Metcalf, Henry &amp; his wife there &amp; Mr &amp; Mrs J Dale in the evening</p>","pageId":777,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":672,"lock":null}
