14:36:41.762 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":717,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, cool. Wind NW. Dined at home. Walked with captain Webb to Tynemouth in the evening. Called at Miss Marr's &amp; saw Emma G. At night blew hard with heavy rain &amp; sleet. Wrote to William</p>","pageId":778,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":675,"lock":null}
14:36:41.762 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
