14:36:41.767 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/728
14:36:41.767 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":728,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind ___. Excessively jacked &amp; tired from the good living of the last two days. Took a walk with my gun, thinking the exercise would do me good. Shot a brace of birds. Dined at home &amp; completely knocked up. Edward White dined with us.</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":683,"lock":null}
