14:36:41.768 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":728,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind ___. Excessively jacked &amp; tired from the good living of the last two days. Took a walk with my gun, thinking the exercise would do me good. Shot a brace of birds. Dined at home &amp; completely knocked up. Edward White dined with us.</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":683,"lock":null}
14:36:41.768 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/729
14:36:41.768 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":729,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, rather cloudy. Jow &amp; Kit out with the hounds. I went out shooting &amp; walked about the whole of the day. Killed only one bird. Dined at home &amp; in the evening Joe &amp; I went to Mr Kell's at Lanchester (the <span class=highlight_yellow>suryion</span>) with whom we drank tea &amp; played a few rubbers. We got home about &frac12; past 1 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":684,"lock":null}
