14:36:41.768 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/73
14:36:41.768 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":73,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A mild day with a fresh breeze from NW by N. A few light ships arrived. At church with fanny Smith in the morning. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tenley. Dined at home</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":70,"lock":null}
