14:36:41.770 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":732,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day. Wind SW. Employed myself in sketching most of the morning. Kit &amp; I took a ride before dinner. Dined &amp; spent a quiet evening at home.</p>","pageId":779,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":687,"lock":null}
