14:36:41.770 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/734
14:36:41.770 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":734,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind SE. Prepared to set off for Shields, but after breakfast it set in such a determined rainingday that we could not think of moving. I therefore remained at Burnhopeside. Spent a quiet evening at home.</p>","pageId":780,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":689,"lock":null}
14:36:41.770 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
