14:36:41.771 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":735,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning after a very heavy fall of rain during the night. Wind NW. After breakfast Kit &amp; Joe went to see the Lambleton hounds throw off at Flags &amp; James, Kits servant, drove me in the gig to Durham, where I had to remain all day, the coach not passing through till evening. Showers during the whole of the morning, but in the intervals I strolled about to see all my old haunts etc. Things much in a &quot;status quo&quot;. I could perceive few alterations or improvements. Called upon <span class=highlight_yellow>SKeene</span>. At 8 o'clock took a gig &amp; got to shields at &frac12; past 9 o'clock &amp; went to the whist club for an hour. Received a letter from William.</p>","pageId":780,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":690,"lock":null}
14:36:41.771 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/736
14:36:41.771 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":736,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull misty morning. Wind NW &amp; N by W</p>\r\n<p><font color=#CC9368>Accepted balances bill at 4 </font><font color=#CC9368><span class=highlight_yellow>months</span></font><font color=#CC9368> for the </font><font color=#CC9368><span class=highlight_yellow>Mesa</span></font><font color=#CC9368> at premium &pound;20-2.6 due 20</font><sup><font color=#CC9368>th</font></sup><font color=#CC9368> Jan</font></p>\r\n<p>Went to South Shields &amp; paid Rids &amp; Oliver their dividend upon G <span class=highlight_yellow>Morrisons</span> estate. Dined at house. Wrote &amp; enclosed a soverign to Mrs Scott Crathorn. H Harry &amp; I drank wine together at the Commercial &amp; afterwards eat some oysters at Janes</p>","pageId":780,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":691,"lock":null}
14:36:41.771 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
