14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":742,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":27,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Went to the theatre &amp; saw Madam Vestris again. She &amp; her sister Miss Bartolozzi performed for the benefit. About ___ in the house</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":696,"lock":null}
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/742
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":742,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":27,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>Went to the theatre &amp; saw Madam Vestris again. She &amp; her sister Miss Bartolozzi performed for the benefit. About ___ in the house</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":696,"lock":null}
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/743
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":743,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. After a rainy night &amp; wind NE, changed now to NNW. During the day variable between W by N &amp; NNE and cold. A sea upon the bar. Amused myself drawing all the morning. Dined at home. Received from Robert &pound;7 on WBS account for newspapers sent Commercial Rooms &amp; &pound;1.18.6 on account of Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>'s.</p>\r\n<p>The Grenville Bay &amp; Love arrived from Greenland well <span class=highlight_yellow>fisked</span>. H Harry &amp; I had a bottle of port together at the George. With Ann Stokes in the evening</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":697,"lock":null}
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/743
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":743,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. After a rainy night &amp; wind NE, changed now to NNW. During the day variable between W by N &amp; NNE and cold. A sea upon the bar. Amused myself drawing all the morning. Dined at home. Received from Robert &pound;7 on WBS account for newspapers sent Commercial Rooms &amp; &pound;1.18.6 on account of Emma G<font color=#BFBFBF>albraith</font>'s.</p>\r\n<p>The Grenville Bay &amp; Love arrived from Greenland well <span class=highlight_yellow>fisked</span>. H Harry &amp; I had a bottle of port together at the George. With Ann Stokes in the evening</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":697,"lock":null}
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/744
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":744,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":10,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; milder weather. Wind WNW. Engaged the principle part of the morning in drawing. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. In the evening eat some oysters at <span class=highlight_yellow>Marks</span> &amp; afterwards attended  the whist club.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":698,"lock":null}
14:36:41.775 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
