14:36:41.778 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/749
14:36:41.778 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":749,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":3,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another mild morning. Wind WSW. A number of light ships arrived this morning.  N Boswell arrived the morning in his ship the <span class=highlight_yellow>William</span> Shand, a fine vessel, about 280 tons <span class=highlight_yellow>coppond</span><span class=highlight_yellow> called</span> on board. Dined at home. H Harry &amp; I took wine together at the Commercial with Bill Jervis <font color=#BFBFBF>in the </font>afternoon.</p>","pageId":781,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":703,"lock":null}
