14:36:41.785 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":764,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine frosty morning. Wind WNW. Took a walk with Boswell to Tyneside. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Mark, H Harry&amp; I had some brandy &amp; water together. Afterwards attended the whist club. With Bell Jerves.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":718,"lock":null}
