14:36:41.786 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":765,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine frosty morning. Wind about West. An idle day with me. Dined at home at 2 o'clock. Boswell &amp; I spent the evening with Allen.</p>","pageId":783,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":719,"lock":null}
