14:36:41.787 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":767,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind E by N blowing fresh &amp; a heavy sea upon the bar. Paid <span class=highlight_yellow>accounts</span> Chapman &pound;50 to <span class=highlight_yellow>C</span><sup><span class=highlight_yellow>m</span></sup> of my account &amp; paid by <span class=highlight_yellow>diss</span> upon <span class=highlight_yellow>them</span> Premium Club bill &pound;25.12.6 &amp; average Hope club &pound;5.10.5. Dined at home. Went to a <span class=highlight_yellow>lobicst</span> party in the evening at Mr Harrison's</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":721,"lock":null}
14:36:41.787 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/768
14:36:41.787 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":768,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Been blowing very hard all night from ESE &amp; still continues nearly the same about E by S with a heavy sea upon the bar but clear weather &amp; exceedingly cold. Dined at home &amp; afterwards went on board the Choice &amp; had some punch with H Harry. The wind increased to a heavy gale. Drank tea with Miss Harry &amp; spent the evening with mark</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":722,"lock":null}
14:36:41.787 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
