14:36:41.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":771,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Thick weather. Wind NW. Drew &pound;5 out of Chapmans. Dined at home. H Harry, Boswell, Nicholson &amp; I took grog together at the Commercial &amp; afterwards went to the theatre</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":725,"lock":null}
14:36:41.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/772
14:36:41.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":772,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":11,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A thick dull morning with a little rain. Wind about north. Allen &amp; I took a walk to Tynemouth. Government having given up the burial ground to the parish again, excepting 40 feet round the sides of the yard. Dined at home.</p>\r\n<p>Spent the evening with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Lewison</span>, H Harry, and A Nicholson at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":784,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":726,"lock":null}
14:36:41.789 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
