14:36:41.790 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/776
14:36:41.790 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":776,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another damp &amp; unpleasant morning. After a stormy night, a heavy sea upon the bar. Wind SE.</p>\r\n<p>Dined at home. At another max with Catherine. In the evening went to South Shields to Mr Bullocks &amp; partook of an oyster supper &amp; milk. Punch with H Harry, Boswell, Allen &amp; J Richardson. The oysters very large &amp; fine, from Wells</p>","pageId":785,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":730,"lock":null}
