14:36:41.795 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":786,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather &amp; wind  SW. Been blowing a gale all night. On board the Hope. At &frac12; past 12 o'clock went by steam to Newcastle. Met Dixon there &amp; walked with him out to Benton to dine &amp; stay all night.</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":740,"lock":null}
14:36:41.795 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/787
14:36:41.795 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":787,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine mild day. Wind SW. Dixon &amp; Bessy went to church. I walked down to Walker &amp; called upon Mr &amp; Mrs Carr, there being no steam boats. I proceeded &amp; walked to Shields, afterwards to Tynemouth &amp; back &amp; dined with J Tinley. With Bell <span class=highlight_yellow>Wait</span></p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":741,"lock":null}
