14:36:41.796 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/791
14:36:41.796 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":791,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frosty morning. Rather foggy. Wind WSW. Took a long walk with Captain Webb round Cullercoats, Tynemouth. Dined at home. Wrote to Boswell at <span class=highlight_yellow>Refe</span> informing him of the <span class=highlight_yellow>odesoan</span> freights being &pound;4 per ton &amp; 10 pct for <span class=highlight_yellow>tullers</span>. At the whist club &amp; with Bell Jarvis</p>","pageId":786,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":745,"lock":null}
