14:36:41.799 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/796
14:36:41.799 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":796,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy damp and very unpleasant morning. Some snow on the ground, having fallen during the night. Wind, the little there is NNW. Dined at 4 o'clock at Mr Metcalf's in Saville Street. A party there. Spent a pleasant day. Wrote to William. Called at the Bank. Spencer promised to under me what accommodation I <span class=highlight_yellow>may</span> want this Xmas. Paid Linskill &amp; etc &pound;24.11.6 for <span class=highlight_yellow>cordage</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Lane</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Spence</span> &amp; <span class=highlight_yellow>Foster</span> &pound;8.10/- for canvas</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":750,"lock":null}
