14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":798,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":24,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold frosty morning. Wind E by N. Been blowing a gale all night. A heavy sea upon the bar. On board the Hope. The master &amp; carpenter absent looking for some knees for the hold beans. Dined at home. H Harry came in &amp; took wine with me. Mrs Dixon down &amp; took Emma to Benton with her. Attended the whist club in the evening. Saw Ann Maxwell</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":752,"lock":null}
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/799
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":799,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Xmas day. Seasonal weather. Very cold with a little snow. Wind East &amp; blowing hard. Walked up to Benton. Dined &amp; remained all night.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":753,"lock":null}
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/799
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":799,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Xmas day. Seasonal weather. Very cold with a little snow. Wind East &amp; blowing hard. Walked up to Benton. Dined &amp; remained all night.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":753,"lock":null}
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/8
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":8,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Again at Newcastle. Saw J Smith Senior &amp; Junior: the old gent: very kind, asked me to dine, &quot;no go&quot; entered upon the subject of the Ariel, showed them W S Brewer's accounts, they seemed to be of our opinion &amp; against any arbitration. Dined with Dixon, had a long conversation about his assisting me. He was extremely kind in his expressions, but said it was out of his power, from his heavy advances to others &amp; having heavy payments to make himself to but that he would consider about it. memo: Its what I expected, not much disappointed. A promise ought to be held sacred. Cold day with rain afternoon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":5,"lock":null}
14:36:41.801 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/8
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":8,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Again at Newcastle. Saw J Smith Senior &amp; Junior: the old gent: very kind, asked me to dine, &quot;no go&quot; entered upon the subject of the Ariel, showed them W S Brewer's accounts, they seemed to be of our opinion &amp; against any arbitration. Dined with Dixon, had a long conversation about his assisting me. He was extremely kind in his expressions, but said it was out of his power, from his heavy advances to others &amp; having heavy payments to make himself to but that he would consider about it. memo: Its what I expected, not much disappointed. A promise ought to be held sacred. Cold day with rain afternoon</p>","pageId":686,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":5,"lock":null}
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/80
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":80,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NNW. At church in the morning with Fanny Smith Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tenley. Dined at home</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":77,"lock":null}
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/80
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":80,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning. Wind NNW. At church in the morning with Fanny Smith Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tenley. Dined at home</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":77,"lock":null}
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/800
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":800,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind ESE. A slight fall of snow during the day. Walked into Newcastle with Dixon. Nothing doing on the Quay side in the way of freights, at least none to suite me. Returned to Shields in a gig. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at H Dales. Received a letter from Boswell from Rye informing me he had got 90 passengers for New York</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":754,"lock":null}
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/800
14:36:41.802 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":800,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind ESE. A slight fall of snow during the day. Walked into Newcastle with Dixon. Nothing doing on the Quay side in the way of freights, at least none to suite me. Returned to Shields in a gig. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at H Dales. Received a letter from Boswell from Rye informing me he had got 90 passengers for New York</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":754,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/801
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":801,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonal morning. Wind NW &amp; snowing heavy. Did not go to church. Made up the Hope's <span class=highlight_yellow>final</span> voyage in the ships <span class=highlight_yellow>log</span>. She clears nothing much to my unsurprised &amp; disappointment. Dined with H Harry. In the evening with Bell Jarvis &amp; Jane Dryden.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":755,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/801
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":801,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine seasonal morning. Wind NW &amp; snowing heavy. Did not go to church. Made up the Hope's <span class=highlight_yellow>final</span> voyage in the ships <span class=highlight_yellow>log</span>. She clears nothing much to my unsurprised &amp; disappointment. Dined with H Harry. In the evening with Bell Jarvis &amp; Jane Dryden.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":755,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/802
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":802,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost, but not yet much snow has fallen. Wind NW. On board the Hope. The carpenter nearly finished. Intend hauling her off the shore at high water. Dined at home.</p>\r\n<p>Mary <span class=highlight_yellow>Carss</span> called upon me.</p>\r\n<p>H Harry, Mark &amp; I had a glass of grog together. Spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":756,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/802
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":802,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of frost, but not yet much snow has fallen. Wind NW. On board the Hope. The carpenter nearly finished. Intend hauling her off the shore at high water. Dined at home.</p>\r\n<p>Mary <span class=highlight_yellow>Carss</span> called upon me.</p>\r\n<p>H Harry, Mark &amp; I had a glass of grog together. Spent the evening at home.</p>","pageId":787,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":756,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/803
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":803,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull winters morning. Frost gone, having been rain during the night. Wind E by S but still cold.</p>\r\n<p>Attended a meeting at the church to take into consideration the offer of the board of ordinance either to purchase the burial ground at Tynemouth or give a piece of ground in lieu of it. The meeting determined not to do either, but to let the Board apply to Parliament for an act to take it from us, which they had threatened to do. Dined at home. In the evening H Harry, H Nicolson &amp; I had a glass of grog at the George together</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":757,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/803
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":803,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull winters morning. Frost gone, having been rain during the night. Wind E by S but still cold.</p>\r\n<p>Attended a meeting at the church to take into consideration the offer of the board of ordinance either to purchase the burial ground at Tynemouth or give a piece of ground in lieu of it. The meeting determined not to do either, but to let the Board apply to Parliament for an act to take it from us, which they had threatened to do. Dined at home. In the evening H Harry, H Nicolson &amp; I had a glass of grog at the George together</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":757,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/804
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":804,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Inclined to freeze. Wind E by S. Drew &pound;5 out of Chapmans. On board the Hope. Carpenter nearly finished laying the half deck. H Harry &amp; Nicolson lunched on board. Dined at home. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it In the evening H Nicholson &amp; I called to see jane Mills. With Jane Dryden</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":758,"lock":null}
14:36:41.803 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/804
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":804,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Rather a dull morning. Inclined to freeze. Wind E by S. Drew &pound;5 out of Chapmans. On board the Hope. Carpenter nearly finished laying the half deck. H Harry &amp; Nicolson lunched on board. Dined at home. Received a letter from WBS &amp; answered it In the evening H Nicholson &amp; I called to see jane Mills. With Jane Dryden</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":758,"lock":null}
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/805
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":805,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The wind continuing from the SE makes it appear as if there was not much if any frost. Though some snow has fallen during the night.</p>\r\n<p>The last day of the year, which has been to me anything but a prosperous one. I trust I may be more fortunate the next one. I know not what will become of me. It appears to me my destiny is fixed &amp; that I'm never to rise in the world again.</p>\r\n<p>Walked to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in having been successful. The fish very <span class=highlight_yellow>firm</span>, particularly the haddock. There were 16 boats. Dined at home. Attended the whist club &amp; sat the new year in.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":759,"lock":null}
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/805
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":805,"version":0,"year":1829,"month":12,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The wind continuing from the SE makes it appear as if there was not much if any frost. Though some snow has fallen during the night.</p>\r\n<p>The last day of the year, which has been to me anything but a prosperous one. I trust I may be more fortunate the next one. I know not what will become of me. It appears to me my destiny is fixed &amp; that I'm never to rise in the world again.</p>\r\n<p>Walked to Cullercoats &amp; saw the fishing boats come in having been successful. The fish very <span class=highlight_yellow>firm</span>, particularly the haddock. There were 16 boats. Dined at home. Attended the whist club &amp; sat the new year in.</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":759,"lock":null}
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/806
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":806,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<div class=\"highlights-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n\t<h2>Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1830.html#1830-01-24\">\r\n\t<p>1830-01-24 Mrs Scott falls out of bed and breaks her leg</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1830.html#1830-07-13\">\r\n\t<p>1830-07-13 JSR witnessed an accident which killed a girl sitting under cliffs</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
