14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/806
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":806,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<div class=\"highlights-section\" >\r\n<section>\r\n\r\n\t<h2>Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1830.html#1830-01-24\">\r\n\t<p>1830-01-24 Mrs Scott falls out of bed and breaks her leg</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n\t<a href=\"/diaries/1830.html#1830-07-13\">\r\n\t<p>1830-07-13 JSR witnessed an accident which killed a girl sitting under cliffs</p>\r\n\t</a>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after: always;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","pageId":null,"type":null,"imageId":null,"marqueeId":null,"lock":null}
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/807
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":807,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Seasonal weather but not very severe. Wind WNW. Walked again to Cullercoats &amp; saw them land their fish which were remarkably fine. Dined at home. In the evening Cunningham, Nicolson, &amp; I went to the Duke of York &amp; drank a jug of punch. In the evening at the Mulstrum &amp; with Bell Jervis</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":760,"lock":null}
14:36:41.805 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
