14:36:41.806 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":807,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Seasonal weather but not very severe. Wind WNW. Walked again to Cullercoats &amp; saw them land their fish which were remarkably fine. Dined at home. In the evening Cunningham, Nicolson, &amp; I went to the Duke of York &amp; drank a jug of punch. In the evening at the Mulstrum &amp; with Bell Jervis</p>","pageId":788,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":760,"lock":null}
