14:36:41.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/811
14:36:41.807 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":811,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":4,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Mild weather. Frost gone. Wind WNW. Walked up to the Point with H Harry, H Nicholson &amp; J Elder &amp; dined with Mr Sadler. In the evening went up to Newcastle to see Duncan. Had an oyster supper afterwards &amp; got home at about 2 o'clock in the morning</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":763,"lock":null}
