14:36:41.808 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":812,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Walked with Mark to Cullercoats &amp; saw the boats come in. Returned home to dinner. Spent the evening at J Tinleys</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":764,"lock":null}
