14:36:41.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":814,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning &amp; fresh weather. Wind about north, been blowing hard all night, sea coming on. Received a letter from WBS. Took a walk with a party to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":766,"lock":null}
14:36:41.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/815
14:36:41.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":815,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>The country covered with snow Which has been very heavy during the night. Wind north. Dined at home. H Harry, Nicholson, H French &amp; I drank wine together at the George &amp; afterwards went to the theatre to see West of the 80<sup>th</sup> regiment perform Fredrick in Lover's Vows. He got on tolerably well for a first attempt.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":767,"lock":null}
14:36:41.809 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
