14:36:41.810 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":816,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind WNW. Thawing after a slight frost during the night. Very sloppy &amp; unpleasant. Walked to Cullercoats. Dined at home. In the evening attended the whist club at Craigs</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":768,"lock":null}
14:36:41.810 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/817
14:36:41.810 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":817,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>It has been a hard frost &amp; blowing a gale at north all night &amp; still continues with a very high sea. Went to church in the morning. Dined at 2 o'clock with H Harry. Mr Sadler there. In the evening at the Mulstrum</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":769,"lock":null}
14:36:41.810 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
