14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":820,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine dry winters morning. Rather frosty &amp; blowing fresh at NE. Dined at home. H Harry, Mr Hewson, Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York. A stormy night, a hurricane with snow.</p>","pageId":789,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":772,"lock":null}
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/821
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/821
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":821,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Still blowing a gale of wind after an awfully stormy night with snow showers. Wind E by S. Dined at home. In the evening at the whist club</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":773,"lock":null}
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/822
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
14:36:41.812 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/822
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":822,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very unpleasant morning. Heavy rain &amp; blowing fresh at E by S &amp; sea high upon the bar.</p>\r\n<p>Received a letter from WBS to receive some &pound;88 from Mr Salmon of South Shields. Wrote to him. Dined at home. At the theatre in the evening. The last performance for the season.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":774,"lock":null}
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/823
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/823
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":823,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull rainy morning. A few light ships in light wind E by S &amp; sea fallen. Went over the water &amp; saw Salmon who had not this money ready for me, but expects to give it this next week. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS. Attended the whist club at Jebbs. Walked there. A stormy night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":775,"lock":null}
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/824
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
