14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":824,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another dull &amp; rainy morning. Wind ESE. A few light ships off. Went to church in the morning. Dined at home. H Nicholson took wine with me. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":776,"lock":null}
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/825
14:36:41.813 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":825,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind WSW. The frost continued very keen throughout the day. Went to Newcastle by steam. Things very dull. Could get nothing for the Hope. Dined at home at 5 o'clock. In the evening Nicholson &amp; I had a glass of grog together at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":777,"lock":null}
