14:36:41.814 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/827
14:36:41.814 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":827,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuance of very severe frost. Wind fresh at ESE. A large fleet of light ships coming in. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy snow storm, turned in the evening to a thaw with sleet &amp; rain very wet &amp; sloppy. Spent the evening at J Tinley's. A ship got upon the Heard Sand at night.</p>","pageId":790,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":779,"lock":null}
