14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":832,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind NW. Took a walk round by Tynemouth &amp; the rocks to see the wreck. Mrs Smith &amp; Fanny arrived in the afternoon. Dined at 4 o'clock. Mrs Scott not so well this evening. Called at Messes Marsh &amp; saw Emma, she having had a cold.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":784,"lock":null}
14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/833
14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":833,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning &amp; hard frost. Wind about west. Mrs Scott has had a bad night &amp; is very sick and ill. Walked with D Dixon round by the rocks to Tynemouth &amp; afterwards to Benton by the river &amp; Wellington. Dined there &amp; staid all night.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":785,"lock":null}
