14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/834
14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":834,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine frosty morning. Wind SW. Left Benton after breakfast &amp;  walked down to Shields. Mrs Scott considered a little better. Dined at home at 3 o'clock. Spent the evening at the billiard room</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":786,"lock":null}
14:36:41.818 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
