14:36:41.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/838
14:36:41.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":838,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":1,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine winter's morning. Frosty with snow. Wind SW. Prevented attending church in the morning. The Smiths coming down so late to breakfast. Wrote to B B Galbraith. Walked to Tynemouth in the afternoon with J Tinley&amp; C Milner. Attended afternoon service &amp; afterwards dined at the castle with west of the 80<sup>th</sup>. In the evening at the Mulstrum.</p>","pageId":791,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":790,"lock":null}
14:36:41.820 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
