14:36:41.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/843
14:36:41.822 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":843,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A continuum of Winter weather with snow showers Wind East S E blowing fresh. Stayed at home at 2 o'clock at the billiard room after dinner. After tea walked upto Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening with Capt French at the Castle. Played a few rubbers at whist &amp; lost</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":795,"lock":null}
