14:36:41.823 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/845
14:36:41.823 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":845,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A most inferior frost Wind S.W. Received a letter from WBS Went to church in the morning Dined at home at &frac12; past 1 o'clock. In the evening at the Duke of York With T Nicholson and afterwards at the Neuls home. This evening a caped this commenced with rain</p>","pageId":796,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":797,"lock":null}
14:36:41.823 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
