14:36:41.824 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":848,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day and frosty The Hope upon the shore to see Ivo Karl. The people busy rigging. Dinner at home. Spent the evening At J Teschays. My birthday</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":800,"lock":null}
