14:36:41.824 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/849
14:36:41.824 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":849,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A frosty morning. Very cold Wind SW. Got the Hope down to her loading birth &amp; surveyed by Smiths foreman for the club. Excepting two hold beam Knees which are rather decayed, he saw no fault to find. People busy rigging. H Nicholson &amp; I dined on board. Attended the Whist Club in the evening. Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":797,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":801,"lock":null}
