14:36:41.827 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":852,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful spring morning. Wind SW. Went to church Mr Mark &amp;  the vicar dest the duty. Dined at home at 1 o'Clock. H Harry, H French Nicholson &amp; I walked to Tynemouth round the castle &amp; took wine at the Star &amp; Garter In the evening at the <span class=highlight_yellow>M</span><span class=highlight_yellow>u</span><span class=highlight_yellow>l</span><span class=highlight_yellow>st</span><span class=highlight_yellow>rum</span></p>","pageId":798,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":804,"lock":null}
14:36:41.827 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/853
14:36:41.827 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":853,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":2,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another beautiful morning &amp; quite mild wind about north. On board the Hope only got J Kuls down Today. Dined at home. Mrs Dixon down to See Mrs Scott. Drank tea at home &amp; in The evening at the George with H Harry &amp; Wrote to WBS</p>","pageId":798,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":805,"lock":null}
