14:36:41.830 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/86
14:36:41.830 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":86,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>D Brown Spouts &amp; heavy ballast &pound;2.12. Fine weather but rather frosty. Wind WNW. Dined at home. Gave captain Stephenson &pound;2. Received from Scott for spars &pound;4.14/- &amp; allowance for ballast 19/2</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":82,"lock":null}
