14:36:41.835 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":872,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A duller foggy morning. Wind SW.  <del>Afterwards got to the L&amp;E</del> <del>Cold accompanied</del> Took a walk with Captain Webb to Tynemouth. Dined with Nicholson a party spent a very Pleasant day &amp; in the evening Attended the Whist Club at I Dales</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":824,"lock":null}
14:36:41.835 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/873
14:36:41.835 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":873,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy morning. Wind NE. Afterwards changed to SE &amp; fine clear weather. Went to Church in the morning. Mr Pemberton accompanied me. I was engaged to dine with I Tealey today but on my return from Church. I found that Mrs Scott was so much poorer &amp; her death expected every moment. I sent an apology. She expired precisely at 9 o'clock without a struggle</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":825,"lock":null}
14:36:41.835 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/873
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":873,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A foggy morning. Wind NE. Afterwards changed to SE &amp; fine clear weather. Went to Church in the morning. Mr Pemberton accompanied me. I was engaged to dine with I Tealey today but on my return from Church. I found that Mrs Scott was so much poorer &amp; her death expected every moment. I sent an apology. She expired precisely at 9 o'clock without a struggle</p>","pageId":802,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":825,"lock":null}
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/874
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":874,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather Frosty. Wind  SSW. Emma G came From school. Mrs Dixon down &amp; Took Emma to N Coatts with her. Wrote to WBS: BBG: &amp; A <span class=highlight_yellow>Deighera</span> of Mrs Scotts death. Kept the house all day.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":826,"lock":null}
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/874
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":874,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather Frosty. Wind  SSW. Emma G came From school. Mrs Dixon down &amp; Took Emma to N Coatts with her. Wrote to WBS: BBG: &amp; A <span class=highlight_yellow>Deighera</span> of Mrs Scotts death. Kept the house all day.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":826,"lock":null}
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/875
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":875,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Rather Frosty. Wind S by W. In the house All day</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":827,"lock":null}
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.836 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/875
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":875,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning. Rather Frosty. Wind S by W. In the house All day</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":827,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/876
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":876,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dull &amp; thick weather &amp; rather cold. Blowing fresh at NSW. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon &amp; I Smith came down today for the purpose of having Mrs Scott's will read &amp; which not a little surprised all of us, a more extraordinary one perhaps never was: By it I am left the very handsome legacy of &pound;10 !!! the same to my brother, plainly proving &amp; confirming what her feelings towards us throughout life must have been, inveterately bad, &amp; carried to the grave with her. Peace go with her. I forgive her For all the mischief &amp; misery she Has caused in our family. The party left us in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":828,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/876
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":876,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Dull &amp; thick weather &amp; rather cold. Blowing fresh at NSW. Mr &amp; Mrs Dixon &amp; I Smith came down today for the purpose of having Mrs Scott's will read &amp; which not a little surprised all of us, a more extraordinary one perhaps never was: By it I am left the very handsome legacy of &pound;10 !!! the same to my brother, plainly proving &amp; confirming what her feelings towards us throughout life must have been, inveterately bad, &amp; carried to the grave with her. Peace go with her. I forgive her For all the mischief &amp; misery she Has caused in our family. The party left us in the afternoon.</p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":828,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/877
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":877,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but blowing hard from about west. Received at the bank for Salmon's debt &pound;88.9.3 for WBS &amp; deducted from it 20/- for my trouble &amp; &pound;11.6 money lent to Bob Marsh &amp; sec by WBS in London. Dined with I Finley, being less Of the confinement to the house. Received a letter from WBS </p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":829,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/877
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":877,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine day but blowing hard from about west. Received at the bank for Salmon's debt &pound;88.9.3 for WBS &amp; deducted from it 20/- for my trouble &amp; &pound;11.6 money lent to Bob Marsh &amp; sec by WBS in London. Dined with I Finley, being less Of the confinement to the house. Received a letter from WBS </p>","pageId":803,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":829,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/878
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":878,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather, but very windy at West. Received a letter from ABS in reply to their informing him of Mrs Scott's death, saying he cannot leave London before tonight or tomorrow morning Dined at home. Wes &amp; Fanny Smith excessively angry that we should claim the amount of taxes upon the house paid by us in error &amp; which ought to have been paid by Mrs Scott. Fanny inclined to be very violent, her conduct disgusting &amp; very insulting; displaying more regard for the money than for the aunt. Blew a perfect hurricane with heavy rain the afternoon</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":830,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/878
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":878,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":12,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Beautiful weather, but very windy at West. Received a letter from ABS in reply to their informing him of Mrs Scott's death, saying he cannot leave London before tonight or tomorrow morning Dined at home. Wes &amp; Fanny Smith excessively angry that we should claim the amount of taxes upon the house paid by us in error &amp; which ought to have been paid by Mrs Scott. Fanny inclined to be very violent, her conduct disgusting &amp; very insulting; displaying more regard for the money than for the aunt. Blew a perfect hurricane with heavy rain the afternoon</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":830,"lock":null}
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/879
14:36:41.837 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":879,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":13,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning, but still Blowing very hard at NW. In the house All day</p>","pageId":804,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":831,"lock":null}
