14:36:41.838 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/88
14:36:41.838 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":88,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine clear frosty morning &amp; cold. Wind NNW. Showers of sleet &amp; rain in the afternoon. Attended morning service. Dined at home.  <span class=highlight_yellow>Carlea</span> Sunday</p>","pageId":692,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":84,"lock":null}
14:36:41.838 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
