14:36:41.840 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":884,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":3,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull showery day. Wind fresh at NW. Engaged at home in the house with ABS. I gave him his note at 40 days for &pound;75.10/- <font color=#FF0000>Accepted &amp; returned </font><font color=#FF0000>Mrs</font><font color=#FF0000> </font><font color=#FF0000>Bulemer</font><font color=#FF0000> a bill</font> <font color=#FF0000>at</font><font color=#FF0000> 3 </font><font color=#FF0000>hou</font><font color=#FF0000>rs. Due 23 p</font><font color=#FF0000>ricing</font><font color=#FF0000> for Policy presumabl</font><font color=#FF0000>y</font> <font color=#FF0000>almost</font><font color=#FF0000> &pound;16.13.8</font> Dined at home. At 5 o'clock the owner &amp; Master of the Commerce with me about the damages received by him in the wold when the Hope came in contact, agreed to leave it to two gentlemen to decide with have to call in a this. At home all the evening </p>","pageId":805,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":836,"lock":null}
