14:36:41.853 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":905,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Milder weather. Wind SW. WBS came up to Newcastle. We lunched in Westgate Street &amp; afterward returned to Shields by steam. Dined at home. In the evening A Harry &amp; I at the Duke</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":857,"lock":null}
