14:36:41.853 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/906
14:36:41.853 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":906,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather. Wind SW. A dull morning, the glass down &amp; evening appearance of rain Saw Brown who declined taking the George again excepting at a very great reduction of rent he offered &pound;50 a year. Dined at home. The Saturdays nights whist club spent the evening with me. Heavy showers during the day &amp; much thunder &amp; lightening in the evening. A number of light ships arrived</p>","pageId":810,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":858,"lock":null}
