14:36:41.859 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":920,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning &amp; continued raining all day. Wind SW. Dined with R Pearch on board the Brondenick &amp; spent a pleasant day</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":872,"lock":null}
14:36:41.859 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
