14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":920,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":21,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very wet morning &amp; continued raining all day. Wind SW. Dined with R Pearch on board the Brondenick &amp; spent a pleasant day</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":872,"lock":null}
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/921
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":921,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from WBS of his arrival in London &amp; also one from I Smith to say he will dine &amp; stay all night with me on the 1<sup>st</sup> May. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Saw Mr &amp; Mrs Ildegton, he very lame with the gout. Spent the evening at Allens, got home at &frac12; past 2 o'clock</p>\r\n<p>x</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":873,"lock":null}
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/921
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":921,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":22,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fine weather blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from WBS of his arrival in London &amp; also one from I Smith to say he will dine &amp; stay all night with me on the 1<sup>st</sup> May. Wrote to WBS. Dined at home. Saw Mr &amp; Mrs Ildegton, he very lame with the gout. Spent the evening at Allens, got home at &frac12; past 2 o'clock</p>\r\n<p>x</p>","pageId":813,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":873,"lock":null}
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/922
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":922,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":23,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind SW. Received a note from In Carr of Walkers, that he could not see me to dinner today a fixed upon &amp; immediately me for next Tuesday. Got &pound;5 from Chapmans. Paid Bulman cargo club &pound;1.12. Entrance on policy 1830. Dined at home. At the Duke in the evening.</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":874,"lock":null}
14:36:41.860 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
