14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":925,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind W by S. Walked to Teymouth; called at Libb's where I met Mrs Ildeston, he returned to Shields with <span class=highlight_yellow>bum</span>. Invited by him to go &amp; stay at <span class=highlight_yellow>Lnasoington</span> with Captain Webb. Dined at home. Jebbs &amp; Webb took wine with over at the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":814,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":877,"lock":null}
14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/926
14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":926,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind SW.  Walked up to Sadlers at Lokiltsy Point and took lunch &amp; he &amp; I afterwards got onboard a steam boat &amp; went up to Walker where we dined with I Carr &amp; spent a very pleasant day. Returned to Shields in evening in a gig. Wind changed to SE</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":878,"lock":null}
