14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":927,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine morning. Wind SE. Attended <span class=highlight_yellow>Kiefs</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>onttes</span><span class=highlight_yellow> </span><span class=highlight_yellow>sah</span>. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon on board the <span class=highlight_yellow>Anus</span> with Mr <span class=highlight_yellow>Ascoerson</span> <span class=highlight_yellow>onffstong</span>. Took tea with the latter &amp; had a walk in the evening with</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":879,"lock":null}
14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/928
14:36:41.862 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":928,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":4,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A countenance of beautiful weather. Wind ESE. Took a walk to Tynemouth with <span class=highlight_yellow>Lt H</span><span class=highlight_yellow>arry</span>. Dined at home. Onboard the John Dunn in the evening with I <span class=highlight_yellow>Wesglot</span> &amp; afterwards at the Duke of York.</p>","pageId":815,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":880,"lock":null}
