14:36:41.863 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":93,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful day but rather cool. Wind NNE. Dined at home. Engaged to an evening party ay Mrs Heddells but sent an apology in consequence of Mrs Deghton's death</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":89,"lock":null}
