14:36:41.866 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":935,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Delightful weather. Wind East &amp; SE. Walked beyond Marsden Rocks with Webb, Gosling RNW To see <span class=highlight_yellow>exfrenements</span> laid for saving shipwrecked men, my means of a rope ladder &amp; air jacket. Returned home to dinner. Webb &amp; Gosling dinned with us. Afterwards walked to Tynemouth &amp; spent the evening at Webb </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":887,"lock":null}
14:36:41.866 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/936
14:36:41.866 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
