14:36:41.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":936,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull think morning with wind SE blowing fresh. Dined with I Finely, met char Nicholas &amp; in the evening went to the whist club at I Newghts. A very stormy night, a gale of wind at ESE with torrents of rain. Gabe Stephenson a debt on Chapmans for &pound;30 &amp; got &pound;5 for self. Gave G Stafs &pound;1 on account of wages</p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":888,"lock":null}
14:36:41.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/937
14:36:41.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
14:36:41.867 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
14:36:41.868 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - publish: topic: diaries/fragments/937
14:36:41.868 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":937,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>All last night marsh dismal &amp; stormy blowing a gale of wind at ESE with a deluge of rain &amp; still continuous Did not go to church. Employed myself in writing to WBS &amp; G Farell. Gave Stephenson a draft upon Chapmans exors at &pound;14.11.7 ( &pound;5 cook + &pound;9.11.7 Balance of after) Dined with a Harry. Called on Webb in the evening who had gout a which prevents him going to Mr Aldertons At the Duke of York in evening. Weather <span class=highlight_yellow>inade</span><span class=highlight_yellow>s</span><span class=highlight_yellow>ater</span></p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":889,"lock":null}
14:36:41.868 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/938
14:36:41.868 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":938,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind East blowing fresh &amp; heavy sea. Lower ladder off its put back left Shields </p>","pageId":817,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":890,"lock":null}
