14:36:41.868 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":94,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":3,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cold morning with showers of rain &amp; sleet. Wind E by N. Dined at home. In the afternoon attended Mrs Deighton's funeral at Tynemouth</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":90,"lock":null}
