14:36:41.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":943,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":14,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day. Wind much the same. Again went &amp; fished in the Alm. Not such good sport. Returned to dinner found Mrs Forston of Alnwick there, who fed  with us. Got a letter from WBS.</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":895,"lock":null}
14:36:41.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/944
14:36:41.870 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":944,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up in the morning at 5 o'clock &amp; after having some bread &amp; milk, started on horseback to fish in Breamish, starting from the Powburn &amp; leaving off at Ingram, caught a dog trout but very small. Got home to dinner before 5 o'clock very tired</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":896,"lock":null}
