14:36:41.871 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":944,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Got up in the morning at 5 o'clock &amp; after having some bread &amp; milk, started on horseback to fish in Breamish, starting from the Powburn &amp; leaving off at Ingram, caught a dog trout but very small. Got home to dinner before 5 o'clock very tired</p>","pageId":819,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":896,"lock":null}
