14:36:41.877 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":960,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather. Wind about West. Icy cold having flown to the locns suffering some pain. Got Robert to sub the park with <span class=highlight_yellow>opadildoc</span>, took a <span class=highlight_yellow>scidlily</span> &amp; did not go to church. Wrote a long letter to ABP Emma G: came over to see us. Dined at home &amp; in the afternoon A Harry &amp; I walked up to North Sheilds to take wine</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":912,"lock":null}
