14:36:41.878 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":961,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning. Wind NSW Blowing hard. Sent my letter off to WBS. Gave a draft on estate then 4 on after  for &pound;50 for ABS. Crew also from &pound;10.10s + &pound;16.3.8 = 27.3.8 for av wages ...</p>","pageId":822,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":913,"lock":null}
14:36:41.878 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/962
14:36:41.878 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":962,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... Hope &amp; Liberal club. A Harry, A Nicholson &amp; Richardson NP took 1 o'clock dinner with me &amp; we afterwards crossed the water to South Shields Races, but it came on such a stormy afternoon we could not do the sport</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":914,"lock":null}
