14:36:41.879 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":962,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":5,"day":31,"sequence":2.0000,"text":"<p>... Hope &amp; Liberal club. A Harry, A Nicholson &amp; Richardson NP took 1 o'clock dinner with me &amp; we afterwards crossed the water to South Shields Races, but it came on such a stormy afternoon we could not do the sport</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":914,"lock":null}
14:36:41.879 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/963
14:36:41.879 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":963,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":1,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind blowing fresh at SW. A Harry, Nicholson took a walk around Tynmouth &amp; at 2 o'clock dined with I Richardson MP at 4 o'clock. We crossed the water to attend the races which were all won easy by chamber horses. Got home at 10 o'clock</p>","pageId":823,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":915,"lock":null}
14:36:41.879 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
