14:36:41.880 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/967
14:36:41.880 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":967,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind SE. Took a walk to Tynemouth With A Nicholson. Called upon Rve Clenton at the Mathew's Dined at home. In the evening at the Duke</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":919,"lock":null}
