14:36:41.881 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":967,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":5,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning Wind SE. Took a walk to Tynemouth With A Nicholson. Called upon Rve Clenton at the Mathew's Dined at home. In the evening at the Duke</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":919,"lock":null}
14:36:41.881 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/968
14:36:41.881 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":968,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another fine day Wind SE, Received a letter from ABS Went over the water to see I Salmon Returned to church. Dined at home &amp; took wine with A Harry &amp; went to Tynemouth in the evening to hear the band. A great many people there at night with Mr Jarvis Wrote to ABS</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":920,"lock":null}
