14:36:41.881 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/969
14:36:41.881 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":969,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull morning, cloudy &amp; appearance of rain. Wind NW Which we had during the morning, but it cleared up &amp; after dinner we had fine weather. Took a walk to Tynemouth. Drank tea at home &amp; in the evening at the Duke</p>","pageId":825,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":921,"lock":null}
