14:36:41.883 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":972,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":15,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull unpleasant morning Blowing fresh from the north with rain Which continued in torrents &amp; without ceasing the whole day &amp; a gale of wind. Dined at home &amp; in the evening at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":924,"lock":null}
14:36:41.883 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/973
14:36:41.883 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":973,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing a gale at about N by E It has never ceased raining since yesterday morning. Still coming down in torrents. I fear it will do great harm to the country. Turned out fair about the middle of the day, but still very cold &amp; stormy Dined at home. At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":925,"lock":null}
14:36:41.883 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
