14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":973,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":16,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy morning blowing a gale at about N by E It has never ceased raining since yesterday morning. Still coming down in torrents. I fear it will do great harm to the country. Turned out fair about the middle of the day, but still very cold &amp; stormy Dined at home. At the Duke of York in the evening</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":925,"lock":null}
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/974
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":974,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":17,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Fair weather after a great deal of rain in the night but still blowing hard at NE &amp; cold Received a letter &amp; notes from ABS. Took a walk around by Cullercoat Fields &amp; Tynemouth. Found Mrs Dixon at the house on my return. Dined at home &amp; in the evening again walked to Tynemouth. Finished at the Duke of York</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":926,"lock":null}
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
