14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":975,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":18,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Another wet morning Wind West. Walked to Tynemouth after breakfast &amp; saw the soldiers parading. Returned by the fields. Dined at home. Wrote to Fanny Smith that Emma would meet his at Morpeth on Thursday next. Paid monthly money for the Hope to do which I drew on Chapmans for &pound;20. Turned out a wet evening &amp; at bed time it was a deluge</p>","pageId":826,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":927,"lock":null}
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/976
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":976,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still showering. Wind NW. Paid Ned's mother yesterday a quarter wages &pound;1.13.9 &amp; lent Mary Carfs &pound;2. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him the last search account. Joined a party at Roddames &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":928,"lock":null}
14:36:41.884 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
