14:36:41.885 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":976,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":19,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>Finer weather but still showering. Wind NW. Paid Ned's mother yesterday a quarter wages &pound;1.13.9 &amp; lent Mary Carfs &pound;2. Dined at home. Wrote to WBS &amp; sent him the last search account. Joined a party at Roddames &amp; spent the evening</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":928,"lock":null}
14:36:41.885 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/977
14:36:41.885 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":977,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":20,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but still cloudy with the appearance of showers wind NNW.  Walked  to Tynemouth. Dined at home. Went to church in the afternoon. Drank tea with A Harry, again walked to Tynemouth to hear the band. A great many people there. Returned &amp; had a glass of whisky toddy with A Harry</p>","pageId":827,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":929,"lock":null}
14:36:41.885 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
