14:36:41.887 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/983
14:36:41.887 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":983,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":25,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Wind east blowing fresh. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. H Harry came in after dinner &amp; took wine with me &amp; he &amp; H French spent the evening supplied with beer with Mr Jervis</p>","pageId":828,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":934,"lock":null}
14:36:41.887 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
