14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":984,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":26,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A rainy morning and blowing fresh at SE with a heavy sea upon the bar. Took a short walk. Dined at home. A French gave me a bottle of wine at the George. An awfully heavy thunder storm with a deluge of rain which overflowed the streets in two or three minutes &amp; changed the wind to NW</p>","pageId":828,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":935,"lock":null}
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/985
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":985,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but the wind again from the SE. Took Jehy sec &amp; did not go to church. Dined at home. A French came &amp; took wine with me. In the <font color=#D9D9D9>[afternoon]</font> walked to Tynemouth, rather showery</p>","pageId":828,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":936,"lock":null}
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
