14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":985,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":27,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning but the wind again from the SE. Took Jehy sec &amp; did not go to church. Dined at home. A French came &amp; took wine with me. In the <font color=#D9D9D9>[afternoon]</font> walked to Tynemouth, rather showery</p>","pageId":828,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":936,"lock":null}
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/986
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":986,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":28,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull cloudy morning with appearance of rain. Wind SE. Received an account of the poor vicar's death at &frac14; past 8 o'clock on Saturday morning to the inexpressible sorrow of the a <span class=highlight_yellow>alecow</span>. All the ships be hoisted their colours half mast high. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined at home. In the afternoon a heavy thunder storm with showers at intervals. Went to see A Harry in the evening who has got a light attack of gout.</p>","pageId":829,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":937,"lock":null}
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
