14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/987
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":987,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":29,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A cloudy morning &amp; like more rain again blowing fresh at WNW. Received a letter from B B Gallbraith &amp; answered it. Dined at home. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening</p>","pageId":829,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":938,"lock":null}
14:36:41.889 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
