14:36:41.890 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/988
14:36:41.890 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":988,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":6,"day":30,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very fine morning something like summer weather at last. Wind WNW afterwards the heat brought is round to SE. Walked out to Whitley Park &amp; called upon I Wright &amp; returned by  Cullercoats to dinner.Webb came in &amp; took part of a bottle of port with me. Walked to Tynemouth in the evening. King William the 4th proclaimed at Newcastle today &amp; the guns fired at Tynemouth castle</p>","pageId":829,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":939,"lock":null}
