14:36:41.891 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":99,"version":0,"year":1828,"month":4,"day":2,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A very cold day with a little rain. Wind NNE. Dined on board the Hope. Had a very pleasant party.  J Tinley, H Harry &amp; Mr Marks. Received a letter from William</p>","pageId":693,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":94,"lock":null}
14:36:41.891 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
