14:36:41.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":994,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":6,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A dull calm morning. Wind SW. Went by coach to Newcastle. Received &pound;4.9.2 balance of premium out of Hope club. Saw the exhibition of paintings which was very good. Walked with D Dixon out to Beaton. Dined &amp; stayed all night</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":945,"lock":null}
14:36:41.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/995
14:36:41.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":995,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":7,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A stormy heavy thunder storm this morning. A deluge of rain. Wind SW &amp; afterwards NW. Set off after breakfast &amp; walked down to Shields between storms. After my arrival it commenced again &amp; continued the remainder of the day, heavy thunder &amp; rain. Dined at I Tealeys</p>","pageId":831,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":946,"lock":null}
14:36:41.893 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           Tree: null
