14:36:41.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":996,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":8,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine clear morning blowing fresh from W by N. Dined at home. Wrote to ABS &amp; sent him his inventory of <span class=highlight_yellow>fumition</span> &amp; by Mr Gosling who sets off for London in the morning. In the evening walked with H Harry to Tynemouth &amp; called in at the Duke of York on our way home</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":947,"lock":null}
14:36:41.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/997
14:36:41.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":997,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":9,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning. Rather cloudy &amp; not <span class=highlight_yellow>walike</span> showers. Wind E. Walked up to the point &amp; dined with Sadlar, spent a pleasant day &amp; got home late in the evening.</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":948,"lock":null}
