14:36:41.894 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":998,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Allen. Turned out a very rainy afternoon. At the Mr Estream in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":949,"lock":null}
