14:36:41.895 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -          value: {"id":998,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":10,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A beautiful morning. Wind WNW. Did not go to church. Walked to Tynemouth. Dined with Allen. Turned out a very rainy afternoon. At the Mr Estream in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":949,"lock":null}
14:36:41.895 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise - Difference detected on topic: diaries/fragments/999
14:36:41.895 [Test worker] INFO  com.rsmaxwell.diaries.responder.sync.Synchronise -           DB:   {"id":999,"version":0,"year":1830,"month":7,"day":11,"sequence":1.0000,"text":"<p>A fine morning after a heavy fall of rain during the night. Wind NW. Captain Webb &amp; I intended going out fishing but the clouds looked so threatening we thought it prudent to stay on shore. Went with the Teinleys to L Midney at Biddick, dined  &amp; walked home in the evening</p>","pageId":832,"type":"MARQUEE","imageId":null,"marqueeId":950,"lock":null}
